s_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran","id":67088644,"login":"yoesran","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MDg4NjQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/05d7ed30d0473693b1dc584663c87ee5a9cd94f4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T02:13:55Z","email":"naufalyoesran@gmail.com","name":"Naufal Yusran"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T02:13:55Z","email":"naufalyoesran@gmail.com","name":"Naufal Yusran"},"message":"feat(kopilima): client landing page for a real coffee chain — the concept is the clock\n\nSecond client piece, incubated in-repo like sukamotret: a one-page Bahasa-only\nsite for Kopi Lima (five branches, Balikpapan + Samarinda, three of them 24\njam, everything Rp15.000). The difference from sukamotret: the brand already\nexists — identity extracted from their live Instagram (ultramarine #3300f8,\namber checkers, \"Daily Cruisin''\") and followed, never invented.\n\nEverything renders from the visitor''s clock converted to WITA, zero API:\n\n- lib/jam.ts — pure clock math (open/closed across midnight, countdowns,\n  siang/malam fase); lib/fase-boot.ts stamps data-fase before first paint,\n  and the \"opens already lit\" test doubles as the boot-vs-jam drift guard\n- a pit-stop board grouped per city (cities never mix; geolocation refuses\n  to recommend when far from Kaltim), a vibe matcher with why-lines, an hour\n  scrubber that replays the board and relights the page (step=60 — 24 stops,\n  ranking reads the real clock so cards never re-sort under your finger)\n- a cup-pour menu (keyed remount + from{height:0}, no JS choreography;\n  shadcn Dialog detail on phones, sticky panel on desktop), a grid-based\n  table-preference denah (integer cells, no coordinate math), a draggable\n  SVG gerobak timeline (role=slider), an ephemeral struk cart (no storage,\n  no backend — the UI says so), and a 15k-flat borongan calculator; every\n  composed brief ends in WEB-5, the lead counter (IG DMs can''t be prefilled)\n\nTHE BLUE WALL: the page ground IS the brand ultramarine; every informational\nsurface is a cream paper sticker (.sticker re-declares the semantic tokens\nfor \"on paper\" — contrast measured, not eyeballed). One visual world, no\nlight/dark split; malam deepens the wall toward navy.\n\nEverything unconfirmed is dummy data behind a Draft banner — launch checklist\nin its README, the design system + gotchas in its CLAUDE.md. Deployed as a\ndraft at kopilima.pages.dev. Checks: tsc, eslint, prettier, 34/34 Playwright\n(chromium + Pixel 7).\n\nDocs: kopilima row + paragraph in overview (now four incubated products);\ndeployment.md counts the client sites; sukamotret-leftover comments cleaned\nand MenuCup memoized to match its documented scrub behaviour.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a03726b671a203b81667836377f061f87274e5da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/git/trees/a03726b671a203b81667836377f061f87274e5da"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/git/commits/05d7ed30d0473693b1dc584663c87ee5a9cd94f4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67088644?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran","id":67088644,"login":"yoesran","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MDg4NjQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commit/05d7ed30d0473693b1dc584663c87ee5a9cd94f4","node_id":"C_kwDOSg0xJdoAKDA1ZDdlZDMwZDA0NzM2OTNiMWRjNTg0NjYzYzg3ZWU1YTljZDk0ZjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commit/6ba43287a794a7b1d486c7b9a33e35db768b8618","sha":"6ba43287a794a7b1d486c7b9a33e35db768b8618","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/6ba43287a794a7b1d486c7b9a33e35db768b8618"}],"sha":"05d7ed30d0473693b1dc584663c87ee5a9cd94f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/05d7ed30d0473693b1dc584663c87ee5a9cd94f4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67088644?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran","id":67088644,"login":"yoesran","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MDg4NjQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/6ba43287a794a7b1d486c7b9a33e35db768b8618/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-12T07:22:02Z","email":"naufalyoesran@gmail.com","name":"Naufal Yusran"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-12T07:22:02Z","email":"naufalyoesran@gmail.com","name":"Naufal Yusran"},"message":"feat(sukamotret): client landing page for a real photo studio — the concept is light\n\nFirst client piece, incubated in-repo like the siblings: a one-page Bahasa-only\nsite for Sukamotret (Tabalong, South Kalimantan), built as freelance presence —\na live site for a real business with a measurable outcome.\n\nThe page is built around light, computed, not asserted:\n\n- lib/sun.ts — NOAA sunrise equation + SunCalc altitude, pure, zero-dependency,\n  cross-checking each other; the smoke suite asserts the invariants at runtime\n- a sky-arc \"cahaya hari ini\" card (golden hour as a picture, with a legend),\n  a day-scrubber that relights a canvas scene AND the whole page from real sun\n  altitude, a before/after photo editor (client-side only, nothing uploads),\n  a pictogram pose guide, and a session builder whose WhatsApp brief ends in\n  \"Dari website.\" — the lead-counting mechanism\n- lib/phase-boot.ts stamps data-phase before first paint (no accent flash);\n  the \"opens already lit\" test doubles as the boot-vs-sunPhase drift guard\n\nNext 16 static export + Tailwind v4 + shadcn (base-vega, nuansa''s setup), brand\ntokens mapped onto the semantic tokens. Everything is dummy data until the\nstudio confirms facts (deliberately fake WA number, visible Draft banner) —\nlaunch checklist in its README. Deployed as a draft at sukamotret.pages.dev.\nChecks: tsc, eslint, prettier, 28/28 Playwright (chromium + Pixel 7).\n\nDocs: sukamotret row + paragraph in overview; README gains the incubated-\nproducts note; stale \"three apps / Pages × 2\" counts fixed in the docs index,\ndeployment.md, and mf-platform.md.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d0037fd34e214eabc5e89522f9fd74f048a7d6a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/git/trees/d0037fd34e214eabc5e89522f9fd74f048a7d6a6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/git/commits/6ba43287a794a7b1d486c7b9a33e35db768b8618","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67088644?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran","id":67088644,"login":"yoesran","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MDg4NjQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commit/6ba43287a794a7b1d486c7b9a33e35db768b8618","node_id":"C_kwDOSg0xJdoAKDZiYTQzMjg3YTc5NGE3YjFkNDg2YzdiOWEzM2UzNWRiNzY4Yjg2MTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commit/108a69bb06da773fabefe2a7f9c6bdf1b2fd9341","sha":"108a69bb06da773fabefe2a7f9c6bdf1b2fd9341","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/108a69bb06da773fabefe2a7f9c6bdf1b2fd9341"}],"sha":"6ba43287a794a7b1d486c7b9a33e35db768b8618","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/6ba43287a794a7b1d486c7b9a33e35db768b8618"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67088644?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran","id":67088644,"login":"yoesran","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MDg4NjQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/108a69bb06da773fabefe2a7f9c6bdf1b2fd9341/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T09:24:11Z","email":"naufalyoesran@gmail.com","name":"Naufal Yusran"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T09:24:11Z","email":"naufalyoesran@gmail.com","name":"Naufal Yusran"},"message":"feat: rework the career record — eDOT out, doubler split, infosys promoted\n\nThe experience data now matches the real employment history, and the `// ask`\nassistant no longer contradicts it.\n\n- host: `ExperienceSlug` gains `freelance` — the 2024–25 Doubler freelance ran\n  alongside Infosys then Danamon, so it sits on the lane-1 branch, while\n  `doubler` keeps the 2023–24 contract on the main rail (his only job then).\n  Infosys Solusi Terpadu becomes a first-class node (LOS for SMI, Next + MUI +\n  Syncfusion); `ExperienceEntry.url` is optional because its domain isn''t known.\n- blog: DBS entry rewritten around the regional MF-platform migration and the\n  two integrations he owned. eDOT is omitted everywhere — it overlapped Ajaib\n  and DBS, and DBS forbids concurrent employment; omission was the honest fix.\n\nFixes the assistant bugs that split introduced or exposed:\n\n- one company held two entries, so \"tell me about doubler\" resolved to two jobs\n  and answered `compare` — Doubler Studio vs Doubler Studio. Entity extraction\n  now keeps the newest entry per company.\n- the company count read `jobs.length`: it double-counted Doubler and silently\n  dropped the three earlier roles. Now distinct companies + earlier (6 → 8).\n- `EARLIER_COMPANIES` was a hand-copy that still listed Infosys after its\n  promotion; it derives from `EARLIER_KEYS` now, so it can''t drift again.\n- an earlier-role name only tied the \"tell\"+\"about\" keywords, so \"tell me about\n  ehealth\" answered with the generic bio. It takes the same boost as any company.\n- Material UI, Syncfusion, Nunjucks and Gulp had no query vocabulary, so the bot\n  fell through to \"I''m not sure\" on tech its own CV bullets name.\n- \"SaaS\" left with eDOT; the industries are banking, fintech, IT services, agency.\n\nAlso: `writing-with-mdx` was a live template post whose first line read \"replace\nit with the real first one\" — indexed, and its body fed the assistant. Rewritten\nas a real post on publishing a bilingual blog from a static export, the claim\nverified by building with a body missing (tsc passes; prerender dies).\n\nDocs: nuansa added to the project table, \"first post pending\" corrected.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ea04ad2763a8805cf68ac5248d01028125bc553f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/git/trees/ea04ad2763a8805cf68ac5248d01028125bc553f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/git/commits/108a69bb06da773fabefe2a7f9c6bdf1b2fd9341","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67088644?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran","id":67088644,"login":"yoesran","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MDg4NjQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commit/108a69bb06da773fabefe2a7f9c6bdf1b2fd9341","node_id":"C_kwDOSg0xJdoAKDEwOGE2OWJiMDZkYTc3M2ZhYmVmZTJhN2Y5YzZiZGYxYjJmZDkzNDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commit/eb2fe7076cd4e39304950ce66dd1d721c3917bfa","sha":"eb2fe7076cd4e39304950ce66dd1d721c3917bfa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/eb2fe7076cd4e39304950ce66dd1d721c3917bfa"}],"sha":"108a69bb06da773fabefe2a7f9c6bdf1b2fd9341","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/108a69bb06da773fabefe2a7f9c6bdf1b2fd9341"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67088644?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran","id":67088644,"login":"yoesran","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MDg4NjQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/eb2fe7076cd4e39304950ce66dd1d721c3917bfa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T02:47:46Z","email":"naufalyoesran@gmail.com","name":"Naufal Yusran"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T02:47:46Z","email":"naufalyoesran@gmail.com","name":"Naufal Yusran"},"message":"feat(nuansa): sections + shells platform for info-display microsites\n\nA template-as-code platform for the sites that exist only to display a\nclient''s information — invitations first, linktrees/menus/guides later.\nDevelopers author sections (a Zod-backed contract, no styling) and shells (a\nvisual identity plus one renderer per section); a template is just a preset —\na shell and a default section order. The editor generates each section''s form\nfrom its contract and lets an operator reorder, toggle, add and remove\nsections beside a live preview of the real shell. Renderers live in the shell,\nso two shells present the same content as genuinely different designs.\n\n- lib/fields.ts — field vocabulary + form generator (contract → form + type)\n- sections/ — 9 invitation sections, contracts only\n- shells/kupu (paged tabs, inline-SVG ornament) + shells/alur (vertical scroll)\n- lib/site.ts — the one module joining a shell to the sections it can render\n- display-only v1; Supabase persistence + widgets (RSVP) come next\n\nArchitecture, decisions, and open questions in SPEC.md.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d32b69a75eb74b3a129d938ccdf2f78ba067f95f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/git/trees/d32b69a75eb74b3a129d938ccdf2f78ba067f95f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/git/commits/eb2fe7076cd4e39304950ce66dd1d721c3917bfa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67088644?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran","id":67088644,"login":"yoesran","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MDg4NjQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commit/eb2fe7076cd4e39304950ce66dd1d721c3917bfa","node_id":"C_kwDOSg0xJdoAKGViMmZlNzA3NmNkNGUzOTMwNDk1MGNlNjZkZDFkNzIxYzM5MTdiZmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commit/33cede39e3a7194c8cc0756232761e1407b7461c","sha":"33cede39e3a7194c8cc0756232761e1407b7461c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/33cede39e3a7194c8cc0756232761e1407b7461c"}],"sha":"eb2fe7076cd4e39304950ce66dd1d721c3917bfa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/eb2fe7076cd4e39304950ce66dd1d721c3917bfa"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67088644?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran","id":67088644,"login":"yoesran","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MDg4NjQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/33cede39e3a7194c8cc0756232761e1407b7461c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-07T06:49:42Z","email":"naufalyoesran@gmail.com","name":"Naufal Yusran"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-07T06:49:42Z","email":"naufalyoesran@gmail.com","name":"Naufal Yusran"},"message":"fix(badriyatim-family): A++ text-size coherence + external seed tooling\n\nThe A/A+/A++ control scaled every letter except the app''s centerpiece — and\nthe deep-check found the member count had silently drifted.\n\n- silsilah canvas: default zoom now multiplies by the text-size factor\n  (html font ÷ 17px base, captured in the existing ResizeObserver — the\n  rem-based canvas resizes on a size switch, so no extra listener); at A++\n  node labels are finally readable. Canvas capped at max-h-[75svh] so the\n  A++ height (~780px) no longer pushes the tree below a phone''s fold.\n  Regression test added (suite now 25).\n- struktur (mobile): edge-fade gradients signal that the clipped org chart\n  scrolls sideways — worst at A++, where a two-card row outgrows any phone.\n- beranda: stat-pill separator dots are desktop-only; they orphaned at line\n  ends whenever the pill wrapped.\n- seed tooling: the PII seed now lives OUTSIDE the repo (repo going public);\n  `npm run build-public` (scripts/build-public.mjs) regenerates\n  data/public.json from it — copies the public sections, reduces member\n  records to a bare count, refuses to write if records leak. First run\n  reproduced the old file byte-for-byte except anggotaCount 91 -> 92 (the\n  seed had gained a member). CLAUDE.md/README/overview reworded for the\n  external-seed reality; .gitignore entry stays as a tripwire.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9c299bb2aa4e3eb30e72c8d5e8adb82300ce7aef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/git/trees/9c299bb2aa4e3eb30e72c8d5e8adb82300ce7aef"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/git/commits/33cede39e3a7194c8cc0756232761e1407b7461c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67088644?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran","id":67088644,"login":"yoesran","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MDg4NjQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commit/33cede39e3a7194c8cc0756232761e1407b7461c","node_id":"C_kwDOSg0xJdoAKDMzY2VkZTM5ZTNhNzE5NGM4Y2MwNzU2MjMyNzYxZTE0MDdiNzQ2MWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commit/b645dd9c0e572e8709e9221ecf13ddfd01f15cff","sha":"b645dd9c0e572e8709e9221ecf13ddfd01f15cff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/b645dd9c0e572e8709e9221ecf13ddfd01f15cff"}],"sha":"33cede39e3a7194c8cc0756232761e1407b7461c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/33cede39e3a7194c8cc0756232761e1407b7461c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67088644?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran","id":67088644,"login":"yoesran","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MDg4NjQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/b645dd9c0e572e8709e9221ecf13ddfd01f15cff/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-07T02:01:55Z","email":"naufalyoesran@gmail.com","name":"Naufal Yusran"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-07T02:01:55Z","email":"naufalyoesran@gmail.com","name":"Naufal Yusran"},"message":"perf: first paint — runtime-register the lab remote + modulepreload the boot chain\n\nDeployed FCP was ~4.4s (local: 3.9s, or a 3s stall with the lab down): the MF\nbootstrap fetched the lab''s cross-origin remoteEntry.js before main.tsx ran,\nand the bootstrap itself is ~12 serial virtual-module round trips that Vite''s\nmodulepreload emission can''t see through. After: host paints ~1s after HTML\n(lab ~0.8s deployed); zero lab requests before first paint.\n\n- host: no build-config `remotes` — lab registered at runtime on first use\n  (src/lib/lab-remote.ts ensureLabRemote; callers LiveRemoteBlock +\n  PresenceOverlay); LAB_URL single-sourced from there (Experience/Quality\n  blocks now import it)\n- host + lab: `preload-critical` vite plugin injects modulepreload for the\n  whole boot graph + a preload for the latin Inter woff2\n- types: @mf-types (downloaded, gitignored, now unrefreshable) replaced by a\n  hand-written contract at src/types/lab.d.ts — fresh clones type-check with\n  the lab never running; tsconfig paths/include cleaned up\n- blog: scripts/knowledge.ts writes only on real content change (CRLF-\n  normalized, timestamp-stripped compare) — builds no longer dirty the two\n  tracked knowledge.json copies\n- docs synced: mf-core §4/§5 (runtime registration, hand-written types),\n  mf-platform initial-load (measured numbers), gotchas #11 follow-up,\n  running-locally fresh-clone, deployment URL wiring, overview file tables\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0423d1a3b2bc0679b8afdefb7b84d94753de6570","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/git/trees/0423d1a3b2bc0679b8afdefb7b8