"html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran","id":67088644,"login":"yoesran","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MDg4NjQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/8e973ab056cf61cc6e9f55dfdaadf9592319c9d2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-06T08:02:28Z","email":"naufalyoesran@gmail.com","name":"Naufal Yusran"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T08:02:28Z","email":"naufalyoesran@gmail.com","name":"Naufal Yusran"},"message":"feat(badriyatim-family): public site + invite-only auth slice (wip)\n\n- P1 public pages (beranda/silsilah/struktur/tentang), Songket & Rumah\n  Gadang design system, Bahasa-only by design\n- silsilah canvas: radial/linear/daftar views; tap (pointer-capture-safe),\n  pan, pinch, Ctrl+gulir zoom; SSR-deterministic layout (rounded trig)\n- P2 auth: Supabase magic link (invite-only), proxy.ts gates /keluarga,\n  expired-link message on /login\n- quality: playwright smoke suite (23 tests, desktop+mobile), prettier,\n  react compiler, 44px touch targets, a11y (skip link, focus, reduced\n  motion, daftar fallback for the canvas)\n- privacy: public bundle imports data/public.json only; PII seed\n  data/family.json stays local/gitignored (goes straight into Supabase),\n  verified by build-output grep\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b18202d8ea50f82af9e0b147c8e6ffd89ddc9ea1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/git/trees/b18202d8ea50f82af9e0b147c8e6ffd89ddc9ea1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesra