naufalyoesran@gmail.com","name":"Naufal Yusran"},"message":"feat(host): surface the whole workspace in the quality dashboard\n\nThe `// quality` cell showed only the host''s own Vitest + Playwright. Now it\nalso renders a card per sibling project''s Vitest (naufal-lab, naufal-blog,\nnaufal-party) — the same SuiteCard as the host''s, each linking to that\nproject''s own published HTML report.\n\n- reports.mjs runs each sibling''s Vitest from its own folder (HTML + JSON\n  reporters), publishes its report to .reports/<project>/, and adds a\n  workspace[] array (each entry carrying its report path) to health.json.\n- @vitest/ui added to the three projects (dev-only) for the HTML reporter.\n- SuiteCard''s report link is now optional and carries a distinct aria-label,\n  so the workspace \"open report\" links don''t collide with the host''s two\n  (gotcha #34).\n- i18n: quality.workspaceTitle + a refreshed description (en + id).\n- docs + the published reports landing page list the new per-project reports.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2ef40f9b02593146fdbc197650f1b61e499323d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/git/trees/2ef40f9b02593146fdbc197650f1b61e499323d6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/git/commits/8255082363c8635f056cf7925cf20378e77c6b35","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67088644?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran","id":67088644,"login":"yoesran","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MDg4NjQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commit/8255082363c8635f056cf7925cf20378e77c6b35","node_id":"C_kwDOSg0xJdoAKDgyNTUwODIzNjNjODYzNWYwNTZjZjc5MjVjZjIwMzc4ZTc3YzZiMzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commit/86a4bb9a9d98b613e5a56466422f97586b4a2255","sha":"86a4bb9a9d98b613e5a56466422f97586b4a2255","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/86a4bb9a9d98b613e5a56466422f97586b4a2255"}],"sha":"8255082363c8635f056cf7925cf20378e77c6b35","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/8255082363c8635f056cf7925cf20378e77c6b35"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67088644?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran","id":67088644,"login":"yoesran","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MDg4NjQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/86a4bb9a9d98b613e5a56466422f97586b4a2255/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-16T10:00:47Z","email":"naufalyoesran@gmail.com","name":"Naufal Yusran"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-16T10:00:47Z","email":"naufalyoesran@gmail.com","name":"Naufal Yusran"},"message":"chore: review sweep — tests, per-post SEO, theme-color, env unify, cleanups\n\nA multi-pass review-and-improve sweep across all four projects. No behavioural\nchanges to the federated runtime; the host and blog gain real fixes, the others\ngain test coverage.\n\nTests (Vitest) — extend coverage beyond the host:\n- party: export the cursor server''s pure helpers + extract `downsample`, then\n  assert them (colour determinism, ghost shape/bounds, downsample window). The\n  test file isn''t imported by the entry, so it stays out of the deploy bundle.\n- blog: cover the SEO/i18n lib — post registry (locale parity, slugs, ISO\n  dates), hreflang `alternates`, sitemap shape (Vitest node env, `@` alias).\n- lab: cover the framework-agnostic mount contract (mountSpringToy renders +\n  cleanup empties target, context defaulting) and the i18n formatter, under\n  Vitest + jsdom (setup stubs ResizeObserver/matchMedia). vitest.config.ts\n  wired into tsconfig.node.json for typecheck coverage.\n\nfeat(blog): per-post OpenGraph/Twitter + BlogPosting JSON-LD on the post page,\nso a shared link shows the post''s own card (type: article) instead of inheriting\nthe site-level one (Next merges metadata shallowly).\n\nfeat(host): theme-color follows the resolved surface — a single dynamic meta,\nupdated by the pre-paint script (first paint) and theme.ts apply() (on change),\nso the browser chrome matches the chosen surface + mode, not just the OS pref.\n\nchore: unify the blog env convention with the host — commit .env.production\n(public NEXT_PUBLIC_* values), gitignore only *.local, drop .env.example.\nCleanups: remove the unreferenced public/icons.svg, key the header nav by href,\nname the experience reflog ring constants.\n\ndocs: document the per-project test suites; update the blog env convention.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"eec5a0c8033b445bf9e064f45966372756b7fe3a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/git/trees/eec5a0c8033b445bf9e064f45966372756b7fe3a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/git/commits/86a4bb9a9d98b613e5a56466422f97586b4a2255","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67088644?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran","id":67088644,"login":"yoesran","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MDg4NjQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commit/86a4bb9a9d98b613e5a56466422f97586b4a2255","node_id":"C_kwDOSg0xJdoAKDg2YTRiYjlhOWQ5OGI2MTNlNWE1NjQ2NjQyMmY5NzU4NmI0YTIyNTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commit/361ba2812d5c875fdb9448d88ac48dcdccc9425a","sha":"361ba2812d5c875fdb9448d88ac48dcdccc9425a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/361ba2812d5c875fdb9448d88ac48dcdccc9425a"}],"sha":"86a4bb9a9d98b613e5a56466422f97586b4a2255","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/86a4bb9a9d98b613e5a56466422f97586b4a2255"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67088644?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran","id":67088644,"login":"yoesran","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MDg4NjQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/361ba2812d5c875fdb9448d88ac48dcdccc9425a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-16T05:41:12Z","email":"naufalyoesran@gmail.com","name":"Naufal Yusran"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-16T05:41:12Z","email":"naufalyoesran@gmail.com","name":"Naufal Yusran"},"message":"feat(host): quality dashboard — published Vitest + Playwright reports\n\nA `// quality` block surfaces the host''s own test suites as real, openable\nreports:\n\n- Vitest unit tests (src/lib/quality) + React Testing Library component\n  tests (src/components/blocks/*.test.tsx), jsdom; a standalone\n  vitest.config + setup, wired into the tsconfigs so they''re type-checked.\n- Playwright e2e gains video + full trace behind a PW_MEDIA flag.\n- scripts/reports.mjs runs both with their HTML reporters and assembles\n  .reports/ (vitest/, playwright/, health.json, a noindex+CORS _headers,\n  a landing page); npm run reports[:deploy] publishes to\n  naufal-reports.pages.dev.\n- The block reads the summary via VITE_REPORTS_URL (dev: the /health.json\n  seed) and links each suite to its full HTML report — Playwright with video.\n\nExports oneOf/loadRadius from theme.ts so the unit suite asserts the real\nvalidation logic. Docs updated (deployment Quality dashboard, running-locally,\noverview, handoff, gotchas #32-34); i18n EN/ID.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"83372884fffac3fc9a08898c1cb245392de23143","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/git/trees/83372884fffac3fc9a08898c1cb245392de23143"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/git/commits/361ba2812d5c875fdb9448d88ac48dcdccc9425a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67088644?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran","id":67088644,"login":"yoesran","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MDg4NjQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commit/361ba2812d5c875fdb9448d88ac48dcdccc9425a","node_id":"C_kwDO