3M2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commit/4a577126bc96a5f6aa446a46d35df78f60c548ad","sha":"4a577126bc96a5f6aa446a46d35df78f60c548ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/4a577126bc96a5f6aa446a46d35df78f60c548ad"}],"sha":"f5bd12be2b9d837bcb8c40b1efda4bb51c4e173e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/f5bd12be2b9d837bcb8c40b1efda4bb51c4e173e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67088644?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran","id":67088644,"login":"yoesran","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MDg4NjQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/4a577126bc96a5f6aa446a46d35df78f60c548ad/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-14T09:26:22Z","email":"naufalyoesran@gmail.com","name":"Naufal Yusran"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-14T09:26:22Z","email":"naufalyoesran@gmail.com","name":"Naufal Yusran"},"message":"chore(host): type-check the Playwright config + tests\n\n`playwright.config.ts` and `tests/` were in no tsconfig `include`, so `tsc -b`\nsilently skipped them — a passing build gave false confidence while the editor\nflagged a real error. Add them to `tsconfig.node.json` (the non-app, Node-context\nproject, alongside `vite.config.ts`) so `npm run build` type-checks them too.\n\nBuild-config only; no runtime change. Verified the other three projects type-check\nevery TS file (lab covers vite.config via its node config, blog uses a **/*.ts\nglob, party''s everything is under src/).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a6fff22d96d849d9c59071209defaa1c7cfd348e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/git/trees/a6fff22d96d849d9c59071209defaa1c7cfd348e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/git/commits/4a577126bc96a5f6aa446a46d35df78f60c548ad","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67088644?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran","id":67088644,"login":"yoesran","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MDg4NjQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commit/4a577126bc96a5f6aa446a46d35df78f60c548ad","node_id":"C_kwDOSg0xJdoAKDRhNTc3MTI2YmM5NmE1ZjZhYTQ0NmE0NmQzNWRmNzhmNjBjNTQ4YWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commit/4ccc2b387c10ff2e410873c915552f8e711a818e","sha":"4ccc2b387c10ff2e410873c915552f8e711a818e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/4ccc2b387c10ff2e410873c915552f8e711a818e"}],"sha":"4a577126bc96a5f6aa446a46d35df78f60c548ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/4a577126bc96a5f6aa446a46d35df78f60c548ad"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67088644?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran","id":67088644,"login":"yoesran","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MDg4NjQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/4ccc2b387c10ff2e410873c915552f8e711a818e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-14T09:04:23Z","email":"naufalyoesran@gmail.com","name":"Naufal Yusran"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-14T09:04:23Z","email":"naufalyoesran@gmail.com","name":"Naufal Yusran"},"message":"feat: presence echoes, smoke suite, a11y + cross-site polish\n\nPresence \"echoes\" — the room remembers recent visitors (naufal-party + the\nSvelte Presence remote). The server records each visitor''s cursor path and, on\nleave, stores it as an anonymous ghost (colour + name + normalized path, no PII)\nin a capped ring buffer, seeded with a few synthetic drifts. Every connection\ngets the set; a client that''s alone replays them as translucent, \"echo\"-tagged\ncursors — so a solo visitor never sees an empty multiplayer room, and they never\npretend to be live. Auto-playing, so it respects prefers-reduced-motion. Solves\nthe empty-room problem the demo had for its exact audience (a lone recruiter).\n\nHost Playwright smoke suite (naufal-host/tests/smoke.spec.ts, `npm run test:e2e`)\n— home render, skip link, canvas toggle, locale switch, theme persistence, and\nthe live-remote offline fallback. Host-focused (boots only the host dev server),\nself-contained and stable. It caught an a11y bug on its first run: the hero\n<h1>''s per-letter cursor-repel spans mangled its accessible name — fixed with\naria-label + aria-hidden (gotchas #31).\n\nSkip-to-content links on the host (-> main#work) and every blog page (-> #content),\ni18n''d EN/ID, focus-moving.\n\nCross-site polish: GitHub link -> github.com/yoesran; the host''s blog links drop\nthe /locale prefix (the blog edge-redirects bare paths) + a /work/* redirect rule\nfor the upcoming experience stories; and the blog header gains a \"portfolio\" link\nback to the host (desktop nav + mobile drawer).\n\ndocs: echoes documented (features/overview/handoff/gotchas), a Testing section,\nand stale open-items marked done.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"535c2a96db36c1db2c3bd28d5984bd95731a300c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/git/trees/535c2a96db36c1db2c3bd28d5984bd95731a300c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/git/commits/4ccc2b387c10ff2e410873c915552f8e711a818e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67088644?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran","id":67088644,"login":"yoesran","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MDg4NjQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commit/4ccc2b387c10ff2e410873c915552f8e711a818e","node_id":"C_kwDOSg0xJdoAKDRjY2MyYjM4N2MxMGZmMmU0MTA4NzNjOTE1NTUyZjhlNzExYTgxOGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commit/b394fc2a50b9553c197b70abdc92c078d8657cee","sha":"b394fc2a50b9553c197b70abdc92c078d8657cee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/b394fc2a50b9553c197b70abdc92c078d8657cee"}],"sha":"4ccc2b387c10ff2e410873c915552f8e711a818e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/4ccc2b387c10ff2e410873c915552f8e711a818e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67088644?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran","id":67088644,"login":"yoesran","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MDg4NjQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/b394fc2a50b9553c197b70abdc92c078d8657cee/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-13T13:56:30Z","email":"naufalyoesran@gmail.com","name":"Naufal Yusran"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-13T13:56:30Z","email":"naufalyoesran@gmail.com","name":"Naufal Yusran"},"message":"feat(host): canvas view — a Figma-mode of the home page\n\nA header toggle (frame icon) flips the home page from the normal scrolling\n\"play\" view into a Figma-like zoom/pan canvas: the site is the central artboard,\nand the margins hold annotations that explain the interactions play mode keeps\nquiet (the hero repel, the orbit, the live federation, the git terminal) plus an\narchitecture note. Opt-in and lazy-split, so play mode never ships it. It''s\ndeliberately host presentation chrome — it presents the architecture and\nsurfaces the easy-to-miss interactions, but doesn''t cross the host↔remote\nboundary (variety, not an MF demo).\n\n- canvas store (toggleStore-backed) + header toggle + lazy CanvasStage around\n  the same block `body` as play mode (one source for the blocks).\n- useCanvas: one transform; mouse/touchpad click-drag pans (except on controls),\n  wheel/two-finger scroll zooms toward the cursor; touch one-finger pans (tap-slop\n  so taps still click) and two-finger pinch-zooms. Works on every device.\n- CanvasStage: artboard layout, ResizeObserver-measured leader-line callouts\n  (data-driven registry keyed to each block''s Cell id — which double as deep-link\n  anchors), architecture note, zoom controls, fit-to-width.\n- useInView is canvas-aware (reveal all on the transformed plane, where\n  IntersectionObserver is unreliable).\n\nlab: fix the SpringToy grab point under a CSS transform — map screen→local\npointer coords by dividing by the rendered scale (1 in normal/standalone use).\n\nrefactor: extract createToggleStore() / useToggle() — presence.ts and canvas.ts\nwere structural duplicates; theme.ts stays separate (multi-axis config).\n\ndocs: features.md (canvas section), overview.md (file table), gotchas.md #30\n(the two CSS-transform traps), handoff.md (decision note).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"152bb9c408bd1ad898b8e4598c89add9942a3959","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/git/trees/152bb9c408bd1ad898b8e4598c89add9942a3959"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/git/commits/b394fc2a50b9553c197b70abdc92c078d8657cee","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67088644?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran","id":67088644,"login":"yoesran","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MDg4NjQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commit/b394fc2a50b9553c197b70abdc92c078d8657cee","node_id":"C_kwDOSg0xJdoAKGIzOTRmYzJhNTBiOTU1M2MxOTdiNzBhYmRjOTJjMDc4ZDg2NTdjZWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commit/53657af2967aab4182f044be3421b2e53dd5c361","sha":"53657af2967aab4182f044be3421b2e53dd5c361","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/53657af2967aab4182f044be3421b2e53dd5c361"}],"sha":"b394fc2a50b9553c197b70abdc92c078d8657cee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/b394fc2a50b9553c197b70abdc92c078d8657cee"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67088644?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran","id":67088644,"login":"yoesran","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MDg4NjQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/53657af2967aab4182f044be3421b2e53dd5c361/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-13T08:59:11Z","email":"naufalyoesran@gmail.com","name":"Naufal Yusran"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-13T08:59:11Z","email":"naufalyoesran@gmail.com","name":"Naufal Yusran"},"message":"chore: post-launch cleanup — measured-height hook, env-driven URLs, party tooling, tunnel removal\n\nInternal cleanups + coherence fixes on top of the shipped build (99acfce). No\nuser-facing behaviour change beyond the SEO additions.\n\nRefactor\n- host: extract `useMeasuredHeight()` — the ResizeObserver→height panel\n  boilerplate, deduped across the Experience / LiveRemote / TechStack blocks\n  (one hook + three call sites, identical runtime output).\n\nCoherence & SEO\n- party: bring `naufal-party` under the repo''s format/type discipline — its own\n  `.prettierrc` + `format`/`format:check`/`check` scripts; `server.ts` reformatted\n  to the no-semi / single-quote style (the one project that was outside the net).\n- blog: `SITE_URL` is env-driven (`NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL`), mirroring the host.\n- blog: add an `x-default` hreflang to `sitemap.ts` + `alternates.ts`.\n- both: the cross-site links are env-driven too — host `BLOG_URL` via\n  `VITE_BLOG_URL`, blog `HOST_URL` centralized in `lib/site.ts` via\n  `NEXT_PUBLIC_HOST_URL` — so the custom-domain switch is pure env on both sides.\n- blog: drop the literal `pages.dev` URL from the en/id meta descriptions.\n\nEnv / tooling cleanup\n- host: remove the `dev:tunnel` mode + its env files, and the redundant\n  `.env.local`/example (`VITE_LAB_URL`/`VITE_PARTY_HOST` already default to\n  `127.0.0.1` in code). Direct deploy supersedes tunnel previews.\n\nDocs\n- deployment.md documents all four URL env vars + the analytics/canonical setup;\n  overview / mf-platform / running-locally / gotchas synced to the new env\n  behaviour (no `.env.local` required; party now formatted).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4c9b563a8d34595ca2841d7e529b209caf48323e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/git/trees/4c9b563a8d34595ca2841d7e529b209caf48323e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/git/commits/53657af2967aab4182f044be3421b2e53dd5c361","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67088644?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran","id":67088644,"login":"yoesran","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MDg4NjQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commit/53657af2967aab4182f044be3421b2e53dd5c361","node_id":"C_kwDOSg0xJdoAKDUzNjU3YWYyOTY3YWFiNDE4MmYwNDRiZTM0MjFiMmU1M2RkNWMzNjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commit/99acfce8bbe2b6d4f6982208ec3c87db618ae4c7","sha":"99acfce8bbe2b6d4f6982208ec3c87db618ae4c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/99acfce8bbe2b6d4f6982208ec3c87db618ae4c7"}],"sha":"53657af2967aab4182f044be3421b2e53dd5c361","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/53657af2967aab4182f044be3421b2e53dd5c361"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67088644?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran","id":67088644,"login":"yoesran","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MDg4NjQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/99acfce8bbe2b6d4f6982208ec3c87db618ae4c7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-13T07:49:48Z","email":"naufalyoesran@gmail.com","name":"Naufal Yusran"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-13T07:49:48Z","email":"naufalyoesran@gmail.com","name":"Naufal Yusran"},"message":"feat: visitor reach + feedback — analytics, blog locale detection, uptime monitor\n\nImprovements on top of an already-shipped build (no open-backlog items touched):\n\n- analytics: env-gated Cloudflare Web Analytics beacon on host (vite\n  transformIndexHtml plugin) and blog (next/script in root layout). Injected\n  only when a token is set, so dev and forks ship no beacon. Privacy-first\n  (no cookies → no consent banner). Tokens are tracked as an open issue.\n- host: env-driven canonical share URL — index.html ships a __SITE_URL__\n  placeholder filled from VITE_SITE_URL, dropping the hardcoded pages.dev origin\n  from the OG/Twitter tags (one-line flip when the custom domain lands).\n- blog: the apex / now detects navigator.languages and routes to /en or /id\n  (noscript meta-refresh falls back to the default); the / edge rule is removed\n  from _redirects so the client stub can run. Section paths still edge-redirect.\n- host: the experience terminal prompt reads as a clickable input (dashed box,\n  hover state, Terminal \"type\" cue) so the mini-shell is actually discoverable.\n- ops: a read-only uptime monitor GitHub Action pings the live origins on a\n  schedule and fails (emails) if any is down — not deploy CI.\n- docs: overview.md designated the single source of truth for live status;\n  handoff roadmap condensed to the decision-level arc; deployment.md gains an\n  Analytics section; gotchas #25 + overview/deployment apex behavior brought\n  back in sync; CF-token wiring added to the open-issues list.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5e3c40516d8ccbe82543ca8e12eaa87f5b141ebf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/git/trees/5e3c40516d8ccbe82543ca8e12eaa87f5b141ebf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/git/commits/99acfce8bbe2b6d4f6982208ec3c87db618ae4c7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67088644?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran","id":67088644,"login":"yoesran","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MDg4NjQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commit/99acfce8bbe2b6d4f6982208ec3c87db618ae4c7","node_id":"C_kwDOSg0xJdoAKDk5YWNmY2U4YmJlMmI2ZDRmNjk4MjIwOGVjM2M4N2RiNjE4YWU0Yzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commit/da2794a1ef22e3cf0f15073d04730b29db02cb87","sha":"da2794a1ef22e3cf0f15073d