026-06-09T13:40:54Z","email":"naufalyoesran@gmail.com","name":"Naufal Yusran"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-09T13:40:54Z","email":"naufalyoesran@gmail.com","name":"Naufal Yusran"},"message":"fix(lab): guard Presence websocket message parse\n\nWrap the PartySocket message JSON.parse in try/catch with an early\nreturn, matching the party server''s posture. A malformed frame is now\ndropped instead of throwing inside the message listener.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8a07ccdfff4207942bada51db3ae54152ddc4b5a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/git/trees/8a07ccdfff4207942bada51db3ae54152ddc4b5a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/git/commits/92ad7ffb8637807324181fca581b97602925c0a9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67088644?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran","id":67088644,"login":"yoesran","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MDg4NjQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commit/92ad7ffb8637807324181fca581b97602925c0a9","node_id":"C_kwDOSg0xJdoAKDkyYWQ3ZmZiODYzNzgwNzMyNDE4MWZjYTU4MWI5NzYwMjkyNWMwYTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commit/d407f489aa9ed41e0a7d757413e639fabf2eacb0","sha":"d407f489aa9ed41e0a7d757413e639fabf2eacb0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/d407f489aa9ed41e0a7d757413e639fabf2eacb0"}],"sha":"92ad7ffb8637807324181fca581b97602925c0a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/92ad7ffb8637807324181fca581b97602925c0a9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67088644?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran","id":67088644,"login":"yoesran","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MDg4NjQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/d407f489aa9ed41e0a7d757413e639fabf2eacb0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-09T13:40:40Z","email":"naufalyoesran@gmail.com","name":"Naufal Yusran"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-09T13:40:40Z","email":"naufalyoesran@gmail.com","name":"Naufal Yusran"},"message":"chore: wire prettier across projects and format sources\n\nAdd a format/format:check script pair to naufal-host, naufal-lab, and\nnaufal-blog, and bring prettier (+ tailwindcss and sort-imports plugins)\nto the blog, which previously had none. Set endOfLine: \"auto\" in every\n.prettierrc so prettier respects the repo''s CRLF working tree\n(core.autocrlf=true, no .gitattributes) instead of flagging every file\non line endings alone.\n\nThen format all sources to the shared style (single quotes, no semicolons,\nsorted imports, tailwind class ordering). Mechanical only — no behavior\nchange; tsc/svelte-check/eslint and production builds stay green across\nall four projects.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"31fc70a931c29732ccd57bd855801e0b98039e46","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/git/trees/31fc70a931c29732ccd57bd855801e0b98039e46"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/git/commits/d407f489aa9ed41e0a7d757413e639fabf2eacb0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67088644?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran","id":67088644,"login":"yoesran","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MDg4NjQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commit/d407f489aa9ed41e0a7d757413e639fabf2eacb0","node_id":"C_kwDOSg0xJdoAKGQ0MDdmNDg5YWE5ZWQ0MWUwYTdkNzU3NDEzZTYzOWZhYmYyZWFjYjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commit/4036bb598cd372b73f555fabccc8b867faeb7f5d","sha":"4036bb598cd372b73f555fabccc8b867faeb7f5d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/4036bb598cd372b73f555fabccc8b867faeb7f5d"}],"sha":"d407f489aa9ed41e0a7d757413e639fabf2eacb0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/d407f489aa9ed41e0a7d757413e639fabf2eacb0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67088644?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran","id":67088644,"login":"yoesran","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MDg4NjQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/4036bb598cd372b73f555fabccc8b867faeb7f5d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-08T15:29:18Z","email":"naufalyoesran@gmail.com","name":"Naufal Yusran"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-08T15:29:18Z","email":"naufalyoesran@gmail.com","name":"Naufal Yusran"},"message":"refactor(host,lab): audit polish — theme-drawer naming, reduced-motion, presence fallback, standalone remote, drop dead boxed mode\n\nFollow-up polish from a self-audit of the playground rework.\n\nHost:\n- rename the theme i18n namespace `themeLab` → `themeDrawer` and the visible\n  drawer title \"// theme-lab\" → \"// theme\" (one name for the concept).\n- soften the theme-drawer copy: \"the Svelte remote re-skins\" → \"a live Svelte\n  remote re-skins\" — the cold-opened drawer can''t show a remote cascading until\n  one is actually mounted.\n- PresenceOverlay: render a \"Live cursors unavailable\" fallback pill when\n  `lab/Presence` can''t load (was silent).\n\nLab:\n- SpringToy honours prefers-reduced-motion: hold/snap instead of swinging (drag\n  stays responsive; embedded mount/unmount behaviour unchanged).\n- SpringToy standalone: no React/MF host node, no \"mounted\" label, no\n  mount/unmount — just the centred lanyard + copy explaining it''s the remote\n  component on its own, not mounted inside anything. Context-aware hint.\n- fix the lanyard cord on the standalone page: `var(--brand)` (host-only) →\n  `var(--color-brand)` (carries the lab''s emerald fallback) so it''s visible.\n- Presence is now always a page-wide overlay; the standalone page mounts it\n  page-wide too. Removed the now-unused boxed-canvas mode and the `global` prop\n  plumbing (Presence.svelte / mountPresence / PresenceOverlay / App.svelte).\n\nDocs: theme-drawer rename, and presence \"cursor canvas\" → \"page-wide overlay\".\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c031ab186630b47a98a64deadbc8bd9e0c95302b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/git/trees/c031ab186630b47a98a64deadbc8bd9e0c95302b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/git/commits/4036bb598cd372b73f555fabccc8b867faeb7f5d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67088644?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran","id":67088644,"login":"yoesran","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MDg4NjQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commit/4036bb598cd372b73f555fabccc8b867faeb7f5d","node_id":"C_kwDOSg0xJdoAKDQwMzZiYjU5OGNkMzcyYjczZjU1NWZhYmNjYzhiODY3ZmFlYjdmNWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commit/32c821716c52722aaabe329b3ee0b40b5488854b","sha":"32c821716c52722aaabe329b3ee0b40b5488854b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/32c821716c52722aaabe329b3ee0b40b5488854b"}],"sha":"4036bb598cd372b73f555fabccc8b867faeb7f5d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/4036bb598cd372b73f555fabccc8b867faeb7f5d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67088644?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran","id":67088644,"login":"yoesran","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MDg4NjQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/32c821716c52722aaabe329b3ee0b40b5488854b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-08T13:44:32Z","email":"naufalyoesran@gmail.com","name":"Naufal Yusran"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-08T13:45:57Z","email":"naufalyoesran@gmail.com","name":"Naufal Yusran"},"message":"feat(host): rework playground — live-remote diagram, lanyard remote, global presence, theme drawer\n\nReframe the microfrontend so it reads as a running thing, not an explainer,\nand promote presence + theme out of cards into the page chrome.\n\nHost:\n- live-remote block: a triggerable you → host → lab federation diagram wired\n  to the real `loadRemote(''lab/SpringToy'')` — packets animate while it''s in\n  flight, links resolve green/red on the real result, and on success it\n  reveals the live remote. \"Break the connection\" exercises the fallback.\n  A `MIN_FETCH_MS` floor paces the local instant-load so the handshake reads.\n- presence is now a global, opt-in whole-page cursor overlay toggled from the\n  header (`PresenceOverlay` + `PresenceToggle`, shared via `lib/presence.ts`),\n  with a live count to soften the empty room. Replaces the boxed presence card.\n- theme customizer moved into a header slide-over `Sheet` (`ThemeSheet` +\n  `ThemeControls`), replacing the theme-lab card; same 5-axis store.\n- RemoteMount: add `eager` (skip the viewport gate for user-triggered loads),\n  drop the now-unused load timing / `ms` (consumers measure their own).\n- removed MicrofrontendBlock / PresenceBlock / ThemeLabBlock; cleaned unused\n  scaffold assets (vite.svg, root react.svg, hero.png).\n\nLab:\n- Counter → SpringToy: a draggable Svelte \"lanyard ticket\" (Vercel-style) with\n  verlet swing physics + idle-sleep; drag it onto the React/MF host to mount\n  (it docks and stays), tug it out with force to unmount. Exposed as\n  `./SpringToy` (was `./Counter`).\n- Presence.svelte: add `global` mode (fixed full-viewport overlay) alongside\n  the standalone boxed canvas; both share one cursor snippet.\n- bundled React + Module Federation marks for the diagram / toy.\n\nDocs: synced overview / mf-core / mf-platform / features / gotchas / handoff /\ndeployment + READMEs + docs index to the new architecture.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0e10f5f066639ba8f181aa3d7050529dc0fe6122","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/git/trees/0e10f5f066639ba8f181aa3d7050529dc0fe6122"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/git/commits/32c821716c52722aaabe329b3ee0b40b5488854b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67088644?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran","id":67088644,"login":"yoesran","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MDg4NjQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commit/32c821716c52722aaabe329b3ee0b40b5488854b","node_id":"C_kwDOSg0xJdoAKDMyYzgyMTcxNmM1MjcyMmFhYWJlMzI5YjNlZTBiNDBiNTQ4ODg1NGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commit/63eda6a4babe586eba960ff9c4b54257ca13d4c2","sha":"63eda6a4babe586eba960ff9c4b54257ca13d4c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/63eda6a4babe586eba960ff9c4b54257ca13d4c2"}],"sha":"32c821716c52722aaabe329b3ee0b40b5488854b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/32c821716c52722aaabe329b3ee0b40b5488854b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67088644?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran","id":67088644,"login":"yoesran","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MDg4NjQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/63eda6a4babe586eba960ff9c4b54257ca13d4c2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T09:26:02Z","email":"naufalyoesran@gmail.com","name":"Naufal Yusran"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T09:26:02Z","email":"naufalyoesran@gmail.com","name":"Naufal Yusran"},"message":"refactor(host): make RemoteMount mount-once independent of the React Compiler\n\nRemoteMount''s effect listed load/opts/onStatusChange in its deps, but\ncallers pass those as inline literals (new identity each render). Without\nmemoization the effect would re-run on every render and its own setState\n(via onStatusChange) would loop; it only worked because the React Compiler\nmemoizes the literals away. Keep correctness from depending on that:\n\n- stash load/opts/onStatusChange in refs, synced in an effect (rules-of-refs\n  clean — the during-render assignment is rejected by react-hooks/refs)\n- gate the mount effect on inView alone, so the remote mounts exactly once\n  when the block scrolls in and never re-mounts on a parent re-render\n\nBehavior unchanged (the offline/reconnect toggle still drives a key remount).\n\nDocs: fix stale theme-control descriptions in features.md + handoff.md — the\nlight/dark/system control is the theme-lab block''s base-mode ToggleGroup (not\na header DropdownMenu), and FOUC is killed by the generated pre-paint script\n(theme-tokens.ts via the theme-prepaint Vite plugin), not an inline index.html\nscript.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b1f7a7f7c3c9e1b9e1a7ec9415a4dd321beec0aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/git/trees/b1f7a7f7c3c9e1b9e1a7ec9415a4dd321beec0aa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/git/commits/63eda6a4babe586eba960ff9c4b54257ca13d4c2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67088644?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran","id":67088644,"login":"yoesran","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MDg4NjQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commit/63eda6a4babe586eba960ff9c4b54257ca13d4c2","node_id":"C_kwDOSg0xJdoAKDYzZWRhNmE0YmFiZTU4NmViYTk2MGZmOWM0YjU0MjU3Y2ExM2Q0YzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commit/9b54e8a1791676e4b817779470f6a9c4a5c1e725","sha":"9b54e8a1791676e4b817779470f6a9c4a5c1e725","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/9b54e8a1791676e4b817779470f6a9c4a5c1e725"}],"sha":"63eda6a4babe586eba960ff9c4b54257ca13d4c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/63eda6a4babe586eba960ff9c4b54257ca13d4c2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67088644?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran","id":67088644,"login":"yoesran","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MDg4NjQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/9b54e8a1791676e4b817779470f6a9c4a5c1e725/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T08:54:36Z","email":"naufalyoesran@gmail.com","name":"Naufal Yusran"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T08:54:36Z","email":"naufalyoesran@gmail.com","name":"Naufal Yusran"},"message":"feat(blog): i18n (EN/ID locale routing), theme toggle, reading panel\n\nMigrate the blog to locale-routed i18n and add reader-facing chrome:\n\n- Locale routing under app/[lang]/ (en, id) with a root app/layout.tsx\n  above the segment owning <html>/<body> so a locale switch never\n  re-renders them (theme class survives; no React-19 script warning).\n  prepaint.js (beforeInteractive, external) restores theme + reading\n  prefs and sets <html lang> from the URL before first paint.\n- Translated UI (en/id dictionaries with build-time key parity) and\n  content: per-locale CV data + one .mdx post body per language.\n- light/dark/system theme toggle and a per-post reading panel\n  (font / size / background), both no-FOUC.\n- SEO: per-locale metadata, hreflang alternates, per-locale sitemap,\n  robots; apex + bare /cv /posts redirect to the default locale via\n  public/_redirects (no middleware in a static export), keeping the\n  host''s locale-less CV link working.\n\nReview fixes folded in: correct ThemeToggle/LocaleToggle aria-labels\n(localized), removed the dead meta.notFoundTitle key, prose palette\nbound to base (non-invert) tokens so light reading backgrounds read\nright. Docs (overview/handoff/deployment/gotchas + READMEs) synced.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ea7ec26bad96cdb09c160d46e7d82d7be827bab7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/git/trees/ea7ec26bad96cdb09c160d46e7d82d7be827bab7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/git/commits/9b54e8a1791676e4b817779470f6a9c4a5c1e725","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified"