ions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commit/8f09079e55f1ab93e52cdcbe3ff13c001aeea56f","node_id":"C_kwDOSg0xJdoAKDhmMDkwNzllNTVmMWFiOTNlNTJjZGNiZTNmZjEzYzAwMWFlZWE1NmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commit/7aeb533b42ddef99418d9b085733c0d423d95781","sha":"7aeb533b42ddef99418d9b085733c0d423d95781","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/7aeb533b42ddef99418d9b085733c0d423d95781"}],"sha":"8f09079e55f1ab93e52cdcbe3ff13c001aeea56f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/8f09079e55f1ab93e52cdcbe3ff13c001aeea56f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67088644?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran","id":67088644,"login":"yoesran","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MDg4NjQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/7aeb533b42ddef99418d9b085733c0d423d95781/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-05T04:23:54Z","email":"naufalyoesran@gmail.com","name":"Naufal Yusran"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-05T04:23:54Z","email":"naufalyoesran@gmail.com","name":"Naufal Yusran"},"message":"feat(blog): pixel-faithful CV page (Calibri replica, print-to-PDF, data-driven)\n\n- /cv: a single-column A4 \"sheet\" replica of the real CV in HTML/CSS, shown\n  inside the blog''s dark frame. Calibri (Carlito metric-fallback for\n  non-Windows), tuned to fit one A4 page.\n- Mobile: the fixed sheet scales to fit via `zoom` (JS-measured; CSS\n  media-query fallbacks for the pre-hydration frame).\n- Download: \"Download PDF\" calls window.print() with a print stylesheet\n  (@page A4, hides chrome, resets zoom) -> a real, selectable, ATS-readable\n  PDF that mirrors the page. Generated on the fly, so the phone number never\n  lives in a committed file.\n- Contact: LinkedIn wired; phone is print-only (hidden on the web, present in\n  the downloaded PDF).\n- Content lives in cv-data.ts (edit a data array, not JSX); one-page fit is\n  tuned via CSS-variable knobs at the top of cv.css (--fs, --lh, --entry-gap,\n  --section-gap). Layout maps over the data.\n- Content is faithful to the source CV and prerendered (crawlable for SEO).\n- docs: handoff updated to reflect the CV page is built.\n\nVerified: static export builds, tsc + eslint clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6862fccfb73fff2372d24809fbf787c3209d05fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/git/trees/6862fccfb73fff2372d24809fbf787c3209d05fb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/git/commits/7aeb533b42ddef99418d9b085733c0d423d95781","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67088644?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"