ers/yoesran/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/91846e3a648fa950ef6d3d5a36578b962f134b77/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T13:00:41Z","email":"naufalyoesran@gmail.com","name":"Naufal Yusran"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T13:00:41Z","email":"naufalyoesran@gmail.com","name":"Naufal Yusran"},"message":"feat: scaffold naufal-blog — Next 16 static export + shadcn\n\nThe standalone content site (CV + technical posts) — App Router, TypeScript,\nTailwind v4, sibling to the other apps.\n\n- next.config: output: ''export'' + images.unoptimized → static out/ for\n  Cloudflare Pages (same direct-upload flow as host/lab). Chosen over\n  SSR/OpenNext: a content site needs no per-request server, and static export\n  is free + simpler while staying fully crawlable for SEO.\n- shadcn initialized (components.json, ui/button, lib/utils, theme tokens) so\n  the blog shares the portfolio''s component look.\n- Replaced the create-next-app template README with an accurate one.\n- docs: overview stack table + handoff updated (Next 15 -> 16, not-started ->\n  scaffolded) and the static-export decision recorded in the decision log.\n\nVerified: builds to static out/, tsc + eslint clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"100e1b567f61911c8f35debd9664774b6e56176f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/git/trees/100e1b567f61911c8f35debd9664774b6e56176f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/git/commits/91846e3a648fa950ef6d3d5a36578b962f134b77","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,