.com/yoesran","id":67088644,"login":"yoesran","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MDg4NjQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/551941ce32d6e23c288098b6b6a1ecbcc3f4ae6e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T11:50:46Z","email":"naufalyoesran@gmail.com","name":"Naufal Yusran"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T11:50:46Z","email":"naufalyoesran@gmail.com","name":"Naufal Yusran"},"message":"chore: real <head> meta + OG tags, monogram favicon, drop template READMEs\n\n- naufal-host/index.html: real title, description, author, light/dark\n  theme-color, and Open Graph + Twitter card tags for link previews.\n- naufal-lab/index.html: real title + description for the standalone page.\n- favicon (both apps): replace the Vite default logo with an emerald \"n\"\n  monogram on a dark rounded square, matching the wordmark + accent.\n- READMEs (both apps): replace the Vite/Svelte template boilerplate with\n  accurate one-pagers pointing into docs/ (removes the false \"React\n  Compiler is not enabled\" line).\n- deployment.md: add og:url/og:image to the custom-domain update checklist;\n  fix a code-fence lint nit.\n\nFollow-up: OG tags point at /og.png (1200x630) — add naufal-host/public/og.png\nfor image previews, and redeploy the host for the new meta to go live.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b7a42b318f024c942ed1eac889fc7eacd4a369dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/git/trees/b7a42b318f024c942ed1eac889fc7eacd