ers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran","id":67088644,"login":"yoesran","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MDg4NjQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/2db9cd65fcf88b70cca6ffec4d0744125e9b4ad6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T11:27:42Z","email":"naufalyoesran@gmail.com","name":"Naufal Yusran"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T11:27:42Z","email":"naufalyoesran@gmail.com","name":"Naufal Yusran"},"message":"perf: code-split below-fold blocks + preconnect remote origin\n\n- App.tsx: React.lazy the four below-fold blocks (Hero stays eager as the\n  LCP element); each in Suspense with a Cell-shaped BlockFallback to avoid\n  layout jump. Trims the initial index chunk ~21% gzip.\n- vite.config.ts: preconnect-remote plugin injects an env-aware\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" crossorigin> to VITE_LAB_URL.\n\ndocs:\n- mf-platform: document the code-splitting + preconnect, the new-block\n  eager/lazy convention (above fold eager, below lazy), and the honest\n  CSR/Lighthouse-noise ceiling.\n- overview: add the missing ThemeLab block row + update the App.tsx role\n  to reflect the lazy-split.\n- mf-core: fix stale consumeTypes snippet (now command === ''serve'').\n- mf-platform: fix stale dev-env description (gitignored .env.local).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c29177