88644?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran","id":67088644,"login":"yoesran","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MDg4NjQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/66bb548979697ff3b9084a1b450c57c959d1a8c3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T06:39:27Z","email":"naufalyoesran@gmail.com","name":"Naufal Yusran"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T06:39:27Z","email":"naufalyoesran@gmail.com","name":"Naufal Yusran"},"message":"chore: deploy to Cloudflare Pages + PartyKit, add deployment docs\n\nDeploy config (direct upload, three independent origins, free tier):\n- naufal-lab/public/_headers: CORS (single ACAO *) for the cross-origin\n  remote + no-store on remoteEntry.js so a redeployed remote is picked up.\n- naufal-host/.env.production + naufal-lab/.env.production: prod URLs\n  (VITE_LAB_URL, VITE_PARTY_HOST) — public VITE_ vars, safe to commit.\n- naufal-host/vite.config.ts: consumeTypes only in dev (serve) so the prod\n  build doesn''t depend on the remote being reachable.\n- naufal-lab/App.svelte: standalone page passes its own VITE_PARTY_HOST to\n  Presence (embedded path gets it via opts).\n- naufal-lab dev:mf runs vite build --watch --mode development so local dev\n  keeps dev env (the remote is otherwise always a production build).\n\nDocs:\n- New docs/deployment.md: live Cloudflare setup, cross-origin env wiring,\n  CORS via _headers, build-mode separation, direct-upload procedure.\n- gotchas #21 (Pages _headers merge -> doubled ACAO) and #22 (remote is\n  always a prod build + standalone needs its own backend config).\n- handoff roadmap: v0.2 marked deployed; selection-filter note (a block\n  earns its place if it crosses the boundary AND stays loosely coupled).\n- README index + mf-platform cross-link.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"39a6e6169dde7dc195a29479ee32bd13277d9c8b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/git/trees/39a6e6169dde7dc195a29479ee32bd13277d9c8b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/git/commits/66bb548979697ff3b9084a1b450c57c959d1a8c3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67088644?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran","id":67088644,"login":"yoesran","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MDg4NjQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commit/66bb548979697ff3b9084a1b450c57c959d1a8c3","node_id":"C_kwDOSg0xJdoAKDY2YmI1NDg5Nzk2OTdmZjNiOTA4NGExYjQ1MGM1N2M5NTlkMWE4YzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commit/44ef118296733c9ac970c90039df12d417f9594d","sha":"44ef118296733c9ac970c90039df12d417f9594d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/44ef118296733c9ac970c90039df12d417f9594d"}],"sha":"66bb548979697ff3b9084a1b450c57c959d1a8c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/66bb548979697ff3b9084a1b450c57c959d1a8c3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67088644?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran","id":67088644,"login":"yoesran","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MDg4NjQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/44ef118296733c9ac970c90039df12d417f9594d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T05:23:37Z","email":"naufalyoesran@gmail.com","name":"Naufal Yusran"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T05:23:37Z","email":"naufalyoesran@gmail.com","name":"Naufal Yusran"},"message":"feat: theme-lab customizer, pre-paint codegen, and media-query cleanup\n\nTheme:\n- Add theme-lab block: visitor-facing customizer across five axes\n  (mode/accent/surface/radius/font), all CSS vars on <html> that cascade\n  into the federated remote live; backed by one shared useSyncExternalStore.\n- Split pure theme data into DOM-free theme-tokens.ts and generate the\n  no-FOUC pre-paint <script>/<style> from it via a theme-prepaint Vite\n  plugin (replaces a slot in index.html), so the inline script can no\n  longer drift from the store.\n- Remove the standalone ThemeToggle/PaletteToggle header shortcuts and the\n  old useTheme.ts hook; the block is now the single entry point.\n\nHeader / responsiveness:\n- Fix the mobile-nav dropdown surfacing on desktop: its popup portals to\n  <body> so a sm:hidden class can''t hide it — unmount the menu on desktop\n  via a new useMediaQuery hook instead.\n- Route every JS desktop/mobile + media check through useMediaQuery\n  (TechStackBlock hover/pointer + reduced-motion, HeroBlock reduced-motion);\n  no hand-rolled matchMedia subscriptions remain in components.\n\nTooling / docs:\n- eslint: ignore generated @mf-types so npm run lint passes with types present.\n- Update overview/features/gotchas/handoff; add gotcha #20 (portaled popup\n  can''t be hidden by a class on its trigger).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"68e2b6ac050127e6db567120730790c2a135349a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/git/trees/68e2b6ac050127e6db567120730790c2a135349a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/git/commits/44ef118296733c9ac970c90039df12d417f9594d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67088644?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/gist