s_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/94e5236cb12515b2502ecf09f05f079f961a519f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-01T16:00:41Z","email":"naufalyoesran@gmail.com","name":"Naufal Yusran"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-01T16:00:41Z","email":"naufalyoesran@gmail.com","name":"Naufal Yusran"},"message":"feat: lab i18n, docs restructure, and host i18n/UX fixes\n\n- lab: i18n via svelte-i18n (en + id) with a typed key wrapper ($t) for\n  autocomplete + compile-time key checks; locale crosses via <html lang> +\n  MutationObserver so the Presence socket survives a language switch\n- host: keep <Trans> reactive to locale under the React Compiler (pass t={t})\n- host: tech-stack deselects on pill-leave instead of canvas-leave; touch cleanup\n- docs: split the two large docs into a focused docs/ set; consolidate gotchas\n- chore: align VITE_PARTY_HOST to a bare host; move shadcn to devDependencies\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d9faeabf5025706bee0ed47af48697ca163fe893","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/git/trees/d9faeabf5025706bee0ed47af48697ca163fe893"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/git/commits/94e5236cb12515b2502ecf09f05f079f961a519f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67088644?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran","id":67088644,"login":"yoesran","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MDg4NjQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commit/94e5236cb12515b2502ecf09f05f079f961a519f","node_id":"C_kwDOSg0xJdoAKDk0ZTUyMzZjYjEyNTE1YjI1MDJlY2YwOWYwNWYwNzlmOTYxYTUxOWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commit/d459f08f42b87389e8907bdf2b4f0e56383bddb0","sha":"d459f08f42b87389e8907bdf2b4f0e56383bddb0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/d459f08f42b87389e8907bdf2b4f0e56383bddb0"}],"sha":"94e5236cb12515b2502ecf09f05f079f961a519f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/94e5236cb12515b2502ecf09f05f079f961a519f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67088644?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran","id":67088644,"login":"yoesran","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MDg4NjQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/d459f08f42b87389e8907bdf2b4f0e56383bddb0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-01T05:22:06Z","email":"naufalyoesran@gmail.com","name":"Naufal Yusran"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-01T05:22:06Z","email":"naufalyoesran@gmail.com","name":"Naufal Yusran"},"message":"feat: host i18n (en + id) — i18next, typed keys, locale shape consistency\n\nLibrary + UI\n- Install i18next + react-i18next + i18next-browser-languagedetector.\n  Install shadcn ToggleGroup (pulls Toggle too) for the locale switcher.\n- Init in src/lib/i18n.ts: en + id resources under one default namespace,\n  detection order localStorage -> navigator, storage key ''locale''. On\n  languageChanged, document.documentElement.lang is set to match -- this\n  is what remotes will read when lab i18n lands.\n- LocaleToggle (shadcn ToggleGroup, segmented EN/ID pill, spacing=0)\n  lives in the header to the left of ThemeToggle. Maps over LOCALES so\n  adding a third locale auto-adds a third pill.\n\nAll host strings migrated\n- App intro, Header nav, HeroBlock tagline, TechStackBlock (prompt + tech\n  notes, with Tech.note replaced by Tech.noteKey + t() lookup),\n  MicrofrontendBlock (description, status, actions, offline title + body,\n  dev hint), PresenceBlock description, ThemeToggle labels -- all routed\n  through t() or <Trans> (the latter where inline <span>/<code> needs to\n  wrap parts of the translated string).\n- Indonesian translations are best-effort drafts awaiting native-speaker\n  review.\n\nLocale type machinery\n- LOCALES = [''en'', ''id''] as const tuple; Locale = (typeof LOCALES)[number];\n  DEFAULT_LOCALE: Locale = ''en''; isLocale(value): value is Locale type\n  guard. Used end-to-end: LocaleToggle''s current is typed Locale,\n  changeLanguage receives narrowed Locale, syncHtmlLang takes Locale.\n\nTranslation key autocomplete + dynamic key safety\n- i18n-types.d.ts augments i18next (not react-i18next -- CustomTypeOptions\n  lives on i18next; react-i18next re-uses it). t(''foo.bar'') is now\n  type-checked against en.json shape with IDE autocomplete on the key arg.\n- Translations = typeof en exported. Components derive sub-unions for\n  dynamic keys via keyof Translations[''path''][''to''] -- e.g. TechNoteKey in\n  TechStackBlock makes t(`techStack.notes.${noteKey}`) type-check without\n  a cast.\n\nLocale shape consistency (dual satisfies)\n- Adding a key to en.json without mirroring it in id.json (or vice versa)\n  now fails the build. Mechanism: at the i18next-init resources block,\n  id satisfies LocaleShape<typeof en> catches missing keys in id (would\n  silently fall back to English at runtime); en satisfies LocaleShape<\n  typeof id> catches extra keys in id (drift indicator). Both directions\n  are needed because TS only excess-property-checks object literals, not\n  JSON-import bindings. LocaleShape<T> widens string leaves to string so\n  literal value differences are ignored and only key structure compared.\n- In-code comment above resources block explains the scaling rule for\n  adding more locales (linear in N via en-as-source-of-truth, not\n  quadratic pairwise checks).\n\nDocs + memory\n- module-federation-setup.md sec.14 covers the architecture stance, the\n  shipped host setup, the type machinery, the dual-satisfies shape check,\n  and a working-convention subsection: any new user-facing string must\n  go through i18n (no hardcoded text in components).\n- project-handoff.md i18n resolved decision updated.\n- New feedback memory feedback_i18n_first.md captures the i18n-first\n  rule for future sessions, alongside the existing feedback_shadcn_first.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"91b1a9490147db704d226f76a7051dfcef2fa19d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/git/trees/91b1a9490147db704d226f76a7051dfcef2fa19d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/git/commits/d459f08f42b87389e8907bdf2b4f0e56383bddb0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67088644?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran","id":67088644,"login":"yoesran","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MDg4NjQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commit/d459f08f42b87389e8907bdf2b4f0e56383bddb0","node_id":"C_kwDOSg0xJdoAKGQ0NTlmMDhmNDJiODczODllODkwN2JkZjJiNGYwZTU2MzgzYmRkYjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commit/8486d1ca050916a74bb1cd2a8e6ba587060fc9b3","sha":"8486d1ca050916a74bb1cd2a8e6ba587060fc9b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/8486d1ca050916a74bb1cd2a8e6ba587060fc9b3"}],"sha":"d459f08f42b87389e8907bdf2b4f0e56383bddb0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/d459f08f42b87389e8907bdf2b4f0e56383bddb0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67088644?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran","id":67088644,"login":"yoesran","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MDg4NjQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/8486d1ca050916a74bb1cd2a8e6ba587060fc9b3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-29T10:18:50Z","email":"naufalyoesran@gmail.com","name":"Naufal Yusran"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-29T10:18:50Z","email":"naufalyoesran@gmail.com","name":"Naufal Yusran"},"message":"feat: v0.2 polish — react compiler, scroll reveal, theme toggle, touch refinements\n\nReact Compiler 1.0\n- Wire babel-plugin-react-compiler via a ~12-line custom Vite plugin that\n  calls @babel/core directly with enforce: ''pre''. The documented Vite 8 /\n  plugin-react v6 path (@rolldown/plugin-babel + reactCompilerPreset) builds\n  cleanly but never runs the babel transform — likely a handshake interaction\n  with @module-federation/vite, not pinned down. Verified by an unminified\n  build: react/compiler-runtime imported, 26 source files compiled.\n- Drop now-redundant useCallback + REMOTE_OPTS module-const in\n  MicrofrontendBlock; compiler auto-memoizes the inline load and\n  opts={{ context: ''host'' }} so RemoteMount doesn''t remount in a loop.\n\nScroll-reveal + deferred federated load\n- New useInView hook (IntersectionObserver, fires once, disconnects on entry).\n- Cell wires it: translate-y-4 opacity-0 → translate-y-0 opacity-100 over\n  duration-700 ease-out, with motion-reduce: variants forcing the visible\n  state immediately for reduced-motion users.\n- RemoteMount gates its load() effect on inView. Federated chunks now wait\n  for the cell to scroll into view, making MicrofrontendBlock''s on-page copy\n  \"fetched the moment it scrolled into view\" literally true.\n\nDark mode toggle (light / dark / system)\n- New useTheme hook tracks stored preference + system preference, derives\n  resolvedTheme, listens to MQL so OS-theme changes flip the page live in\n  system mode.\n- New ThemeToggle uses shadcn DropdownMenu + DropdownMenuRadioGroup; trigger\n  is a ghost-variant Button showing Sun/Moon for the current resolved theme.\n- Inline init script in index.html mirrors useTheme storage + system read,\n  sets .dark on <html> before any paint. Inline <style> paints background +\n  color-scheme per class — kills both FOUC and theme-flash for return\n  visitors. Replaces the aspirational mitigation in gotcha #13.\n- scrollbar-gutter: stable on <html> in index.css to prevent the horizontal\n  layout shift when base-ui-react''s portal locks body scroll on open.\n\nTechStackBlock touch + hover refinements\n- Desktop: hovering empty canvas no longer pauses the orbit (only active\n  selection drives the pause). Pills sweep under the cursor naturally.\n- Mobile: tapping empty canvas deselects without engaging the touch-pause\n  flag, so passive touches (a finger landing during a scroll) don''t stutter\n  the orbit.\n- Mobile: document-level touchstart listener (capture phase) deselects when\n  the touch lands outside the canvas. iOS Safari doesn''t blur a focused\n  button on a non-focusable tap, so the onBlur fallback was unreliable.\n  Force-resets touchActiveRef alongside the deselect to defend against stale\n  refs from scroll-promotion or multi-touch sequences.\n- Next.js icon color follows --foreground so it stays visible on both themes\n  (was hardcoded #FFFFFF, invisible on light).\n\nshadcn migration in MicrofrontendBlock\n- Drop local Skeleton, use @/components/ui/skeleton.\n- RemoteOffline now uses shadcn Alert + AlertTitle + AlertDescription; the\n  bespoke dashed-red styling is preserved via overrides — gain is\n  role=\"alert\" semantics and clearer structural intent.\n- Install shadcn dropdown-menu, skeleton, alert via the shadcn CLI.\n\nDocs + memory\n- module-federation-setup.md: new §12 React Compiler integration, §13 Dark\n  mode toggle, §14 Scroll-reveal + deferred federated load. Gotcha #13 (white\n  flash) rewritten to reflect actual mitigation. Gotcha #15 (rolldown silent\n  fail) and #16 (iOS focus-stuck-on-tap) added.\n- project-handoff.md: v0.2 status updated, Setup drops Framer Motion\n  reference, Behavior notes scroll reveal is now real, Dark mode resolved\n  decision marked done, Components principle expanded with the shadcn-first\n  rule (don''t reinvent the wheel).\n- Memory: mf_architecture.md gains the React Compiler workaround + iOS\n  focus-stuck-on-tap entries; new feedback_shadcn_first.md records the\n  prefer-shadcn-over-bespoke rule.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"331917dcf518cffd3748edb620cf7298fda1ade1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/git/trees/331917dcf518cffd3748edb620cf7298fda1ade1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/git/commits/8486d1ca050916a74bb1cd2a8e6ba587060fc9b3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67088644?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran","id":67088644,"login":"yoesran","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MDg4NjQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commit/8486d1ca050916a74bb1cd2a8e6ba587060fc9b3","node_id":"C_kwDOSg0xJdoAKDg0ODZkMWNhMDUwOTE2YTc0YmIxY2QyYThlNmJhNTg3MDYwZmM5YjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commit/418cbfeef3e376a3d1f0a8f2a0e3dda8de21a941","sha":"418cbfeef3e376a3d1f0a8f2a0e3dda8de21a941","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/418cbfeef3e376a3d1f0a8f2a0e3dda8de21a941"}],"sha":"8486d1ca050916a74bb1cd2a8e6ba587060fc9b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/8486d1ca050916a74bb1cd2a8e6ba587060fc9b3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67088644?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran","id":67088644,"login":"yoesran","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MDg4NjQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/418cbfeef3e376a3d1f0a8f2a0e3dda8de21a941/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-28T17:56:42Z","email":"naufalyoesran@gmail.com","name":"Naufal Yusran"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-28T17:56:42Z","email":"naufalyoesran@gmail.com","name":"Naufal Yusran"},"message":"feat: complete v0.2 playground — frame, blocks, deploy resilience\n\nBlocks + frame\n- Add HeroBlock (host-native interactive wordmark with per-letter cursor repel\n  and emerald glow; touch parity via touch-as-cursor + 350ms tap hold)\n- Add TechStackBlock (host-native rotating icon orbit; local SVG assets;\n  detail panel with smooth height animation; clean desktop/mobile event split\n  via matchMedia; sticky selection; orbit pause derived from active state)\n- Add Header + Footer (sticky nav, social/contact links)\n- MicrofrontendBlock: loading skeleton (shadcn-style), height-animated remote\n  area, responsive status/button row, hide simulate-toggle when remote is\n  genuinely offline (vs simulated)\n- PresenceBlock: per-cursor origin label (host/remote) relayed via PartyKit\n\nLazy loading + boot resilience\n- Switch RemoteMount loads to loadRemote() from @module-federation/runtime so\n  the plugin''s static analyzer doesn''t add federated chunks to the bootstrap\n  proxy''s preload list — React mounts immediately, blocks lazy-load after\n- Add mf-fallback-plugin.ts runtime plugin: errorLoadRemote returns a benign\n  stub for auto-init failure (host still boots) and a throwing stub for\n  block-level loads (RemoteMount fallback fires)\n- Wrap App in top-level ErrorBoundary + add unhandledrejection swallower\n- Inline dark background + color-scheme in index.html to avoid FOUC before JS\n\nDeploy plumbing\n- vite.config.ts uses loadEnv to read VITE_LAB_URL — federation entry is now\n  environment-aware; .env.tunnel.local + dev:tunnel script for VS Code tunnels\n- naufal-lab preview/server: cors: true + allowedHosts: true for cross-origin\n  tunnel access; env example files for both modes\n\nOther\n- Move app.css import from .ts mount adapters into .svelte components so the\n  dts plugin''s tsc (which only extends root tsconfig, no vite/client) doesn''t\n  choke on side-effect CSS imports\n- Docs: add lazy-loadRemote pattern, resilience plugin, env-aware deploy\n  sections; add new gotchas (eager preload, dts tsconfig inheritance, MF\n  rewriting imports inside comments, FOUC, touchcancel handling)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0ca39fd53223c48a2decd9c37fb76dabc5371c40","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/git/trees/0ca39fd53223c48a2decd9c37fb76dabc5371c40"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/git/commits/418cbfeef3e376a3d1f0a8f2a0e3dda8de21a941","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67088644?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran","id":67088644,"login":"yoesran","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MDg4NjQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commit/418cbfeef3e376a3d1f0a8f2a0e3dda8de21a941","node_id":"C_kwDOSg0xJdoAKDQxOGNiZmVlZjNlMzc2YTNkMWYwYThmMmEwZTNkZGE4ZGUyMWE5NDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commit/5af14871a8dd273095dba145d32710d994467a1f","sha":"5af14871a8dd273095dba145d32710d994467a1f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/5af14871a8dd273095dba145d32710d994467a1f"}],"sha":"418cbfeef3e376a3d1f0a8f2a0e3dda8de21a941","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/418cbfeef3e376a3d1f0a8f2a0e3dda8de21a941"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67088644?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran","id":67088644,"login":"yoesran","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MDg4NjQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/5af14871a8dd273095dba145d32710d994467a1f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-25T13:25:48Z","email":"naufalyoesran@gmail.com","name":"Naufal Yusran"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-25T13:25:48Z","email":"naufalyoesran@gmail.com","name":"Naufal Yusran"},"message":"feat: add playground blocks, presence remote, and PartyKit realtime\n\n- Add home-page playground: Cell frame primitive + microfrontend-meta and\n  presence-room blocks in the host\n- Add Presence Svelte remote (lab/Presence) — live multiplayer cursors with\n  per-cursor name + origin (host/remote) labels\n- Add naufal-party PartyKit WebSocket server relaying cursor presence\n- Enhance RemoteMount with load status, graceful offline fallback, and opts\n  passthrough; add context-aware mouse-tracker glow to Counter\n- Thread runtime context across the MF boundary via the opts contract\n- Ship remote Tailwind over federation by importing app.css in mount adapters\n- Fix DTS generation under TS 6.0 (ignoreDeprecations for inherited baseUrl)\n- Update MF setup + handoff docs with realtime architecture and new gotchas\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f538e81bf6ee9e2f1d8d6bca907a24867595e561","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/git/trees/f538e81bf6ee9e2f1d8d6bca907a24867595e561"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/git/commits/5af14871a8dd273095dba145d32710d994467a1f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67088644?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran","id":67088644,"login":"yoesran","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MDg4NjQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesr