":"Naufal Yusran"},"message":"feat: set up shadcn/ui, Prettier, and DX improvements across host and remote\n\n- Replace LabRemote with generic RemoteMount wrapper; update App.tsx accordingly\n- Add shadcn/ui (Button) to host; add shadcn-svelte (Button) to remote\n- Fix Counter.svelte for Svelte 5 ($state rune, onclick syntax)\n- Add Prettier with import sorting and Tailwind class sorting to both host and remote\n- Add prettier-plugin-svelte to remote for .svelte file formatting\n- Configure VS Code formatOnSave and per-language default formatters\n- Expand dts config from shorthand to explicit generateTypes/consumeTypes\n- Sync theme tokens between host index.css and remote app.css\n- Update docs to reflect current architecture\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0e50b965b677f7c0e764cdcab98190c426fed352","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/git/trees/0e50b965b677f7c0e764cdcab98190c426fed352"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/git/commits/a0325d10697908c0f68a8176902cc7ff9edfacce","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67088644?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran","id":67088644,"login":"yoesran","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MDg4NjQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commit/a0325d10697908c0f68a8176902cc7ff9edfacce","node_id":"C_kwDOSg0xJdoAKGEwMzI1ZDEwNjk3OTA4YzBmNjhhODE3NjkwMmNjN2ZmOWVkZmFjY2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commit/460992f8eded0cf8f28bc0b446963cdda0e778ae","sha":"460992f8eded0cf8f28bc0b446963cdda0e778ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/460992f8eded0cf8f28bc0b446963cdda0e778ae"}],"sha":"a0325d10697908c0f68a8176902cc7ff9edfacce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/a0325d10697908c0f68a8176902cc7ff9edfacce"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67088644?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran","id":67088644,"login":"yoesran","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MDg4NjQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/460992f8eded0cf8f28bc0b446963cdda0e778ae/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-18T12:55:01Z","email":"naufalyoesran@gmail.com","name":"Naufal Yusran"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-18T12:55:01Z","email":"naufalyoesran@gmail.com","name":"Naufal Yusran"},"message":"chore: improve MF DX — generated types, 127.0.0.1, remote watch mode\n\nReplace the hand-written ambient declaration with proper type generation:\nenable dts: true on both federation configs, map lab/* paths to\n./@mf-types/lab/* in tsconfig, delete the now-redundant remotes.d.ts,\nand gitignore the generated .mf and @mf-types dirs.\n\nSwitch all URLs from localhost to 127.0.0.1 to avoid IPv6 resolution\nmismatches. Add fs.allow on the host so Vite can serve files from the\nmonorepo root. Add a watch-remote-dist plugin to the host that triggers\na full page reload whenever the remote''s dist changes during development.\n\nAdd concurrently to naufal-lab and a dev:mf script that runs\nvite build --watch alongside vite preview — the production-like\nalternative to the raw dev server when the host needs a stable remoteEntry.\n\nAlso add .vscode/settings.json and docs/project-handoff.md.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3e1733e34f3c9eff712805d3a6940f602fc5faab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/git/trees/3e1733e34f3c9eff712805d3a6940f602fc5faab"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/git/commits/460992f8eded0cf8f28bc0b446963cdda0e778ae","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67088644?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran","id":67088644,"login":"yoesran","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MDg4NjQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commit/460992f8eded0cf8f28bc0b446963cdda0e778ae","node_id":"C_kwDOSg0xJdoAKDQ2MDk5MmY4ZWRlZDBjZjhmMjhiYzBiNDQ2OTYzY2RkYTBlNzc4YWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commit/492ed3d225b42bd1b463ac98a85f02aaa388a58b","sha":"492ed3d225b42bd1b463ac98a85f02aaa388a58b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/492ed3d225b42bd1b463ac98a85f02aaa388a58b"}],"sha":"460992f8eded0cf8f28bc0b446963cdda0e778ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/460992f8eded0cf8f28bc0b446963cdda0e778ae"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67088644?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yoesran","id":67088644,"login":"yoesran","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MDg4NjQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoesran","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoesran/naufal-portfolio/commits/492ed3d225b42bd1b463ac98a85