,"message":"docs(claude): tighten CLAUDE.md — fix stale Tauri facts, dedupe, restructure\n\n257 -> 187 lines, no info loss (details point to authoritative docs).\n\nFixes wrong guidance an agent would act on: \"launch via Electron\" -> start-dev.bat;\nGUI-debug log paths were all apps/host-electron (Electron) but the Tauri mainline\nlogs to apps/host-tauri/src-tauri/logs / data/<key>/logs; cim-gui MCP is 19222\nElectron-only, Tauri uses the apps/host-tauri/e2e CDP flow; sheets are three\n(edge-analysis / yolo-detection / annotation), not \"only one\"; drop rotting line\nnumbers in favor of function names; packaging is three paths not just Electron.\n\nFills gaps hit this session: .bat must be ASCII-only (CP950 breaks cmd parsing),\nPOST /reload is additive (removed tools linger in the catalog until restart /\n--rebuild-catalog), the full test command (py -3.11 over both test dirs), and a\ncollected \"do-not-commit / gitignored derived artifacts\" table.\n\nCompresses the WDAC section (same conclusion was stated ~4x) and de-duplicates\nfirst-run/shared-code/per-tool-deps (now single-sourced with pointers). Moves the\nalways-obey rules (language, test gate, don''t-touch) to the top, and adds a meta\nrule: put detail in authoritative docs, keep this file to rules + signposts,\ncite symbols not line numbers.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7050565264d87b88113d609bb2a13383a3cbb423","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/git/trees/7050565264d87b88113d609bb2a13383a3cbb423"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/git/commits/9ca78c203a9ff57c2dd97aa1a1d028581198d139","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36671829?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik","id":36671829,"login":"hctsaik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjcxODI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik/nativeApp/commit/9ca78c203a9ff57c2dd97aa1a1d028581198d139","node_id":"C_kwDOSg8bTdoAKDljYTc4YzIwM2E5ZmY1N2MyZGQ5N2FhMWExZDAyODU4MTE5OGQxMzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik/nativeApp/commit/c99956e1cf2ee36273d0fca3c3930898f5ddf95e","sha":"c99956e1cf2ee36273d0fca3c3930898f5ddf95e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/commits/c99956e1cf2ee36273d0fca3c3930898f5ddf95e"}],"sha":"9ca78c203a9ff57c2dd97aa1a1d028581198d139","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/commits/9ca78c203a9ff57c2dd97aa1a1d028581198d139"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36671829?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik","id":36671829,"login":"hctsaik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjcxODI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/commits/c99956e1cf2ee36273d0fca3c3930898f5ddf95e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-05T05:05:25Z","email":"36671829+hctsaik@users.noreply.github.com","name":"hctsaik"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-05T05:05:25Z","email":"36671829+hctsaik@users.noreply.github.com","name":"hctsaik"},"message":"feat(shell): resolve_log_dir honors CIM_LOG_DIR (portable per-project logs)\n\nOptional P3 of the portable-app design: the Tauri shell''s resolve_log_dir()\nnow prefers CIM_LOG_DIR (injected by start.bat), falling back to cwd\\logs\n(unchanged dev behavior). Logic extracted into a pure log_dir_from() helper\nwith a unit test.\n\nNOTE: takes effect only after rebuilding the shell on a non-WDAC machine\n(cargo is blocked here, so this was reviewed but not compiled). Until then\nstart.bat already achieves per-project logs via the cwd trick, so this is a\nrobustness/cleanliness improvement, not required for the launcher to work.\n\nRefs docs/platform/portable-runtime-and-project-data.md §2.5\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7f331f7c1df20e139f85fcc96f926c031a1049c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/git/trees/7f331f7c1df20e139f85fcc96f926c031a1049c1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/git/commits/c99956e1cf2ee36273d0fca3c3930898f5ddf95e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36671829?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik","id":36671829,"login":"hctsaik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjcxODI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik/nativeApp/commit/c99956e1cf2ee36273d0fca3c3930898f5ddf95e","node_id":"C_kwDOSg8bTdoAKGM5OTk1NmUxY2YyZWUzNjI3M2QwZmNhM2MzOTMwODk4ZjVkZGY5NWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik/nativeApp/commit/56f37a44d810e6d5fb1f5ddf824496494fa3297a","sha":"56f37a44d810e6d5fb1f5ddf824496494fa3297a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/commits/56f37a44d810e6d5fb1f5ddf824496494fa3297a"}],"sha":"c99956e1cf2ee36273d0fca3c3930898f5ddf95e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/commits/c99956e1cf2ee36273d0fca3c3930898f5ddf95e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36671829?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik","id":36671829,"login":"hctsaik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjcxODI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/commits/56f37a44d810e6d5fb1f5ddf824496494fa3297a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-05T05:05:12Z","email":"36671829+hctsaik@users.noreply.github.com","name":"hctsaik"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-05T05:05:12Z","email":"36671829+hctsaik@users.noreply.github.com","name":"hctsaik"},"message":"feat(portable): XCOPY launcher + relocatable runtime + per-project data\n\nMake \"one folder = one complete install\": copy to deploy, delete to remove.\nEach loaded project gets its own data dir, so removal/rebuild is trivial.\nImplements docs/platform/portable-runtime-and-project-data.md P1/P2/P4.\n\nstart.bat (portable launcher, ASCII-only to avoid cmd CP950 line-parsing\ncorruption): resolves the project (--project / CIM_PROJECT_DIR / deployed\nengine\\ / repo sidecar\\python-engine), derives project-key =\n<safe-foldername>-<sha256(abspath)[:8]>, creates/points\ndata\\<key>\\{logs,tool-venvs,deppack-cache,wheel-store}, sets the CIM_* env\nand cd''s into data\\<key> so the shell''s resolve_log_dir()=cwd\\logs is already\nper-project -- runs the EXISTING cim-light.exe, zero Rust change, WDAC-friendly.\n\nPortable runtime: build-runtime.bat (thin wrapper) + generalized\nfetch-standalone-python.ps1 (adds -DestRoot/-Flatten/-Requirements; default\nbehavior unchanged so the electron packaging path is unaffected) stage a\nrelocatable install_only CPython 3.11 at runtime\\python311\\ with the engine\ncore deps preinstalled, so an offline machine needs no Python and no pip.\nruntime\\ is gitignored (README kept); data\\ gitignored.\n\nVerified end-to-end with the real exe: engine starts with\n--log-dir ...\\data\\<key>\\logs, catalog rebuilds (24 tools) into the per-project\ndata, tools.sqlite lands there; a second --project gets a separate data\\<key>\nwith no interference. Runtime staging (download/extract/--strip-components=1\nflatten) produces a working python.exe with venv+pip. npm 20 + pytest 943 green.\n\nRefs docs/platform/portable-runtime-and-project-data.md\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"be5f794bab484c25b45d5edbede74ef4333a77ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/git/trees/be5f794bab484c25b45d5edbede74ef4333a77ef"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/git/commits/56f37a44d810e6d5fb1f5ddf824496494fa3297a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36671829?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik","id":36671829,"login":"hctsaik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjcxODI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik/nativeApp/commit/56f37a44d810e6d5fb1f5ddf824496494fa3297a","node_id":"C_kwDOSg8bTdoAKDU2ZjM3YTQ0ZDgxMGU2ZDVmYjFmNWRkZjgyNDQ5NjQ5NGZhMzI5N2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik/nativeApp/commit/b8521bf35dcbe79e865275e3b38bc067177230c9","sha":"b8521bf35dcbe79e865275e3b38bc067177230c9","ur