I5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/commits/5699bfa57334c251307b694e2000a89d54e8eeb3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-04T01:48:56Z","email":"36671829+hctsaik@users.noreply.github.com","name":"hctsaik"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-04T01:48:56Z","email":"36671829+hctsaik@users.noreply.github.com","name":"hctsaik"},"message":"feat(e2e): closed-loop LV↔Labeling journey — read-back UI + cross-tool harness\n\nSpec-driven build (docs/platform/loop-e2e-unet/) for the full active-learning\nloop: LV discovers samples → sends to Labeling → annotate → export → back to\nLV with the read-back applied. Golden path = diversity/active-learning\nsampling, verified end-to-end against the real Tauri shell (3 live runs, one\nclean PASS covering all 7 stages).\n\n- apps/host-tauri/e2e/lib.mjs: split testTool() into 7 reusable primitives\n  (spawnShell/waitEngineReady/getReadyPage/selectAndStart/verifyRendered/\n  teardown/waitForActiveTool) so a script can drive the shell across tool\n  switches instead of one-shot-per-tool. testTool()''s own output is unchanged\n  (regression-checked against sheet-edge-analysis and app-lv for real). Also\n  fixes DEFAULTS.exe, which still pointed at the retired nativeApp_Light\n  sibling — the whole harness was silently broken on this machine before this.\n- apps/host-tauri/e2e/journeys/lv-diversity-to-labeling.mjs: the golden-path\n  scenario script.\n- sidecar/python-engine/tests/test_lv_to_labeling_e2e.py: unit tests for\n  apply_readback() covering reordering after LV''s process restart, partial\n  annotation, and idempotency.\n- vendor/LV bump: brings in apply_readback() + the LV-side read-back UI\n  (separate commit inside the submodule).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c9b48c60317eefd8bdd843b292bea41ced85af9a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/git/trees/c9b48c60317eefd8bdd843b292bea41ced85af9a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/git/commits/5699bfa57334c251307b694e2000a89d54e8eeb3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36671829?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik","id":36671829,"login":"hctsaik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjcxODI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik/nativeApp/commit/5699bfa57334c251307b694e2000a89d54e8eeb3","node_id":"C_kwDOSg8bTdoAKDU2OTliZmE1NzMzNGMyNTEzMDdiNjk0ZTIwMDBhODlkNTRlOGVlYjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik/nativeApp/commit/2fd69538d184ca965d00c196f5606e222e8bf47a","sha":"2fd69538d184ca965d00c196f5606e222e8bf47a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/commits/2fd69538d184ca965d00c196f5606e222e8bf47a"}],"sha":"5699bfa57334c251307b694e2000a89d54e8eeb3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/commits/5699bfa57334c251307b694e2000a89d54e8eeb3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36671829?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik","id":36671829,"login":"hctsaik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjcxODI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/commits/2fd69538d184ca965d00c196f5606e222e8bf47a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-01T17:20:47Z","email":"36671829+hctsaik@users.noreply.github.com","name":"hctsaik"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-01T17:20:47Z","email":"36671829+hctsaik@users.noreply.github.com","name":"hctsaik"},"message":"chore(shell): stop committing prebuilt cim-light.exe; produce it out of git\n\nThe 17MB Tauri shell binary no longer lives in git. Untrack it and ignore\nprebuilt/*.exe; produce it on a non-WDAC machine via scripts/win/build-shell.bat\n(cargo build --release -> copy into prebuilt/), then copy onto the target box.\nThe existing on-disk exe still runs, and start-dev-tauri.bat''s fallback chain\nplus its \"exe missing\" hint were updated to point at build-shell.bat.\n\nDocs synced (CLAUDE.md, INSTALL.md, README, AGENTS, copilot-instructions,\nstartup-tauri.md): every \"ships with the repo / committed prebuilt\" claim now\nsays the exe is built elsewhere and copied in. Notably fixes an INSTALL.md\ntroubleshooting step that told users to `git checkout` the (now untracked) exe.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fd92e2e1e5a1cde733f69012fafed7fda9dbd667","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/git/trees/fd92e2e1e5a1cde733f69012fafed7fda9dbd667"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/git/commits/2fd69538d184ca965d00c196f5606e222e8bf47a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36671829?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik","id":36671829,"login":"hctsaik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjcxODI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik/nativeApp/commit/2fd69538d184ca965d00c196f5606e222e8bf47a","node_id":"C_kwDOSg8bTdoAKDJmZDY5NTM4ZDE4NGNhOTY1ZDAwYzE5NmY1NjA2ZTIyMmU4YmY0N2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik/nativeApp/commit/27bc47751941ef33d705d0623f92b27d30d41064","sha":"27bc47751941ef33d705d0623f92b27d30d41064","url"