uleNotFoundError) + fix\n- step 2: branch note (platform content lives on feat/extract-cim-modules; plain clone lands on main)\n- troubleshooting rows: cp950 UnicodeDecodeError, ai4bi ModuleNotFoundError, .mcp.json/.claude fresh-clone gap, npm ci / stale package-lock.json\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b1dfdc2a6ef88c30a9f1b533d39ef29fcfd04055","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/git/trees/b1dfdc2a6ef88c30a9f1b533d39ef29fcfd04055"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/git/commits/27bc47751941ef33d705d0623f92b27d30d41064","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36671829?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik","id":36671829,"login":"hctsaik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjcxODI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik/nativeApp/commit/27bc47751941ef33d705d0623f92b27d30d41064","node_id":"C_kwDOSg8bTdoAKDI3YmM0Nzc1MTk0MWVmMzNkNzA1ZDA2MjNmOTJiMjdkMzBkNDEwNjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik/nativeApp/commit/7f443362378e7a7f04d3e772bee297bcd9883786","sha":"7f443362378e7a7f04d3e772bee297bcd9883786","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/commits/7f443362378e7a7f04d3e772bee297bcd9883786"}],"sha":"27bc47751941ef33d705d0623f92b27d30d41064","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/commits/27bc47751941ef33d705d0623f92b27d30d41064"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36671829?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik","id":36671829,"login":"hctsaik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjcxODI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/commits/7f443362378e7a7f04d3e772bee297bcd9883786/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-30T19:45:42Z","email":"36671829+hctsaik@users.noreply.github.com","name":"hctsaik"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-30T19:45:42Z","email":"36671829+hctsaik@users.noreply.github.com","name":"hctsaik"},"message":"feat(shell): consolidate Tauri shell into repo at apps/host-tauri (retire nativeApp_Light sibling)\n\nThe Tauri shell (cim-light) was a separate sibling repo (..\\nativeApp_Light\\5_PG_Develop).\nIt now lives in this repo so daily use needs only one clone:\n\n- apps/host-tauri/src-tauri/ — Rust shell source (frontendDist repointed to ../../portal-react/dist)\n- apps/host-tauri/prebuilt/cim-light.exe — committed runnable binary (17MB), ships with the clone.\n  WDAC (enforced) blocks a local cargo rebuild, so the prebuilt exe is what runs. Rebuild only on a\n  non-WDAC machine, then replace this file.\n- apps/host-tauri/{package.json, e2e/, tests/, SIGNING.md} — tauri-cli wrapper + e2e harness.\n\nstart-dev*.bat now launch apps/host-tauri/prebuilt/cim-light.exe (fallback: local build -> legacy\nsibling). Verified: shell runs from new location, portal loads all 24 tools, engine /health + /whoami ok.\n\nDocs updated (CLAUDE.md, INSTALL.md, startup-tauri.md, README, AGENTS, copilot, cursor, docs/INSTALL)\nto drop the sibling-clone requirement; daily use no longer needs nativeApp_Light.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"473bd54b0a824d87da36df5bc02b26c5cedfe2cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/git/trees/473bd54b0a824d87da36df5bc02b26c5cedfe2cc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/git/commits/7f443362378e7a7f04d3e772bee297bcd9883786","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36671829?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik","id":36671829,"login":"hctsaik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjcxODI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://a