"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/commits/86eab7328b4b135de4b09a4561e52cb1e01d7142/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-29T15:02:17Z","email":"36671829+hctsaik@users.noreply.github.com","name":"hctsaik"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-29T15:02:17Z","email":"36671829+hctsaik@users.noreply.github.com","name":"hctsaik"},"message":"docs: add root INSTALL.md (new-machine + Tauri build runbook) + AI discoverability hooks\n\nAuthoritative, AI-executable setup/build runbook for a build-capable (no-WDAC)\nmachine: prereqs incl. the Tauri toolchain (Rust/msvc + MSVC C++ Build Tools +\nWebView2), sibling-repo layout, 3 submodules vs the ANnoTation JUNCTION, the\n4-layer py -3.11 pip install, portal-dist-before-tauri ordering, signed-NSIS\nbuild (with the cert-thumbprint / build-unsigned caveat), run, verify, and a\ntroubleshooting table. Produced + adversarially verified via a 5-agent workflow\n(correctness / fresh-AI walkthrough / discoverability lenses).\n\nDiscoverability so another AI notices and follows it:\n- AGENTS.md (root) — cross-tool entry hook pointing at INSTALL.md.\n- Pointer lines added to CLAUDE.md (首次設定) and README.md (top).\n- Reconcile the STALE docs/INSTALL.md: redirect banner at top; fix the\n  README + source-bundle-readme pointers that aimed at it (it wrongly called\n  Labeling a submodule and lacked the Tauri toolchain).\n- .github/copilot-instructions.md and .cursor/rules/00-setup.mdc one-line stubs\n  so Copilot/Cursor also route to INSTALL.md.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f5765e6dafe535b1f8606e5b734dd4a4a9e8d22c","url":"https://api.github.com/rep