s://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/commits/6f9476d1ad82778227ba8c77699de4cc2cbaf4ce/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-28T13:35:04Z","email":"36671829+hctsaik@users.noreply.github.com","name":"hctsaik"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-28T13:35:04Z","email":"36671829+hctsaik@users.noreply.github.com","name":"hctsaik"},"message":"docs(startup): honest WDAC finding — tauri dev is also WDAC-blocked\n\nEmpirically ran `tauri dev` on the WDAC-enforced machine: it fails during the\ncargo build with `os error 4551` (\"應用程式控制原則已封鎖此檔案\") on the unsigned\nbuild-script exe (`src-tauri/target/debug/build/.../build-script-build`). So Tauri\ndev does NOT sidestep WDAC — it just moves the blocked binary from esbuild.exe to\ncargo''s build-script/debug exe (same class: unsigned executable). Tauri''s WDAC win\nis the SIGNED release (`tauri build` → signed nsis), not dev.\n\n- start-dev-tauri.bat: run `tauri:dev` in the foreground and, on failure (WDAC build\n  block / rc!=0), auto-fall back to start-dev-nowdac-electron.bat (the only LOCAL DEV\n  that runs on this enforce machine) with a clear explanation.\n- docs/platform/startup-tauri.md + CLAUDE.md: correct the earlier optimistic\n  \"Tauri dev avoids WDAC\" claim; document the os-error-4551 reality, the auto-fallback,\n  and the real fixes (IT allowlist src-tauri\\target, or build signed elsewhere & deploy).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3bc72c728fbe702206a769faa9503c1e0b8a65e1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/git/trees/3bc72c728fbe702206a769faa9503c1e0b8a65e1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/git/commits/6f9476d1ad82778227ba8c77699de4cc2cbaf4ce","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36671829?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik","id":36671829,"login":"hctsaik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjcxODI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik/nativeApp/commit/6f9476d1ad82778227ba8c77699de4cc2cbaf4ce","node_id":"C_kwDOSg8bTdoAKDZmOTQ3NmQxYWQ4Mjc3ODIyN2JhOGM3NzY5OWRlNGNjMmNiYWY0Y2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik/nativeApp/commit/4ead2c8c9c3ccdd2ec7a66f4ce86875f2f2e92b8","sha":"4ead2c8c9c3ccdd2ec7a66f4ce86875f2f2e92b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/commits/4ead2c8c9c3ccdd2ec7a66f4ce86875f2f2e92b8"}],"sha":"6f9476d1ad82778227ba8c77699de4cc2cbaf4ce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/commits/6f9476d1ad82778227ba8c77699de4cc2cbaf4ce"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36671829?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik","id":36671829,"login":"hctsaik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjcxODI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/commits/4ead2c8c9c3ccdd2ec7a66f4ce86875f2f2e92b8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-28T13:25:51Z","email":"36671829+hctsaik@users.noreply.github.com","name":"hctsaik"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-28T13:25:51Z","email":"36671829+hctsaik@users.noreply.github.com","name":"hctsaik"},"message":"chore(startup): switch DEV launch to Tauri shell; document + redirect bats\n\nNew architecture: the shell moves from Electron to Tauri (nativeApp_Light),\nreusing the SAME portal dist + Python engine + cim-modules unchanged.\n\n- start-dev-tauri.bat: new Tauri DEV launcher (preflight submodules, check\n  Tauri project/node_modules/cargo/prebuilt-dist/Python3.11, clean stray engine,\n  set CIM_ENGINE_EXE=engine.py + CIM_ENGINE_PYTHON, run `npm run tauri:dev` in\n  ../nativeApp_Light/5_PG_Develop).\n- start-dev.bat / start-dev-nowdac.bat: now redirect to start-dev-tauri.bat.\n  Their old Electron logic is preserved as start-dev-electron.bat /\n  start-dev-nowdac-electron.bat (fallback only).\n- docs/platform/startup-tauri.md: authoritative startup doc with a full\n  inventory + disposition of every *.bat (so nothing is silently missed),\n  prerequisites, WDAC notes, and the no-19222 caveat.\n- CLAUDE.md (啟動方式/首次設定/啟動鏈), README, docs/INSTALL §6 updated to Tauri.\n- start-prod.bat / start-trusted.bat: non-breaking notice pointing at the Tauri\n  path (Tauri PROD = `npm run tauri:build`, signed nsis); PROD migration is next.\n\nRationale: Tauri dev loads the prebuilt portal dist (no Vite/esbuild → sidesteps\nthe local WDAC esbuild block); release `tauri build` produces a signed nsis\n(WDAC-friendly). Engine/portal/modules are shell-agnostic and unchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7cee8f4b9481959a3234e573986ae2d338bf8781","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/git/trees/7cee8f4b9481959a3234e573986ae2d338bf8781"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/git/commits/4ead2c8c9c3ccdd2ec7a66f4ce86875f2f2e92b8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36671829?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik","id":36671829,"login":"hctsaik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjcxODI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik/nativeApp/commit/4ead2c8c9c3ccdd2ec7a66f4ce86875f2f2e92b8","node_id":"C_kwDOSg8bTdoAKDRlYWQyYzhjOWMzY2NkZDJlYzdhNjZmNGNlODY4NzVmMmYyZTkyYjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik/nativeApp/commit/e37268e517bda1723f9f8813d635d1e935713a83","sha":"e37268e517bda1723f9f8813d635d1e935713a83","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/commits/e37268e517bda1723f9f8813d635d1e935713a83"}],"sha":"4ead2c8c9c3ccdd2ec7a66f4ce86875f2f2e92b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nati