folder''s manifest first (no manifest -> not complete).\n- tools/verify_deppack.py <folder>: CLI wrapper.\n- CP950 safety: both deppack CLIs strip emoji and reconfigure stdout/stderr with\n  errors=\"replace\" — they run on factory Traditional-Chinese consoles where a\n  stray non-CP950 char (e.g. an emoji) would otherwise crash print().\n- tests: 4 cases (complete / tampered / missing wheel / no manifest).\n\nTests: npm run test:python 715 passed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"add0f80b1169ed85c0a44116e7d1fff6f0f05a3b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/git/trees/add0f80b1169ed85c0a44116e7d1fff6f0f05a3b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/git/commits/f5d89b69fbedd7dfdc430e488ec5be72c17f3f93","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36671829?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik","id":36671829,"login":"hctsaik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjcxODI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik/nativeApp/commit/f5d89b69fbedd7dfdc430e488ec5be72c17f3f93","node_id":"C_kwDOSg8bTdoAKGY1ZDg5YjY5ZmJlZGQ3ZGZkYzQzMGU0ODhlYzViZTcyYzE3ZjNmOTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik/nativeApp/commit/4e3a76cb55fef60e32f60b99702e362ab881411f","sha":"4e3a76cb55fef60e32f60b99702e362ab881411f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/commits/4e3a76cb55fef60e32f60b99702e362ab881411f"}],"sha":"f5d89b69fbedd7dfdc430e488ec5be72c17f3f93","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/commits/f5d89b69fbedd7dfdc430e488ec5be72c17f3f93"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36671829?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik","id":36671829,"login":"hctsaik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjcxODI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/commits/4e3a76cb55fef60e32f60b99702e362ab881411f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-17T17:21:32Z","email":"36671829+hctsaik@users.noreply.github.com","name":"hctsaik"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-17T17:21:32Z","email":"36671829+hctsaik@users.noreply.github.com","name":"hctsaik"},"message":"feat(deppack): produce wheelhouse pack + offline-install into per-tool venv (P3 core)\n\nImplements the critical chain of docs/platform/modules-independence-and-store-plan.md\n§6: let a machine with no Python / no environment install heavy deps (LV''s torch\n~2GB, etc.) OFFLINE — an agent/store copies a pre-downloaded wheelhouse to the\ndevice, and the platform builds the isolated per-tool venv from it via\n`pip --no-index`, with per-file sha256 verification (fail-closed on tamper).\n\n- core/deppack.py: build_wheelhouse() (pip download -> wheelhouse), compute/\n  verify_wheelhouse() (per-wheel sha256), DepPackManifest (requires_fingerprint\n  + python_tag/platform_tag), device-side cache (CIM_DEPPACK_CACHE, default\n  .deppack-cache/, not tied to log-dir), prepare_tool_wheelhouse() (returns the\n  wheelhouse only if verified; raises DepPackError otherwise).\n- core/tool_deps.py: _resolve_wheelhouse() prefers a verified per-tool dep-pack\n  cache (offline pip --no-index) -> CIM_WHEELHOUSE -> online PyPI; a present-but-\n  invalid dep-pack is FAIL-CLOSED (never silently falls back to PyPI). Public\n  requires_fingerprint shared with deppack. Engine unchanged — both _make_env and\n  _prewarm call sites benefit automatically.\n- tools/build_deppack.py: CLI to build a tool''s dep-pack from its plugin.yaml\n  requires: (cross-platform --platform/--python-version/--abi; --dry-run preview).\n- tests/test_deppack.py (20): build/manifest/verify/tamper-missing-extra detection,\n  cross-platform command assembly, prepare 3-state, tool_deps offline install +\n  fail-closed + no-pack-falls-online.\n- .gitignore: .deppack-cache/. Docs: §11 as-built + per-tool-dependencies note.\n\nTests: npm run test:python 711 passed / 1 skipped / 1 xpassed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"000032c37ce70492d5f30151e44ed3095abe4be2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/git/trees/000032c37ce70492d5f30151e44ed3095abe4be2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/git/commits/4e3a76cb55fef60e32f60b99702e362ab881411f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.co