hctsaik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/commits/fec8f353121bffc983a3c526c25c9ce64232f29c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-17T14:48:31Z","email":"36671829+hctsaik@users.noreply.github.com","name":"hctsaik"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-17T14:48:31Z","email":"36671829+hctsaik@users.noreply.github.com","name":"hctsaik"},"message":"feat(modules): extract first-party CV modules into cim-modules submodule\n\nSplits scripts/module_{001-005,007,021} + frame_fit_score.py out of the\nplatform into a standalone repo (nativeApp_modules), mounted back as a git\nsubmodule at sidecar/python-engine/plugins/cim-modules/ — mirroring the LV /\nAI4BI pattern. Reached after a two-layer multi-agent design review (5 expert\nlenses -> v2 -> 2 convergence arbiters, both GO). Design + decisions:\ndocs/platform/modules-independence-and-store-plan.md.\n\nWhy engine/loader need no change: the modules now sit at\nplugins/cim-modules/modules/module_xxx/, which the existing scan glob\n(plugins/*/modules/*/plugin.yaml) and dual-root plugin_loader already cover.\n\nChanges:\n- modules moved to the cim-modules submodule (pinned); .gitmodules url ->\n  github.com/hctsaik/nativeApp_modules.\n- reverse host-path lookups rebased +2 depth (same as labeling''s\n  plugins/*/modules/ depth); frame_fit_score.py -> modules/_shared/.\n- tests/test_modules_platform_contract.py: freeze the host dependency surface\n  to core.* + scripts/shared/{_config_base,_help} (measured real surface).\n- scaffold module --dest defaults to cim-modules when present, with a\n  submodule commit/push reminder.\n- check_submodules()/preflight-submodules.bat detect a missing cim-modules\n  checkout (fresh clone without --recurse-submodules).\n- test_module_roots / test_orphan_sheet: resolve via dual-root loader instead\n  of hard-coded scripts/ paths. make-source-bundle.ps1 $mounts (untracked) gets\n  the cim-modules mount.\n- docs: repo-topology.md, CLAUDE.md updated for the new submodule.\n\nTests: npm run test:python 691 passed/1 skipped/1 xpassed; npm test 20 passed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"02ece898353f6455dfd8d967dae056bda0593f0c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/git/trees/02ece898353f6455dfd8d967dae056bda0593f0c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/git/commits/fec8f353121bffc983a3c526c25c9ce64232f29c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36671829?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik","id":36671829,"login":"hctsaik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjcxODI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik/nativeApp/commit/fec8f353121bffc983a3c526c25c9ce64232f29c","node_id":"C_kwDOSg8bTdoAKGZlYzhmMz