}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik","id":36671829,"login":"hctsaik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjcxODI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/commits/9c9bea30eba2afe302b2db0357bc67f335f7165a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-14T11:34:33Z","email":"36671829+hctsaik@users.noreply.github.com","name":"hctsaik"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-14T11:34:33Z","email":"36671829+hctsaik@users.noreply.github.com","name":"hctsaik"},"message":"chore(lv): bump vendor/LV submodule to integrated uihuang_dev\n\nPin vendor/LV to uihuang_dev @1b08844, which now combines:\n- uihuang''s 桶① physical-detectability gate (H0) + per-image-type self-correction\n  (signal_strength.py / calibrate_signal_gate.py / interaction.diagnose_root_cause\n  caveat), and\n- the LV→Labeling one-way hand-over (inbox + quiz round-trip removed).\n\nIntegrated by rebasing the one-way work onto uihuang_dev (zero conflicts — the\ntwo changesets touch disjoint app.py regions) and fast-forwarding uihuang_dev.\nSmoke + signal_strength (13) + close-out (4) tests pass on the combined tree.\nThe pin now matches .gitmodules branch=uihuang_dev.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"80726635b6209898d615a94821f8f9cbc13a8aff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/git/trees/80726635b6209898d615a94821f8f9cbc13a8aff"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/git/commits/9c9bea30eba2afe302b2db0357bc67f335f7165a","verification":{"payload":null,"re