github.com/hctsaik","id":36671829,"login":"hctsaik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjcxODI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/commits/eb4395518c65b492c12de22698b6f53f256b4c0d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-14T11:24:23Z","email":"36671829+hctsaik@users.noreply.github.com","name":"hctsaik"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-14T11:24:23Z","email":"36671829+hctsaik@users.noreply.github.com","name":"hctsaik"},"message":"feat(lv): wire LV one-way hand-over into the platform (portal nav + submodule + BDD)\n\n- portal (main.jsx) + shared-protocol: OPEN_TOOL message type + handler so an LV\n  send auto-switches the portal to the Labeling sheet (sheet-annotation).\n- Register vendor/LV as a submodule (.gitmodules) and pin it to the one-way\n  hand-over commit (inbox + quiz round-trip removed; see LV repo\n  feat/lv-oneway-handoff). NOTE: pinned commit currently lives on the LV\n  feature branch and still needs reconciling with uihuang_dev''s newer app.py work.\n- tests/bdd/lv: reusable MCP-driven BDD suite (20 scenarios, features + runner +\n  fixtures + evidence) and tools/lv_e2e_smoke.py (engine-driven launch smoke);\n  the unified-handoff feature doc updated to the one-way model.\n- tools/lv_prebuild_deps.py: pre-build LV''s per-tool venv deps.\n- start-dev.bat: resolve a real Python (uvicorn/fastapi) and pass it to Electron;\n  stray-engine cleanup; CRLF/ASCII-safe.\n- .gitignore: ignore sidecar/python-engine/.tool-venvs/ (per-tool venv cache).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 