/36671829?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik","id":36671829,"login":"hctsaik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjcxODI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/commits/e67c7dcd5c6d584f3520c422f01c4825c302ab7a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-14T01:04:15Z","email":"36671829+hctsaik@users.noreply.github.com","name":"hctsaik"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-14T01:04:15Z","email":"36671829+hctsaik@users.noreply.github.com","name":"hctsaik"},"message":"chore(labeling): mount labeling as external plugin (junction) instead of submodule\n\nLabeling is developed in its own repo (ANnoTation). Instead of vendoring it as a\ngit submodule under plugins/labeling, the platform now references it as an\nexternal plugin: clone ANnoTation beside nativeApp and mount it at\nplugins/labeling via a directory junction (scripts/win/link-labeling.bat),\ngitignored. Discovery/import need no platform code changes; the submodule\npreflight now reports labeling as kind=external with the junction fix, while\nAI4BI stays a git submodule.\n\nUpdated engine.py (+test), preflight-submodules.bat, verify-setup.ps1, README,\nrequirements/engine.spec comments, and the independence plan (P4). The plugin''s\nown path anchors were made junction-safe in the ANnoTation repo.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8a45c955f217e2fd9595c78ec0125bcb9937b056","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/git/trees/8a45c955f217e2fd9595c78ec0125bcb9937b056"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/git/commits/e67c7dcd5c6d584f3520c422f01c4825c302ab7a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36671829?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik","id":36671829,"login":"hctsaik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjcxODI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik/nativeApp/commit/e67c7dcd5c6d584f3520c422f01c4825c302ab7a","node_id":"C_kwDOSg8bTdoAKGU2N2M3ZGNkNWM2ZDU4NGYzNTIwYzQyMmYwMWM0ODI1YzMwMmFiN2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik/nativeApp/commit/f0db714dced4fda8c589a9e6ed9cbd528006f86e","sha":"f0db714dced4fda8c589a9e6ed9cbd528006f86e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/commits/f0db714dced4fda8c589a9e6ed9cbd528006f86e"}],"sha":"e67c7dcd5c6d584f3520c422f01c4825c302ab7a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/commits/e67c7dcd5c6d584f3520c422f01c4825c302ab7a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36671829?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik","id":36671829,"login":"hctsaik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjcxODI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/commits/f0db714dced4fda8c589a9e6ed9cbd528006f86e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-14T00:56:46Z","email":"36671829+hctsaik@users.noreply.github.com","name":"hctsaik"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-14T00:56:46Z","email":"36671829+hctsaik@users.noreply.github.com","name":"hctsaik"},"message":"feat(lv): 加入 VisualLatent (LV) 為 app 類型 plugin（runner + 宣告 + 測試）\n\n把 LV（資料策展 / 嵌入分析，獨立 repo）以「app 類型工具」掛進平台，鏡像 AI4BI 的\n「連結不複製」模型。本 commit 只含乾淨新增的三件，刻意不含 vendor/LV submodule、\n.gitmodules 與 engine.py registry 那一行——那些與進行中的 platform-restructure 改到\n同檔，留給該 restructure 一起提交。\n\n- tools/lv_runner.py：薄 runner。LV 是 flat scripts（非 package），故把 vendor/LV/scripts\n  塞 sys.path → runpy 跑 app.py（程序隔離避撞名，免重打包）。模型權重不入 submodule，\n  由 LV_MODELS_DIR / LV_INCEPTION_DIR 指向 model-house。\n- plugins/lv/：plugin.manifest.yaml + modules/app-lv/plugin.yaml（id app-lv → category app；\n  runner lv；requires 鏡像 LV 14 個重相依走 per-tool venv）。module 資料夾須名為 app-lv，\n  _start_app 才讀得到 requires（find_module_folder direct-match tool_id）。\n- tests/test_lv_app_wiring.py：5 個接線測試。\n\n實機驗證：透過此 runner 從 vendor/LV 啟動 LV，五工具皆出、模型經 env 解析、零例外。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"39b133f438a4ec3c8cfdbc3efeeddb22a3b59a80","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/git/trees/39b133f438a4ec3c8cfdbc3efeeddb22a3b59a80"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/git/commits/f0db714dced4fda8c589a9e6ed9cbd528006f86e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36671829?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik","id":36671829,"login":"hctsaik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjcxODI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik/nativeApp/commit/f0db714dced4fda8c589a9e6ed9cbd528006f86e","node_id":"C_kwDOSg8bTdoAKGYwZGI3MTRkY2VkNGZkYThjNTg5YTllNmVkOWNiZDUyODAwNmY4NmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik/nativeApp/commit/054bc7349247073448adfe8639151f6f4347179a","sha":"054bc7349247073448adfe8639151f6f4347179a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/commits/054bc7349247073448adfe8639151f6f4347179a"}],"sha":"f0db714dced4fda8c589a9e6ed9cbd528006f86e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/commits/f0db714dced4fda8c589a9e6ed9cbd528006f86e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36671829?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik","id":36671829,"login":"hctsaik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjcxODI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/commits/054bc7349247073448adfe8639151f6f4347179a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-07T07:03:18Z","email":"36671829+hctsaik@users.noreply.github.com","name":"hctsaik"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-07T07:04:04Z","email":"36671829+hctsaik@users.noreply.github.com","name":"hctsaik"},"message":"Fix frozen Streamlit so packaged tools actually launch (metadata + devMode)\n\nEnd-to-end frozen verification revealed that NO Streamlit tool had ever launched\nin a packaged exe (this is why frozen e2e was still an open TODO). Two packaging\nbugs, both unrelated to timeouts:\n\n1. streamlit''s .dist-info was not bundled, so streamlit/version.py''s\n   importlib.metadata.version(''streamlit'') raised PackageNotFoundError and every\n   tool subprocess crashed on \"import streamlit\".\n   Fix: engine.spec copy_metadata(''streamlit'', recursive=True) (45 dists).\n2. In the frozen exe streamlit defaults global.developmentMode=true, which\n   forbids --server.port -> RuntimeError, killing the subprocess.\n   Fix: run_streamlit_script sets STREAMLIT_GLOBAL_DEVELOPMENT_MODE=false\n   (already false in dev, so no-op there).\n\nVerified against the packaged binaries: a real cv_framework \"requires: cowsay\"\ntool now starts with HTTP 200 in ~10s, building its per-tool venv via the\nbundled standalone Python. (Not yet verified: Streamlit frontend static\nrendering in the packaged Electron app -- needs a GUI smoke test.)\n\nAlso keeps a defensive improvement (not the 500 cause): _prewarm_deps_and_timeout\nbuilds the per-tool venv before spawn (off the readiness budget) and gives\nrequires: tools a longer first-launch readiness wait; covers _start_regular,\n_start_app and sheet tabs. 3 new unit tests in test_tool_deps.\n\nnpm run test:python: 682 passed, 1 xpassed; host-electron: 20 passed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cf97e8434f42b03d0f0bd64ee2c02cd0e0c802a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/git/trees/cf97e8434f42b03d0f0bd64ee2c02cd0e0c802a1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/git/commits/054bc7349247073448adfe8639151f6f4347179a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36671829?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik","id":36671829,"login":"hctsaik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjcxODI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik/nativeApp/commit/054bc7349247073448adfe8639151f6f4347179a","node_id":"C_kwDOSg8bTdoAKDA1NGJjNzM0OTI0NzA3MzQ0OGFkZmU4NjM5MTUxZjZmNDM0NzE3OWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik/nativeApp/commit/3d4acf6b3c83c7d41a25955139953edd634f1480","sha":"3d4acf6b3c83c7d41a25955139953edd634f1480","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/commits/3d4acf6b3c83c7d41a25955139953edd634f1480"}],"sha":"054bc7349247073448adfe8639151f6f4347179a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/commits/054bc7349247073448adfe8639151f6f4347179a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36671829?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik","id":36671829,"login":"hctsaik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjcxODI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/commits/3d4acf6b3c83c7d41a25955139953edd634f1480/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-07T06:15:55Z","email":"36671829+hctsaik@users.noreply.github.com","name":"hctsaik"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-07T06:15:55Z","email":"36671829+hctsaik@users.noreply.github.com","name":"hctsaik"},"message":"Verify frozen per-tool venv end-to-end; make build-release.bat codepage-safe\n\n- build-release.bat: ''chcp 65001'' so cmd parses/echoes the UTF-8 Chinese lines\n  correctly regardless of the console''s default codepage (cp950 misaligned the\n  multibyte bytes and silently skipped the real build steps).\n- per-tool-dependencies.md: record the end-to-end frozen verification result and\n  a known first-run UX edge case.\n\nVerified against the packaged binaries (release/win-unpacked): the frozen\nengine.exe, given CIM_PYTHON pointing at the bundled standalone Python, built a\nper-tool venv for a ''requires: cowsay'' tool at runtime\n(engine.log: ''Per-tool deps ready ... [cowsay]'' then ''(cached)''; cowsay present\nin the venv). A clean machine with no system Python can now run requires: tools.\n\nKnown finding: a requires: tool''s FIRST start can 500 because the synchronous\npip install blocks the spawn past the readiness wait; second start (cached) is\nfine. Mitigation noted in the doc (prebuild venv / async install / longer first\ntimeout).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"00b5ac3709b7ff8d1b597daf4907e5da51a072c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/git/trees/00b5ac3709b7ff8d1b597daf4907e5da51a072c9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/git/commits/3d4acf6b3c83c7d41a25955139953edd634f1480","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36671829?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik","id":36671829,"login":"hctsaik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjcxODI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik/nativeApp/commit/3d4acf6b3c83c7d41a25955139953edd634f1480","node_id":"C_kwDOSg8bTdoAKDNkNGFjZjZiM2M4M2M3ZDQxYTI1OTU1MTM5OTUzZWRkNjM0ZjE0ODA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik/nativeApp/commit/2da21768cb934ffe52b98998ea3230d00d32ae1c","sha":"2da21768cb934ffe52b98998ea3230d00d32ae1c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/commits/2da21768cb934ffe52b98998ea3230d00d32ae1c"}],"sha":"3d4acf6b3c83c7d41a25955139953edd634f1480","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/commits/3d4acf6b3c83c7d41a25955139953edd634f1480"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36671829?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik","id":36671829,"login":"hctsaik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjcxODI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/commits/2da21768cb934ffe52b98998ea3230d00d32ae1c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T19:47:56Z","email":"36671829+hctsaik@users.noreply.github.com","name":"hctsaik"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T19:47:56Z","email":"36671829+hctsaik@users.noreply.github.com","name":"hctsaik"},"message":"Bundle a standalone Python 3.11 in releases for per-tool venvs\n\nFrozen engine.exe has a read-only embedded Python and cannot ''python -m venv''\nitself, so a tool that declares ''requires:'' needs a real external interpreter.\nShip one with the release so a clean factory machine needs no separately\ninstalled Python.\n\n- scripts/win/fetch-standalone-python.ps1: download a relocatable\n  python-build-standalone 3.11 (full stdlib + pip + venv, unlike the embeddable\n  zip) into apps/host-electron/python-runtime/. Version pinned to 3.11 to stay\n  ABI-compatible with the frozen engine (per-tool venv site-packages are injected\n  into the frozen engine''s PYTHONPATH). Idempotent; verifies venv+ensurepip.\n- package.json: extraResources copies it to resources/python/.\n- main.js: inject CIM_PYTHON=<resources>/python/python.exe when packaged (an\n  explicit CIM_PYTHON always wins); also use it for the source-engine fallback.\n- build-release.bat: add the fetch step before electron packaging.\n- electron-env.test.js: assert the CIM_PYTHON wiring + extraResources entry.\n- .gitignore: python-runtime/ (fetched at build time, ~150MB).\n- docs: per-tool-dependencies (frozen base_python now provided) + package-build.\n\nVerified for real: with the staged Python as CIM_PYTHON under simulated frozen,\ncore/tool_deps.ensure_tool_deps built a venv, pip-installed cowsay, and imported\nit via the injected PYTHONPATH. Full packaged in-app run remains the last step.\n\nnpm test: 20 passed; test_tool_deps: 26 passed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2ca007c0f27c3a6571ee22482afee0bdcf0e30af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/git/trees/2ca007c0f27c3a6571ee22482afee0bdcf0e30af"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/git/commits/2da21768cb934ffe52b98998ea3230d00d32ae1c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36671829?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik","id":36671829,"login":"hctsaik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjcxODI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik/nativeApp/commit/2da21768cb934ffe52b98998ea3230d00d32ae1c","node_id":"C_kwDOSg8bTdoAKDJkYTIxNzY4Y2I5MzRmZmU1MmI5ODk5OGVhMzIzMGQwMGQzMmFlMWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik/nativeApp/commit/b8aee8a398e0296c397eaa89bd2439b46a02cde1","sha":"b8aee8a398e0296c397eaa89bd2439b46a02cde1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/commits/b8aee8a398e0296c397eaa89bd2439b46a02cde1"}],"sha":"2da21768cb934ffe52b98998ea3230d00d32ae1c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/commits/2da21768cb934ffe52b98998ea3230d00d32ae1c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36671829?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik","id":36671829,"login":"hctsaik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjcxODI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/commits/b8aee8a398e0296c397eaa89bd2439b46a02cde1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T19:25:25Z","email":"36671829+hctsaik@users.noreply.github.com","name":"hctsaik"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T19:25:25Z","email":"36671829+hctsaik@users.noreply.github.com","name":"hctsaik"},"message":"Keep platform lean: plugin heavy deps belong to plugins, not the core\n\nThe platform repo is the host; labeling and AI4BI are separate git submodules\nthat own their own heavy deps. The core was leaking plugin-specific packages,\ncoupling the platform to its plugins. Restore the separation:\n\n- requirements.txt: drop ultralytics / streamlit-image-annotation /\n  streamlit-autorefresh (labeling-only, already in\n  plugins/labeling/requirements-labeling.txt). Core stays plugin-agnostic.\n- engine.spec: do NOT bundle plugin heavy deps (torch / plotly / duckdb / ai4bi)\n  into the frozen engine.exe; plugins install their deps into per-tool venvs at\n  runtime (core/tool_deps.py, #7).\n- test_packaging_guards: add test_engine_spec_does_not_bundle_plugin_heavy_deps\n  to block re-coupling the platform to a plugin via collect_all.\n- start-dev.bat / start-fleet.bat: auto-detect Python 3.11 via ''py -3.11''\n  (override with PYTHON) instead of a hardcoded user path.\n- verify-setup.ps1: mirror the new Python auto-detect.\n- README / INSTALL / AI4BI_INTEGRATION: lean-platform install + packaging model.\n- Bump labeling submodule: delete_tenant regression tests.\n\nnpm run test:python: 809 passed, 1 xpassed; npm test: 16 passed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4bc93d20e17042e17ac10e8358a044d829f8939d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/git/trees/4bc93d20e17042e17ac10e8358a044d829f8939d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/git/commits/b8aee8a398e0296c397eaa89bd2439b46a02cde1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36671829?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik","id":36671829,"login":"hctsaik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjcxODI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik/nativeApp/commit/b8aee8a398e0296c397eaa89bd2439b46a02cde1","node_id":"C_kwDOSg8bTdoAKGI4YWVlOGEzOThlMDI5NmMzOTdlYWE4OWJkMjQzOWI0NmEwMmNkZTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik/nativeApp/commit/ee466db7d13614c51359660d437c16cc3541924e","sha":"ee466db7d13614c51359660d437c16cc3541924e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/commits/ee466db7d13614c51359660d437c16cc3541924e"}],"sha":"b8aee8a398e0296c397eaa89bd2439b46a02cde1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/commits/b8aee8a398e0296c397eaa89bd2439b46a02cde1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36671829?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik","id":36671829,"login":"hctsaik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjcxODI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/commits/ee466db7d13614c51359660d437c16cc3541924e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T18:49:21Z","email":"36671829+hctsaik@users.noreply.github.com","name":"hctsaik"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T18:49:32Z","email":"36671829+hctsaik@users.noreply.github.com","name":"hctsaik"},"message":"Make declarative YAML the catalog source of truth; tools.sqlite is a derived cache\n\nCatalog definitions (tools/sheets) now come solely from declarative text:\neach plugin.yaml, sheet *.yaml, and a new config/seed.yaml for tools that\nhave no plugin.yaml. tools.sqlite becomes a per-device derived cache that is\nrebuilt idempotently on every boot, so it no longer belongs in version control.\n\n- Add config/seed.yaml (static_tools/disable_tools/prod_enable_tools/renames/\n  sheet_tab_deletions); engine reads it via _load_static_seed(), replacing the\n  hardcoded INSERT tuples in _seed_static_tools (diff-reviewable).\n- Delete the dead committed config/tools.sqlite (no code path read it) and\n  gitignore config/*.sqlite so it cannot be re-added.\n- Add ''engine --rebuild-catalog'' flag: deletes tools.sqlite before boot for a\n  guaranteed-clean rebuild (handy after a git pull).\n- engine.spec filters out *.sqlite so a dev machine cache is never frozen in.\n- /package-source mode A no longer bundles the runtime DB by default.\n- CI: test_catalog_rebuilds_identically_after_db_deleted + seed-from-yaml guard.\n- Update CLAUDE.md, guidance, package-source command, and the discussion doc.\n\nnpm run test:python: 678 passed, 1 xpassed; npm test: 16 passed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5310c99016b79817ea0c5d7c987671630b8a77f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/git/trees/5310c99016b79817ea0c5d7c987671630b8a77f2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/git/commits/ee466db7d13614c51359660d437c16cc3541924e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36671829?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik","id":36671829,"login":"hctsaik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjcxODI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik/nativeApp/commit/ee466db7d13614c51359660d437c16cc3541924e","node_id":"C_kwDOSg8bTdoAKGVlNDY2ZGI3ZDEzNjE0YzUxMzU5NjYwZDQzN2MxNmNjMzU0MTkyNGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik/nativeApp/commit/c2ee6134550b62ffcbdbf316db4f712c891148e7","sha":"c2ee6134550b62ffcbdbf316db4f712c891148e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/commits/c2ee6134550b62ffcbdbf316db4f712c891148e7"}],"sha":"ee466db7d13614c51359660d437c16cc3541924e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/commits/ee466db7d13614c51359660d437c16cc3541924e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36671829?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik","id":36671829,"login":"hctsaik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjcxODI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/commits/c2ee6134550b62ffcbdbf316db4f712c891148e7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-02T19:46:56Z","email":"36671829+hctsaik@users.noreply.github.com","name":"hctsaik"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-02T19:46:56Z","email":"36671829+hctsaik@users.noreply.github.com","name":"hctsaik"},"message":"Make orphan/broken catalog tools structurally unreachable + visible engine version\n\nPermanent prevention for the recurring \"Missing CIM_SHEET_ID or CIM_PLUGIN_ID\"\nclass of failure (P0 from the multi-agent prevention discussion). SQLite-centric:\nthe invariant is enforced on the DB, not via hard-coded per-id patches.\n\n1. Orphan auto-converge (general invariant, replaces whack-a-mole):\n   _reconcile_sheets_from_yaml now disables ANY enabled \"sheet-*\" tool that has\n   no wired tabs, logging [CIM-PREFLIGHT]. Such a tool can never launch (it would\n   spawn sheet_runner.py without CIM_PLUGIN_ID), so hiding it makes the cryptic\n   error unreachable from the dropdown. Runs on every init AND /reload, so\n   existing DBs self-heal on restart. Removed the hard-coded per-id DELETE of the\n   old garbage seed — the general rule now covers it.\n\n2. Engine version visibility: engine_commit() (git short hash, BUILD_COMMIT\n   fallback) + boot_id. Logged at boot as [CIM-BOOT] and exposed via /version and\n   /diagnostics, so \"am I running the fixed code or a stale sidecar?\" is\n   answerable at a glance — the #1 reason past fixes \"looked like they didn''t work.\"\n\n3. CI gate (test_catalog_invariant.py): asserts every enabled sheet tool has\n   wired tabs AND _make_env injects both CIM_SHEET_ID + CIM_PLUGIN_ID, and that an\n   injected orphan is auto-disabled on re-init. Reintroducing an orphan now fails\n   CI before shipping.\n\nTests: 676 passed (+5), JS 33 passed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"53d29e32cdc1810453c139f91cd2a80db63d5cce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/git/trees/53d29e32cdc1810453c139f91cd2a80db63d5cce"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/git/commits/c2ee6134550b62ffcbdbf316db4f712c891148e7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36671829?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik","id":36671829,"login":"hctsaik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjcxODI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik/nativeApp/commit/c2ee6134550b62ffcbdbf316db4f712c891148e7","node_id":"C_kwDOSg8bTdoAKGMyZWU2MTM0NTUwYjYyZmZjYmRiZjMxNmRiNGY3MTJjODkxMTQ4ZTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik/nativeApp/commit/857e682357a9646710c6904f3dd89eb677e46848","sha":"857e682357a9646710c6904f3dd89eb677e46848","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/commits/857e682357a9646710c6904f3dd89eb677e46848"}],"sha":"c2ee6134550b62ffcbdbf316db4f712c891148e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/commits/c2ee6134550b62ffcbdbf316db4f712c891148e7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36671829?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik","id":36671829,"login":"hctsaik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjcxODI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/commits/857e682357a9646710c6904f3dd89eb677e46848/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-02T19:03:35Z","email":"36671829+hctsaik@users.noreply.github.com","name":"hctsaik"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-02T19:03:35Z","email":"36671829+hctsaik@users.noreply.github.com","name":"hctsaik"},"message":"Fix orphaned sheet tools that failed with \"Missing CIM_SHEET_ID or CIM_PLUGIN_ID\"\n\nSecond root cause of the \"downloaded build doesn''t work\" report: two seeded\n\"sheet-*\" tools had no backing sheet definition, so on a fresh install they\nappeared in the catalog but failed on launch.\n\n- sheet-共用標註功能_-_套件: pure garbage -- a Chinese tool_id auto-derived from\n  a test sheet name that never had a YAML/tabs. Removed from the seed and added\n  an idempotent DELETE so existing DBs lose it too. Also cleaned from the\n  committed config/tools.sqlite.\n- sheet-edge-analysis (邊緣品質分析（套件）): a real, documented sheet that lost\n  its YAML in the sheet->YAML migration. Restored sheets/edge-analysis.yaml with\n  its 3 tabs (module_003/004/005, all enabled) so reconcile rebuilds it on every\n  fresh install.\n\nDefense in depth: _start_sheet no longer silently falls back to _start_regular\nwhen a sheet has no tabs (which launched sheet_runner.py without a plugin_id ->\nthe cryptic \"Missing CIM_SHEET_ID or CIM_PLUGIN_ID\"). It now raises a clear,\ngreppable [CIM-PREFLIGHT] error that surfaces to the portal as HTTP 500.\n\nVerified by building a fresh tools.sqlite through the real init path: garbage\ntool gone, edge-analysis wired with 3 tabs. Tests: test_orphan_sheet.py.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fd93ba862b9a4b40db8826f3084720c3d29ecb04","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/git/trees/fd93ba862b9a4b40db8826f3084720c3d29ecb04"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/git/commits/857e682357a9646710c6904f3dd89eb677e46848","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36671829?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik","id":36671829,"login":"hctsaik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjcxODI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik/nativeApp/commit/857e682357a9646710c6904f3dd89eb677e46848","node_id":"C_kwDOSg8bTdoAKDg1N2U2ODIzNTdhOTY0NjcxMGM2OTA0ZjNkZDg5ZWI2NzdlNDY4NDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik/nativeApp/commit/b4ebfd42ed0092b1a387a5ec8959021b7838799f","sha":"b4ebfd42ed0092b1a387a5ec8959021b7838799f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/commits/b4ebfd42ed0092b1a387a5ec8959021b7838799f"}],"sha":"857e682357a9646710c6904f3dd89eb677e46848","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/commits/857e682357a9646710c6904f3dd89eb677e46848"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36671829?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik","id":36671829,"login":"hctsaik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjcxODI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/commits/b4ebfd42ed0092b1a387a5ec8959021b7838799f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-02T18:40:51Z","email":"36671829+hctsaik@users.noreply.github.com","name":"hctsaik"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-02T18:40:51Z","email":"36671829+hctsaik@users.noreply.github.com","name":"hctsaik"},"message":"Add submodule preflight guard so missing-submodule installs fail loudly\n\nRoot cause of \"downloaded from GitHub but the workflow list differs and the\napp won''t start\": the project uses two git submodules (plugins/labeling,\nvendor/AI4BI). A GitHub \"Download ZIP\" or a non --recurse-submodules clone\nleaves those dirs empty, so the engine''s plugin/sheet globs silently match\nnothing -- tools vanish from the catalog with no error.\n\nTurn that silent failure into a loud, pasteable [CIM-PREFLIGHT] signal:\n\n- scripts/win/preflight-submodules.bat: shared sentinel-file check; the four\n  start-*.bat entry points call it and abort with an actionable message.\n  ASCII-only on purpose -- downloaders'' machines are often CP950, where UTF-8\n  echo gets mojibaked and can corrupt cmd parsing.\n- engine.py: check_submodules()/preflight_submodules() log a bilingual\n  [CIM-PREFLIGHT] error to engine.log and surface missing_submodules via\n  /diagnostics. Does NOT sys.exit (would trigger Electron''s auto-restart loop);\n  skipped in frozen builds.\n- README.md / docs/INSTALL.md: explicit \"do not use Download ZIP\" warning +\n  recurse-submodules clone; INSTALL branch updated to main.\n- tests: test_submodule_preflight.py + a /diagnostics shape assertion.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6cdbc3dcec0f8b2513685f3051e2e341bfcfbf13","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/git/trees/6cdbc3dcec0f8b2513685f3051e2e341bfcfbf13"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/git/commits/b4ebfd42ed0092b1a387a5ec8959021b7838799f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36671829?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik","id":36671829,"login":"hctsaik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjcxODI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik/nativeApp/commit/b4ebfd42ed0092b1a387a5ec8959021b7838799f","node_id":"C_kwDOSg8bTdoAKGI0ZWJmZDQyZWQwMDkyYjFhMzg3YTVlYzg5NTkwMjFiNzgzODc5OWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik/nativeApp/commit/795ba5b37d695a1dfb59bd835e5e4500cfad86e3","sha":"795ba5b37d695a1dfb59bd835e5e4500cfad86e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/commits/795ba5b37d695a1dfb59bd835e5e4500cfad86e3"}],"sha":"b4ebfd42ed0092b1a387a5ec8959021b7838799f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/commits/b4ebfd42ed0092b1a387a5ec8959021b7838799f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36671829?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik","id":36671829,"login":"hctsaik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjcxODI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/commits/795ba5b37d695a1dfb59bd835e5e4500cfad86e3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-01T23:21:40Z","email":"36671829+hctsaik@users.noreply.github.com","name":"hctsaik"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-01T23:21:47Z","email":"36671829+hctsaik@users.noreply.github.com","name":"hctsaik"},"message":"Bump AI4BI submodule to Round 186 (CV dataset-management demo + NL generalization)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2cefe7b79b2da0f5c598fcfcf7fd7703513ea635","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/git/trees/2cefe7b79b2da0f5c598fcfcf7fd7703513ea635"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/git/commits/795ba5b37d695a1dfb59bd835e5e4500cfad86e3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36671829?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik","id":36671829,"login":"hctsaik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjcxODI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik/nativeApp/commit/795ba5b37d695a1dfb59bd835e5e4500cfad86e3","node_id":"C_kwDOSg8bTdoAKDc5NWJhNWIzN2Q2OTVhMWRmYjU5YmQ4MzVlNWU0NTAwY2Zh