ps://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik","id":36671829,"login":"hctsaik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjcxODI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/commits/14fd9a6750e3f15980e62a52cb396470847abfb7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-01T18:44:48Z","email":"36671829+hctsaik@users.noreply.github.com","name":"hctsaik"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-01T18:44:48Z","email":"36671829+hctsaik@users.noreply.github.com","name":"hctsaik"},"message":"feat: per-tool dependencies (#7) + fleet distribution (#1)\n\nPer-tool deps: a tool declares `requires:` in plugin.yaml; engine builds an\nisolated per-tool venv and prepends its site-packages onto the Streamlit\nsubprocess PYTHONPATH. core/tool_deps.py (fingerprint cache for instant\nre-runs, file lock, frozen-exe external-Python fallback), wired into engine\n_make_env; scaffold gains --requires. Offline via CIM_WHEELHOUSE.\n\nFleet distribution: core/distribution ToolDistributionSource\n(LocalFsSource/HttpRegistrySource) with HMAC-signed artifacts; fetch verifies\nthe signature so tampered/unsigned code is rejected. tools/registry_server.py\n(File/Sqlite DAL), tools/fleet_publish.py, and start-fleet.bat simulate a\n1-registry + 2-device fleet on one machine. engine pulls approved artifacts\ninto the local catalog, env-gated by CIM_DISTRIBUTION_SOURCE (no-op when\nunset; default single-machine behaviour unchanged) and re-pulls on /reload.\n\nDocs: docs/platform/{per-tool-dependencies,fleet-distribution}.md; updated\nCLAUDE.md, README, shared-components.md.\n\nTests: 663 passed (tool_deps 26, distribution+registry 43, integration 3\nincl. tamper-rejection, scaffold +2); JS 33 passed; live HTTP loopback smoke.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4ab36c246ac104a882afbac390559960bb35735e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/git/trees/4ab36c246ac104a882afbac390559960bb35735e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hctsaik/nativeApp/git/commits/14fd9a6750e3f15980e62a52cb396470847abfb7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36671829?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik","id":36671829,"login":"hctsaik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjcxODI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hctsaik","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hctsaik/nativeApp/commit/14fd9a6750e3f15980e62a52cb396470847abfb7","node_id":"C_kwDOSg8bTdoAKDE0ZmQ5YTY3NTBlM2YxNTk4MGU2MmE1MmNiMzk2NDcwODQ3YWJmYjc"