ithub.com/users/syedhaffiz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commits/9c37174d47f54d5635348233bdb6688a180f8dcc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T06:51:39Z","email":"haffizsyed@gmail.com","name":"Syed Haffiz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T06:51:39Z","email":"haffizsyed@gmail.com","name":"Syed Haffiz"},"message":"Add Debtors overview, components & mocks\n\nIntroduce a Debtors overview screen and supporting UI: aging tiles, segment/group breakdown, receivables donut, and receivable tile cards. Add DebtorsOverview page, new components under components/finance/debtors, and move/rename existing Debtors components/files. Update routes (overview + table), rename Debtors -> DebtorsTable, and wire a new debtorsOverview API endpoint. Extend mocks with buildDebtorsOverview and canonical AGINGS, adjust BOOK aging logic. Add types (DebtorsOverviewResponse, DebtorsBreakdownItem, DebtorsAgingBucket), tokens (debtorsColors, receivable colors), and formatMoneyCompact helper.","tree":{"sha":"eaaf9d34cd762ce4f38bce70d8f0de9280fb55cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/git/trees/eaaf9d34cd762ce4f38bce70d8f0de9280fb55cf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/git/commits/9c37174d47f54d5635348233bdb6688a180f8dcc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25886784?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/s