mail.com","name":"Syed Haffiz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T04:32:37Z","email":"haffizsyed@gmail.com","name":"Syed Haffiz"},"message":"Refactor Market Share filters to hybrid single/multi model\n\nChange Share filter to single-select (Adani/Non-Adani party selection) and convert all other dropdowns to multi-select. Update Category list to business types (Trader/End User/etc) instead of parties.\n\nUI improvements:\n- Applied filter tags now display one pill per selected value for multi-select filters\n- Enhanced tag styling with custom borders and backgrounds for light/dark themes\n- Better visual separation of filter label and value in tags\n\nState management refactoring:\n- Replace MS_SINGLE_FIELDS with MS_DRAWER_FIELDS metadata that tracks multi flag\n- Unify all multi-select filters into MS_MULTI_KEYS (including zone, port, origin, etc)\n- Replace setSingleBatch with setMany for atomic multi-key updates\n- Simplify drawer component to work with both single and multi-select via uniform Draft structure","tree":{"sha":"45a2f28aa7e4d3056c433e863357cab00b27fa14","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/git/trees/45a2f28aa7e4d3056c433e863357cab00b27fa14"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/git/commits/6a776368e8e15c0eba721c7cf03b1710d48b4e0c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25886784?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/syedhaffiz","id":25886784,"login":"syedhaffiz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1ODg2Nzg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commit/6a776368e8e15c0eba721c7cf03b1710d48b4e0c","node_id":"C_kwDOSh0tt9oAKDZhNzc2MzY4ZThlMTVjMGViYTcyMWM3Y2YwM2IxNzEwZDQ4YjRlMGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commit/d63a8ee07e4c9d200f09131cf3435a92de184cd2","sha":"d63a8ee07e4c9d200f09131cf3435a92de184cd2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commits/d63a8ee07e4c9d200f09131cf3435a92de184cd2"}],"sha":"6a776368e8e15c0eba721c7cf03b1710d48b4e0c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commits/6a776368e8e15c0eba721c7cf03b1710d48b4e0c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25886784?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/syedhaffiz","id":25886784,"login":"syedhaffiz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1ODg2Nzg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commits/d63a8ee07e4c9d200f09131cf3435a92de184cd2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-06T04:21:12Z","email":"haffizsyed@gmail.com","name":"Syed Haffiz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T04:21:12Z","email":"haffizsyed@gmail.com","name":"Syed Haffiz"},"message":"Market Share UI & mock API revamp\n\nRewrite Market Share into seven independent cards and URL-backed filters. Adds new components (MultiSelectFilter, AppliedFilterTags, MarketShareFilters, MarketShareFilterDrawer, MarketShareSplitCard, PairedColumnCard, QuarterwiseImportCard) and the useMarketShareFilters hook. Replaces old drilldown/shipper components and moves to per-card API endpoints in frontend/src/api/marketing.ts with matching mock builders in mocks/marketing.ts. Extends catalog with filter lists, updates types (paired rows, quarter groups, filter option shapes) and theme tokens (per-card color pairs + series labels). MarketSharePage updated to use new layout and filter flow. Note: old marketShare/marketShareDrill endpoints/components removed.","tree":{"sha":"e6ad1ca6a0001f8ccc3f12f22ece240993452fad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/git/trees/e6ad1ca6a0001f8ccc3f12f22ece240993452fad"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/git/commits/d63a8ee07e4c9d200f09131cf3435a92de184cd2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25886784?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_ur