 displays ports belonging to the selected zone and resets to ''All'' when the zone changes.\n\nChanges:\n- Add GET /filters/ports endpoint that returns ports for a given zone\n- Create RevenuePortFilter component that loads ports dynamically per zone\n- Add zone-port mappings to mock catalogs\n- Reset port filter when zone changes (single URL update to avoid conflicts)\n- Normalize ''all'' values in revenue mock data for consistent seeding","tree":{"sha":"edc582bb75b2d82e0be65384b84c480ae3aa3b7f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/git/trees/edc582bb75b2d82e0be65384b84c480ae3aa3b7f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/git/commits/08c394ad64e3b6f67be6c618c074f70c585d603c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25886784?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/syedhaffiz","id":25886784,"login":"syedhaffiz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1ODg2Nzg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commit/08c394ad64e3b6f67be6c618c074f70c585d603c","node_id":"C_kwDOSh0tt9oAKDA4YzM5NGFkNjRlM2I2ZjY3YmU2YzYxO