repository/types/mocks updated to accept zone, port and Currency (INR/USD), mock converts INR→USD and returns deltas and portwise budget/actual. Frontend: API types and mocks updated; new components added (BudgetActualColumnChart, DeltaStat, RevenueFilters); Revenue page refactored to use URL-backed filters, currency toggle, currency-aware KPI/donut formatting and a Port Wise bar chart. Removed legacy PeriodToggle, RevenueChildLinks, ledger column helpers and Port/Segment pages; routes updated. Also added design asset. Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"52b9e61027dea9efed3f09daabf8ef52d94145bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/git/trees/52b9e61027dea9efed3f09daabf8ef52d94145bf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/git/commits/3c818cd28c90c03d12683bf2fd6b93c34f9bc832","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25886784?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/syedhaffiz","id":25886784,"login":"syedhaffiz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1ODg2Nzg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commit/3c818cd28c90c03d12683bf2fd6b93c34f9bc832","node_id":"C_kwDOSh0tt9oAKDNjODE4Y2QyOGM5MGMwM2QxMjY4M2JmMmZkNmI5M2MzNGY5YmM4MzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commit/0cbf24a158f981a0819178ca3ef841d499e051eb","sha":"0cbf24a158f981a0819178ca3ef841d499e051eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commits/0cbf24a158f981a0819178ca3ef841d499e051eb"}],"sha":"3c818cd28c90c03d12683bf2fd6b93c34f9bc832","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commits/3c818cd28c90c03d12683bf2fd6b93c34f9bc832"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25886784?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/syedhaffiz","id":25886784,"login":"syedhaffiz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1ODg2Nzg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commits/0cbf24a158f981a0819178ca3ef841d499e051eb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-02T19:29:20Z","email":"haffizsyed@gmail.com","name":"Syed Haffiz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-02T19:29:20Z","email":"haffizsyed@gmail.com","name":"Syed Haffiz"},"message":"Remove RevenuePeriod; use date-range presets\n\nDrop the RevenuePeriod type and the `period` query/response across backend and frontend. Backend: controller/service/repository/types/mocks updated to accept only from/to dates and OpenAPI spec no longer exposes a `period` parameter or response field. Frontend: replaced PeriodToggle with PeriodSelect and presetOf logic that derives YTD/MTD from the date-range (None for custom ranges), updated API calls to stop sending period. Mocks and scaling logic adjusted accordingly. This treats presets as a client-side derived convenience and makes the date range the single source of truth.","tree":{"sha":"b0764ba9ddcc8497c97c74d5bbe670e318248dc4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/git/trees/b0764ba9ddcc8497c97c74d5bbe670e318248dc4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/git/commits/0cbf24a158f981a0819178ca3ef841d499e051eb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25886784?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/syedhaffiz","id":25886784,"login":"syedhaffiz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1ODg2Nzg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commit/0cbf24a158f981a0819178ca3ef841d499e051eb","node_id":"C_kwDOSh0tt9oAKDBjYmYyNGExNThmOTgxYTA4MTkxNzhjYTNlZjg0MWQ0OTllMDUxZWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commit/099e3d346a71954781986b39767d6030ec406cd5","sha":"099e3d346a71954781986b39767d6030ec406cd5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commits/099e3d346a71954781986b39767d6030ec406cd5"}],"sha":"0cbf24a158f981a0819178ca3ef841d499e051eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commits/0cbf24a158f981a0819178ca3ef841d499e051eb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25886784?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/syedhaffiz","id":25886784,"login":"syedhaffiz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1ODg2Nzg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commits/099e3d346a71954781986b39767d6030ec406cd5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-02T14:32:31Z","email":"haffizsyed@gmail.com","name":"Syed Haffiz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-02T14:32:31Z","email":"haffizsyed@gmail.com","name":"Syed Haffiz"},"message":"Add fiscal year filter to handling rates\n\nAdd a fiscal-year dropdown to the Handling Rates card header, allowing users to select from available fiscal years. The backend now supports a year query parameter and provides a new /fiscal-year endpoint to list available years. Rates are dynamically adjusted per year while maintaining deterministic variation. Both frontend and backend include updated mocks to reflect year-specific data.","tree":{"sha":"cb0df0a23bafef641e0596a37886769840378a64","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/git/trees/cb0df0a23bafef641e0596a37886769840378a64"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/git/commits/099e3d346a71954781986b39767d6030ec406cd5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25886784?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/syedhaffiz","id":25886784,"login":"syedhaffiz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1ODg2Nzg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commit/099e3d346a71954781986b39767d6030ec406cd5","node_id":"C_kwDOSh0tt9oAKDA5OWUzZDM0NmE3MTk1NDc4MTk4NmIzOTc2N2Q2MDM