v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/syedhaffiz","id":25886784,"login":"syedhaffiz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1ODg2Nzg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commits/45e5d3900b71fca07191ecc2d716e657dc4d0db0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-27T12:28:53Z","email":"haffizsyed@gmail.com","name":"Syed Haffiz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-27T12:28:53Z","email":"haffizsyed@gmail.com","name":"Syed Haffiz"},"message":"Add Cr format helpers and apply compact UI\n\nIntroduce splitCrValue and formatCrValue helpers to render stored crore (Cr) values as a compact number + unit (Cr/L) pair. Update BreakdownCard, KpiCard, TotalProfitabilityCard and DonutChart to use splitCrValue for two-tone number/unit rendering and use formatCrValue in chart/tooltip outputs. Update HorizontalBarChart to conditionally format Cr tooltips and data labels (import Highcharts type) so sub-crore values display in lakhs while non-monetary units remain unchanged. Overall improves readability of monetary figures across charts and KPI cards.","tree":{"sha":"1cc11bd61b7fae58f6c47e1c1d3af2a69aea1899","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/git/trees/1cc11bd61b7fae58f6c47e1c1d3af2a69aea1899"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/git/commits/45e5d3900b71fca07191ecc2d716e657dc4d0db0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25886784?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/syedhaffiz","id":25886784,"login":"syedhaffiz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1ODg2Nzg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commit/45e5d3900b71fca07191ecc2d716e657dc4d0db0","node_id":"C_kwDOSh0tt9oAKDQ1ZTVkMzkwMGI3MWZjYTA3MTkxZWNjMmQ3MTZlNjU3ZGM0ZDBkYjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commit/6fab54b6eee2148e7c69b4e12171535c6da95bd7","sha":"6fab54b6eee2148e7c69b4e12171535c6da95bd7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commits/6fab54b6eee2148e7c69b4e12171535c6da95bd7"}],"sha":"45e5d3900b71fca07191ecc2d716e657dc4d0db0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commits/45e5d3900b71fca07191ecc2d716e657dc4d0db0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25886784?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/syedhaffiz","id":25886784,"login":"syedhaffiz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1ODg2Nzg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commits/6fab54b6eee2148e7c69b4e12171535c6da95bd7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-26T17:24:40Z","email":"haffizsyed@gmail.com","name":"Syed Haffiz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-26T17:24:40Z","email":"haffizsyed@gmail.com","name":"Syed Haffiz"},"message":"Revenue: add date-range and unify breakdown items\n\nAdd date-range support to the revenue breakdown and unify the per-segment output. Backend: controller, service and repository signatures changed to accept from/to dates; controller parses fromDate/toDate and passes parsed Dates to the service. Mocks updated to scale a monthly baseline by the selected date window (and MTD factor), and replacement of Cr-string units with whole-number rupee amounts plus pct. OpenAPI and types renamed Card/Slice shapes to RevenueBreakdownItem and updated the response schema to return items[]. Frontend: API mock and page hooks pass fromDate/toDate; components now consume items (single source) instead of separate cards/slices and render whole-number rupee totals formatted as Cr/L using new format utils (toCrLakh / formatCrLakh). Overall: makes the revenue breakdown responsive to date-range filters and simplifies the data model shared by KPI cards and the donut chart.","tree":{"sha":"09820a26aa3a60b610c31903e43afce00f0f8530","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/git/trees/09820a26aa3a60b610c31903e43afce00f0f8530"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/git/commits/6fab54b6eee2148e7c69b4e12171535c6da95bd7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25886784?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/syedhaffiz","id":25886784,"login":"syedhaffiz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1ODg2Nzg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commit/6fab54b6eee2148e7c69b4e12171535c6da95bd7","node_id":"C_kwDOSh0tt9oAKDZmYWI1NGI2ZWVlMjE0OGU3YzY5YjRlMTIxNzE1MzVjNmRhOTViZDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commit/6f10cf637688ec6cfa67da415da9c0d07a628f0b","sha":"6f10cf637688ec6cfa67da415da9c0d07a628f0b","url":"https://api.github.com/repo