ps://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/syedhaffiz","id":25886784,"login":"syedhaffiz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1ODg2Nzg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commits/2c03db249c7955f6081c4f993d75855cc466fd33/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-22T08:03:03Z","email":"haffizsyed@gmail.com","name":"Syed Haffiz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-22T08:03:03Z","email":"haffizsyed@gmail.com","name":"Syed Haffiz"},"message":"Add allowAll to SelectFilter; disable All for port\n\nIntroduce an allowAll prop on SelectFilter (default true) so callers can omit the \"All\" option and force a concrete selection. Update SelectFilter to adjust options, value handling, and placeholder based on allowAll.\n\nRefactor DischargePortFilter to use SelectFilter with allowAll=false and accept undefined values in onChange. In OceanFreightPage, load filters to derive a default port id (filtersData?.ports[0]?.id), use that as the fallback dischargePort, and avoid firing the freight API until a dischargePort is known (keeps the page in loading state until the default port is available). Also update the URL param handling to compare against the dynamic default port.","tree":{"sha":"a53c53369ae03