993d75855cc466fd33"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25886784?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/syedhaffiz","id":25886784,"login":"syedhaffiz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1ODg2Nzg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commits/d9a50b13afdfb26905194b32ec80cb752ef58def/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-20T17:42:42Z","email":"haffizsyed@gmail.com","name":"Syed Haffiz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-20T17:42:42Z","email":"haffizsyed@gmail.com","name":"Syed Haffiz"},"message":"Revamp marketing market-share charts\n\nIntroduce async drilldown pies and shipper/receiver chart for marketing market-share. Add DrilldownPieCard and ShipperReceiverCard components, register Highcharts drilldown module, and remove legacy CenteredDonut/OverallShareCard/ZoneShareCard/shareColumns. Extend API with marketShareDrill (http + mock) and implement buildMarketShareDrill and richer buildMarketShare mock payloads (geographic/businessType roots, drill levels, and shipperReceiver data). Update types and theme tokens (marketShare palette) and adapt MarketSharePage to use the new components/layout.","tree":{"sha":"50a641a5dda52a534edd90f3d7664fffc2688442","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/git/trees/50a641a5dda52a534edd90f3d7664fffc2688442"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/git/commits/d9a50b13afdfb26905194b32ec80cb752ef58def","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25886784?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/syedhaffiz","id":25886784,"login":"syedhaffiz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1ODg2Nzg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commit/d9a50b13afdfb26905194b32ec80cb752ef58def","node_id":"C_kwDOSh0tt9oAKGQ5YTUwYjEzYWZkZmIyNjkwNTE5NGIzMmVjODBjYjc1MmVmNThkZWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commit/f2eefb77c1721fc1f58e9af7aecf65a97f01fa6b","sha":"f2eefb77c1721fc1f58e9af7aecf65a97f01fa6b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commits/f2eefb77c1721fc1f58e9af7aecf65a97f01fa6b"}],"sha":"d9a50b13afdfb26905194b32ec80cb752ef58def","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commits/d9a50b13afdfb26905194b32ec80cb752ef58def"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25886784?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/syedhaffiz","id":25886784,"login":"syedhaffiz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1ODg2Nzg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commits/f2eefb77c1721fc1f58e9af7aecf65a97f01fa6b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-20T17:42:18Z","email":"haffizsyed@gmail.com","name":"Syed Haffiz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-20T17:42:18Z","email":"haffizsyed@gmail.com","name":"Syed Haffiz"},"message":"Add lazy market-share drilldown API\n\nIntroduce a lazily-loaded drilldown for Market Share: adds a new GET /marketing/market-share/drill endpoint and controller (with zod query validation) that returns a single drilldown level or 404 for unknown ids. Refactor market-share mock data to provide root pies (geographic and businessType), drilldown series builders, and shipper/receiver rows; change unit from MMT to MT. Add new types (MarketSharePiePoint, MarketShareDrilldownSeries, MarketShareRootPie, MarketShareDimension, ShipperReceiverRow) and update repository/service wiring to expose marketShareDrill. Update OpenAPI spec to document the new endpoint and revised schemas.","tree":{"sha":"72ffee20efd2821d36a1802a5fd63fa379b18d28","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/git/trees/72ffee20efd2821d36a1802a5fd63fa379b18d28"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/git/commits/f2eefb77c1721fc1f58e9af7aecf65a97f01fa6b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25886784?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/syedhaffiz","id":25886784,"login":"syedhaffiz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1ODg2Nzg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commit/f2eefb77c1721fc1f58e9af7aecf65a97f01fa6b","node_id":"C_kwDOSh0tt9oAKGYyZWVmYjc3YzE3MjFmYzFmNThlOWFmN2FlY2Y2NWE5N2YwMWZhNmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commit/d86565541ac629618c0b1120f01b173cfb3b5c25","sha":"d86565541ac629618c0b1120f01b173cfb3b5c25","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commits/d86565541ac629618c0b1120f01b173cfb3b5c25"}],"sha":"f2eefb77c1721fc1f58e9af7aecf65a97f01fa6b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commits/f2eefb77c1721fc1f58e9af7aecf65a97f01fa6b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25886784?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/syedhaffiz","id":25886784,"login":"syedhaffiz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1ODg2Nzg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commits/d86565541ac629618c0b1120f01b173cfb3b5c25/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-20T15:06:21Z","email":"haffizsyed@gmail.com","name":"Syed Haffiz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-20T15:06:21Z","email":"haffizsyed@gmail.com","name":"Syed Haffiz"},"message":"Add market share Highcharts and assets\n\nIntroduce MarketShare design reference: add two Highcharts visualizations and supporting images. BarChart.js implements a stacked column chart with custom HTML tooltips and per-point entity metadata; PieChartDrilldown.js implements a multi-level drilldown pie with a reusable tooltip formatter that computes Adani vs Non-Adani splits. Also add related PNG assets (BarChart1/2, MarketShareFigma, pie1–pie5) used for design/marketing reference.","tree":{"sha":"49e357f8d9a26aca21cf9e638b065a475e7ed539","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/git/trees/49e357f8d9a26aca21cf9e638b065a475e7ed539"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/git/commits/d86565541ac629618c0b1120f01b173cfb3b5c25","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25886784?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/syedhaffiz","id":25886784,"login":"syedhaffiz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1ODg2Nzg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commit/d86565541ac629618c0b1120f01b173cfb3b5c25","node_id":"C_kwDOSh0tt9oAKGQ4NjU2NTU0MWFjNjI5NjE4YzBiMTEyMGYwMWIxNzNjZmIzYjVjMjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commit/8814514b8dac0816d6a463c6dbb0bba68a0ae80b","sha":"8814514b8dac0816d6a463c6dbb0bba68a0ae80b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commits/8814514b8dac0816d6a463c6dbb0bba68a0ae80b"}],"sha":"d86565541ac629618c0b1120f01b173cfb3b5c25","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commits/d86565541ac629618c0b1120f01b173cfb3b5c25"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25886784?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/syedhaffiz","id":25886784,"login":"syedhaffiz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1ODg2Nzg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commits/8814514b8dac0816d6a463c6dbb0bba68a0ae80b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-20T06:52:57Z","email":"haffizsyed@gmail.com","name":"Syed Haffiz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-20T06:52:57Z","email":"haffizsyed@gmail.com","name":"Syed Haffiz"},"message":"Unify column charts and remove BudgetActualColumnChart\n\nDelete the specialized BudgetActualColumnChart and extend ColumnChart to handle formatting, legend, label rotation/italic, decimals, loading and memoized Highcharts options. Add useMemo for rows and options, support legendName and numeric label formatting, and pass loading through to Chart. Update TargetChart to map BudgetActualRow -> ColumnChart (budget-only views for originwise/segmentwise) and remove the old component import.","tree":{"sha":"07d5e6f8a2393a45a36f9f4508389f075e54cb8d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/git/trees/07d5e6f8a2393a45a36f9f4508389f075e54cb8d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/git/commits/8814514b8dac0816d6a463c6dbb0bba68a0ae80b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25886784?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/syedhaffiz","id":25886784,"login":"syedhaffiz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1ODg2Nzg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commit/8814514b8dac0816d6a463c6dbb0bba68a0ae80b","node_id":"C_kwDOSh0tt9oAKDg4MTQ1MTRiOGRhYzA4MTZkNmE0NjNjNmRiYjBiYmE2OGEwYWU4MGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commit/e34f982cd5d8e4641eb3184cef027c4e90aff5b9","sha":"e34f982cd5d8e4641eb3184cef027c4e90aff5b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commits/e34f982cd5d8e4641eb3184cef027c4e90aff5b9"}],"sha":"8814514b8dac0816d6a463c6dbb0bba68a0ae80b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commits/8814514b8dac0816d6a463c6dbb0bba68a0ae80b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25886784?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/syedhaffiz","id":25886784,"login":"syedhaffiz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1ODg2Nzg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commits/e34f982cd5d8e4641eb3184cef027c4e90aff5b9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-20T06:10:32Z","email":"haffizsyed@gmail.com","name":"Syed Haffiz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-20T06:10:32Z","email":"haffizsyed@gmail.com","name":"Syed Haffiz"},"message":"Refactor index movement: new range/cadence & slugs\n\nConvert Index Movement to use numeric month ranges and explicit cadences. Replaces the old MarketRange (1W/1M/3M/1Y) with IndexRange = \"1\" | \"2\" and adds IndexCadence (daily|weekly). Controllers, service and repository signatures updated to accept the new range values and default to \"1\". Mocks were reworked: introduce anchored dates to match design, new indexSpecs keyed by slugs (\"ici\", \"api-daily\", \"api-weekly\"), weekly/daily category generators, and index charts now include title and cadence fields. OpenAPI spec updated to reflect new query enum, path slug examples, and IndexChart schema changes.","tree":{"sha":"07cd21c2942eb59c87598d7854371c3efab4d1a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/git/trees/07cd21c2942eb59c87598d7854371c