rs/syedhaffiz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/syedhaffiz","id":25886784,"login":"syedhaffiz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1ODg2Nzg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commits/47420604e98f84396966ab23d1dddedd86811f73/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-20T06:06:09Z","email":"haffizsyed@gmail.com","name":"Syed Haffiz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-20T06:06:09Z","email":"haffizsyed@gmail.com","name":"Syed Haffiz"},"message":"Refactor index charts, add loading overlay\n\nIntroduce a focused refactor of the Index Movement feature: replace MarketRange with IndexRange and add IndexCadence, update API signatures/defaults, and add IndexRangeSelect for 1/2 month windows. Add a LoadingIndicator component (LoadingOverlay) and use it in Chart to overlay a Spin without layout shift. Memoise chart options in MultiSeriesLineChart, add a loading prop, and improve data validation to avoid re-creating Highcharts on unrelated renders. Update mock data to produce date-based categories (anchored to end-May-2026) and richer index specs (ici/api-daily/api-weekly). Add loadingOverlay tokens and expose them via useBrandTokens; wire themed colors through IndexCard and IndexMovementPage to match figma palette.","tree":