7420604e98f84396966ab23d1dddedd86811f73"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25886784?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/syedhaffiz","id":25886784,"login":"syedhaffiz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1ODg2Nzg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commits/bf699ded8d65126100420f602729e774a2a255f8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-19T09:41:41Z","email":"haffizsyed@gmail.com","name":"Syed Haffiz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-19T09:41:41Z","email":"haffizsyed@gmail.com","name":"Syed Haffiz"},"message":"Add reusable column filters and wire tables\n\nIntroduce reusable column filter helpers (textSearchFilter, treeFilter, uniqueValues) in a new columnFilters.tsx to provide input-driven search and tree-checkbox filters with options derived from current rows. Apply these filters to vessel and batch detail column definitions and update the column factories to accept the current row set so filter options reflect live data. Update BatchDetail and VesselProfitability pages to pass rows into the builders and use those rows as the table dataSource; remove the previous global search UI and ad-hoc matching logic. Overall this enables per-column searching/filtering and keeps filter option lists in-sync with the displayed data.","tree":{"sha":"44203ce14a23c8089cbcc41565d33fae7f386a5a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/git/trees/44203ce14a23c8089cbcc41565d33fae7f386a5a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/git/commits/bf699ded8d65126100420f602729e774a2a255f8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25886784?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/syedhaffiz","id":25886784,"login":"syedhaffiz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1ODg2Nzg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commit/bf699ded8d65126100420f602729e774a2a255f8","node_id":"C_kwDOSh0tt9oAKGJmNjk5ZGVkOGQ2NTEyNjEwMDQyMGY2MDI3MjllNzc0YTJhMjU1Zjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commit/858092b793ba245799a1e570764be596ac8ccc78","sha":"858092b793ba245799a1e570764be596ac8ccc78","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commits/858092b793ba245799a1e570764be596ac8ccc78"}],"sha":"bf699ded8d65126100420f602729e774a2a255f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commits/bf699ded8d65126100420f602729e774a2a255f8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25886784?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/syedhaffiz","id":25886784,"login":"syedhaffiz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1ODg2Nzg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commits/858092b793ba245799a1e570764be596ac8ccc78/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-19T03:34:57Z","email":"haffizsyed@gmail.com","name":"Syed Haffiz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-19T03:34:57Z","email":"haffizsyed@gmail.com","name":"Syed Haffiz"},"message":"Add revenue breakdown UI, APIs and mocks\n\nIntroduce a full Revenue feature with breakdown + drilldowns. Adds new API endpoints (revenueBreakdown, revenuePort, revenueSegment) and corresponding mock builders and types (RevenuePeriod, RevenueBreakdown*, RevenuePort*, RevenueSegment*). Implements UI: Revenue page with PeriodToggle, RevenueDonut, RevenueKpiCard, RevenueChildLinks and ledger column builders, plus dedicated Port and Segment ledger pages. Updates routes and PageHeader labels, adjusts KPI href for the Revenue card, and wires URL params (period/port/segment) so filters persist. Replaces the generic BreakdownPage usage for revenue with the new custom implementation.","tree":{"sha":"8c2637978aecc443750a33b13ff57742dc6fba31","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/git/trees/8c2637978aecc443750a33b13ff57742dc6fba31"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/git/commits/858092b793ba245799a1e570764be596ac8ccc78","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25886784?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/syedhaffiz","id":25886784,"login":"syedhaffiz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1ODg2Nzg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commit/858092b793ba245799a1e570764be596ac8ccc78","node_id":"C_kwDOSh0tt9oAKDg1ODA5MmI3OTNiYTI0NTc5OWExZTU3MDc2NGJlNTk2YWM4Y2NjNzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commit/4706455b6a6c5c2201477fea349b9d6d6615e475","sha":"4706455b6a6c5c2201477fea349b9d6d6615e475","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/co