ollowing{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/syedhaffiz","id":25886784,"login":"syedhaffiz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1ODg2Nzg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commits/6765238470477b6eb758e9d0dbc525f951343dcc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-18T16:24:35Z","email":"haffizsyed@gmail.com","name":"Syed Haffiz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-18T16:24:35Z","email":"haffizsyed@gmail.com","name":"Syed Haffiz"},"message":"Add Net Margin profitability UI, API & mocks\n\nIntroduce the Net Margin profitability feature across frontend: add new chart primitives (HorizontalBarChart, TreemapChart) and multiple finance UI components (PortWiseProfitabilityCard, SegmentWiseTreemapCard, TotalProfitabilityCard, VesselTabsNav, VesselWiseLinkCard, BatchIdLink) plus table column builders for vessel & batch detail views. Expand API surface (netMarginProfitability, vesselSales, vesselHandling, salesBatchDetail, handlingBatchDetail) and wire up mock implementations in mocks/finance/profitability.ts to produce port/segment/vessel and batch-level data with currency support. Update Profitability page and add BatchDetail page and route adjustments, refine AppShell menu/submenu open behavior, and correct KPI link to the new profitability overview path.","tree":{"sha":"0f288c2ced30526e45b96f7a18da23ef8dda8002","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo