github.com/users/syedhaffiz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commits/2334bf0d8a41f1b5c66606625affc74600beca7c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-15T07:58:07Z","email":"haffizsyed@gmail.com","name":"Syed Haffiz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-15T07:58:07Z","email":"haffizsyed@gmail.com","name":"Syed Haffiz"},"message":"Add Legal backend module and endpoints\n\nIntroduce a Legal backend module: adds types, deterministic mock data, a mock repository, a thin service layer, controllers (with zod query parsing), and routes. Implements endpoints for summary, critical cases list, per-case detail, and critical issues (/legal/summary, /legal/critical-cases, /legal/critical-cases/:caseNo, /legal/critical-issues). Updates the main router to register /legal and extends the OpenAPI spec with paths and schemas so the API is documented for frontend integration and local development testing.","tree":{"sha":"4942c4022f7053333d58dcfbeceeca814beaddef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/git/trees/4942c4022f7053333d58dcfbeceeca814beaddef"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/git/commits/2334bf0d8a41f1b5c66606625affc74600beca7c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25886784?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/follow