haffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commits/aaab2e8be8eb087472ab1903ac12e2c0de5fbc77/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-12T11:05:32Z","email":"haffizsyed@gmail.com","name":"Syed Haffiz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-12T11:05:32Z","email":"haffizsyed@gmail.com","name":"Syed Haffiz"},"message":"Customize sidebar menu theme and styles\n\nAdd custom CSS and theme tokens to style the Ant Design sidebar/menu. index.css introduces rules for a transparent menu background, a solid-blue active submenu title with white icons/text, a rounded open-submenu card layout, and child item styles. ThemeProvider.tsx now exposes CSS variables (--ct-*) for those menu colors and the card shadow on :root. antdTheme.ts updates Menu tokens to use the accent/white/black colors (selected bg -> accent, selected color -> white, itemColor -> black) so the design matches the new CSS. These changes cover gaps where Ant Design lacks tokens for the open-submenu title/panel styling.","tree":{"sha":"5ea07ed044594dac0c371ceb02f9bd00cfff378e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/git/trees/5ea07ed044594dac0c371ceb02f9bd00cfff378e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/git/commits/aaab2e8be8eb087472ab1903ac12e2c0de5fbc77","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25886784?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/syedhaffiz","id":25886784,"login":"syedhaffiz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1ODg2Nzg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.