"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commits/8f1c8fba62f9be396315c063ce0a7d4611089c71/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-11T10:18:47Z","email":"haffizsyed@gmail.com","name":"Syed Haffiz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-11T10:18:47Z","email":"haffizsyed@gmail.com","name":"Syed Haffiz"},"message":"Add Marketing module UI and chart components\n\nIntroduce the Marketing module UI with new pages (IndexMovement, MarketShare, OceanFreight, TargetAbove2) and mock/type support. Add a set of reusable chart components (BudgetActualColumnChart, ColumnChart, CenteredDonut, MultiSeriesLineChart), UI helpers (RangeSelect, TargetModeSegmented, DischargePortFilter, shareColumns), and marketing-specific components/cards (IndexCard, FreightChartCard, OverallShareCard, ZoneShareCard, TargetChart). Add ErrorRetry shared error banner and replace duplicated inline error Alerts across finance/inventory pages. Update AppShell menu to include a Marketing submenu (and open state logic), and adjust routes, theme tokens and formatting utilities to integrate the new features.","tree":{"sha":"b559467ef7bb0f2e36728fac64b4178bce85809e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/git/trees/b559467ef7bb0f2e36728fac64b4178bce85809e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/git/commits/8f1c8fba62f9be396315c063ce0a7d4611089c71","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25886784?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/syedhaffiz","id":25886784,"logi