its own MSAL PublicClientApplication (env-driven client/tenant/redirect). If VITE_AZURE_CLIENT_ID is absent, auth is disabled and the app runs token-less for standalone UI work. Remove the previous host-MSAL sync (useActiveAccountSync) and @azure/msal-react dependency, replace token wiring with silent-only flows (ssoSilent/acquireTokenSilent) that never prompt or sign the user out. Update UI to drop remote sign-out, adjust federation sharing (no @azure/msal-* singletons), and update docs/env example and host comments accordingly. Also bump diagnostic tsconfig path and update package.json deps.","tree":{"sha":"3c14196fd6ccbe1447da69528d2993c3f87aecbd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/git/trees/3c14196fd6ccbe1447da69528d2993c3f87aecbd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/git/commits/13095f5021ff6afaa9675c0961a5b8465a1aa827","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25886784?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/syedhaffiz","id":25886784,"login":"syedhaffiz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1ODg2Nzg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"http