update federation diagnostics\n\nUpgrade project dependencies and update related diagnostics/configs. Bump @module-federation packages to 2.5.0 and @module-federation/vite to 1.16.2, update React/react-dom to 18.3.1 and their @types to 18.3.0, and apply various transitive dependency updates reflected in package-lock files. Update frontend diagnostics (.mf/latest.json) to point to the new .federation tsconfig hash and refresh its timestamp. Adjust project config/source files (vite configs, expose-app, host App/types) to align with these dependency changes.","tree":{"sha":"8f7b0253f7e9b72005e66f68ddca990ebb2cbf85","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/git/trees/8f7b0253f7e9b72005e66f68ddca990ebb2cbf85"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/git/commits/2846af889fa7c9d22bb03314fb726ba50acf7450","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25886784?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/syedhaffiz","id":25886784,"login":"syedhaffiz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1ODg2Nzg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commit/2846af889fa7c9d22bb03314fb726ba50acf7450","node_id":"C_kwDOSh0tt9oAKDI4NDZhZjg4OWZhN2M5ZDIyYmIwMzMxNGZiNzI2YmE1MGFjZjc0NTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commit/2048d1eaf956331216f76c774b0af0efdc96853e","sha":"2048d1eaf956331216f76c774b0af0efdc96853e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commits/2048d1eaf956331216f76c774b0af0efdc96853e"}],"sha":"2846af889fa7c9d22bb03314fb726ba50acf7450","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commits/2846af889fa7c9d22bb03314fb726ba50acf7450"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25886784?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/syedhaffiz","id":25886784,"login":"syedhaffiz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1ODg2Nzg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commits/2048d1eaf956331216f76c774b0af0efdc96853e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-02T16:52:29Z","email":"haffizsyed@gmail.com","name":"Syed Haffiz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-02T16:52:29Z","email":"haffizsyed@gmail.com","name":"Syed Haffiz"},"message":"Move auth ownership to host, simplify remote\n\nCentralize SSO in the host and convert the frontend remote into a token-consumer. The frontend no longer creates or bootstraps an MSAL PublicClientApplication or gates the UI; AuthProvider now reads the host-provided MSAL instance (via useMsal) and registers it for the axios interceptor. Removed standalone SSO toggles, dummy-token flow and bootstrap logic from the remote; token acquisition and active-account sync were simplified to tolerate a missing/stubbed MSAL instance (token-less dev mode). The host now always instantiates MSAL (requires VITE_AZURE_CLIENT_ID) and always wraps the app in MsalProvider/MsalAuthenticationTemplate. Other updates: adjust federated App typings (remove ssoEnabled prop), tweak package scripts for remote builds, update env examples and minor diagnostics metadata.","tree":{"sha":"e6dc7446e6f0f7c32d4086a944c40fb75475e441","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/git/trees/e6dc7446e6f0f7c32d4086a944c40fb75475e441"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/git/commits/2048d1eaf956331216f76c774b0af0efdc96853e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25886784?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/syedhaffiz","id":25886784,"login":"syedhaffiz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1ODg2Nzg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commit/2048d1eaf956331216f76c774b0af0efdc96853e","node_id":"C_kwDOSh0tt9oAKDIwNDhkMWVhZjk1NjMzMTIxNmY3NmM3NzRiMGFmMGVmZGM5Njg1M2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commit/24f7b6e5f78af32c914df1070a41c7c0e3d4f74a","sha":"24f7b6e5f78af32c914df1070a41c7c0e3d4f74a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commits/24f7b6e5f78af32c914df1070a41c7c0e3d4f74a"}],"sha":"2048d1eaf956331216f76c774b0af0efdc96853e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commits/2048d1eaf956331216f76c774b0af0efdc96853e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25886784?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/syedhaffiz","id":25886784,"login":"syedhaffiz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1ODg2Nzg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commits/24f7b6e5f78af32c914df1070a41c7c0e3d4f74a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-02T15:25:31Z","email":"haffizsyed@gmail.com","name":"Syed Haffiz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-02T15:25:31Z","email":"haffizsyed@gmail.com","name":"Syed Haffiz"},"message":"Add Module Federation support and federated auth\n\nIntroduce Module Federation for the frontend and refactor auth to support standalone and federated hosts. Key changes:\n\n- Frontend: add federation plugin, new build/dev scripts (dev:remote, build:remote, preview:remote), expose-app entry, and vite.config tuned for federated vs standalone builds (shared singletons, dedupe).\n- Auth: support three modes (standalone SSO on/off, federated). Add IS_FEDERATED, AUTH_ACTIVE, set/get active PCA; AuthProvider accepts ssoEnabled and delegates to host PCA when federated. Token helpers/useActiveAccountSync use the active PCA so interceptor works in both modes.\n- App/router: App accepts basename and ssoEnabled; routes factory createAppRouter(basename) for host mounting; default router preserved for standalone.\n- Highcharts: replace highcharts-react-official usage with an imperative wrapper to avoid duplicate-React hook issues under federation.\n- UI tweaks: use Alert `title` consistently, shorten logo text to \"IRM\"; update copy in PLAN/README to reflect IRM naming.\n- Backend: rename package and Swagger/site titles to \"IRM API\".\n- Add a minimal host scaffold (host/...) for running the app as a portal host and a federation diagnostics file.\n\nThese changes enable the app to be built as a remote module consumable by a host portal while preserving standalone dev/build behavior and ensuring a single shared React/MSAL instance across host+remote.","tree":{"sha":"8294c586a416bb4e7dc25d60c797cd487a13dbcf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/git/trees/8294c586a416bb4e7dc25d60c797cd487a13dbcf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/git/commits/24f7b6e5f78af32c914df1070a41c7c0e3d4f74a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigne