oggle (VITE_SSO_ENABLED) and refactor authentication to support both SSO-on and SSO-off modes.\n\nKey changes:\n- Add VITE_SSO_ENABLED (defaults to true) plus DUMMY_USERNAME/DUMMY_TOKEN to allow running without Azure SSO in local/dev or demo builds.\n- Replace previous federation-specific PCA wiring with a unified AuthProvider that: uses MSAL + MsalAuthenticationTemplate when SSO is enabled, or provides a placeholder identity when disabled. Exposes useIdentity() for components.\n- Move active-account sync into MsalIdentityProvider and simplify token helpers to return a dummy token when SSO is off. signOut/getAccessToken adjusted accordingly.\n- Update App to wrap with AuthProvider and AppShell/components to read identity from the new context.\n- Simplify main.tsx and routes: export a single router (removed basename factory), remove expose-app and federation-related code from vite config and package.json (dev/build scripts and devDependencies for module federation removed).\n- Remove host microfrontend files and a diagnostics file related to module federation.\n\nBreaking/behavior changes:\n- VITE_SSO_ENABLED is read at build time; set it to \"false\" to run without SSO. When false, requests carry a dummy bearer token and UI shows a demo user.\n- Missing VITE_AZURE_CLIENT_ID now only throws when SSO is enabled.\n- Module Federation/remote exposure has been removed; if you relied on federated remote usage, update your integration accordingly.","tree":{"sha":"81e67cdbc4702a0ad2de036801bd2c4181bc2b74","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/git/trees/81e67cdbc4702a0ad2de036801bd2c4181bc2b74"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/git/commits/c17fa72960020c10c51c53eb9904d2ea7cc13359","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25886784?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/syedhaffiz","id":25886784,"login":"syedhaffiz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1ODg2Nzg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commit/c17fa72960020c10c51c53eb9904d2ea7cc13359","node_id":"C_kwDOSh0tt9oAKGMxN2ZhNzI5NjAwMjBjMTBjNTFjNTNlYjk5MDRkMmVhN2NjMTMzNTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commit/4b9f81dbc09f7e2f87155ab71f079cb13e02505c","sha":"4b9f81dbc09f7e2f87155ab71f079cb13e02505c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commits/4b9f81dbc09f7e2f87155ab71f079cb13e02505c"}],"sha":"c17fa72960020c10c51c53eb9904d2ea7cc13359","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commits/c17fa72960020c10c51c53eb9904d2ea7cc13359"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25886784?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/syedhaffiz","id":25886784,"login":"syedhaffiz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1ODg2Nzg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commits/4b9f81dbc09f7e2f87155ab71f079cb13e02505c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-02T04:07:33Z","email":"haffizsyed@gmail.com","name":"Syed Haffiz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-02T04:07:33Z","email":"haffizsyed@gmail.com","name":"Syed Haffiz"},"message":"Add card shadow token and apply to theme\n\nIntroduce card-specific tokens (cardHeader, cardShadow) for light and dark themes and wire them into the UI. ThemeProvider now sets --ct-card-shadow on the document root via useLayoutEffect so cards receive a consistent resting elevation; index.css applies that variable to .ant-card. Also set Card headerBg in the antd theme to use the new cardHeader tokens. This addresses the lack of a native antd Card box-shadow token and ensures mode-aware card styling.","tree":{"sha":"998c72a547191d7accdd909e0a749e9cfd3e8240","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/git/trees/998c72a547191d7accdd909e0a749e9cfd3e8240"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/git/commits/4b9f81dbc09f7e2f87155ab71f079cb13e02505c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25886784?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/followers","following_u