ons","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commits/cb71f164c7ab05c5dc47f0097500fe26e99fd73a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-01T13:34:51Z","email":"haffizsyed@gmail.com","name":"Syed Haffiz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-01T13:34:51Z","email":"haffizsyed@gmail.com","name":"Syed Haffiz"},"message":"Split vessel lists into separate endpoints\n\nRemove vessel arrays from the InventoryOverview payload and introduce two new endpoints: /inventory/vessels/sailed-out and /inventory/vessels/under-loading. Backend: add controller handlers, repository/service methods, routes and OpenAPI spec entries; update mocks to extract computeVesselCounts so KPI card and vessel endpoints share the same seeded counts. Types: remove vessel lists from InventoryOverviewResponse. Frontend: add API methods and mock implementations for the new endpoints, update OverviewPage to fetch vessel lists independently (with loading/error handling and tab count labels that show “…” while loading) and render tables per tab.","tree":{"sha":"00cf83e4d66762981bace108668088101a1a64f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/git/trees/00cf83e4d66762981bace108668088101a1a64f0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/git/commits/cb71f164c7ab05c5dc47f0097500fe26e99fd73a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25886784?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/syedhaffiz","id":25886784,"login":"syedhaffiz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1ODg2Nzg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commit/cb71f164c7ab05c5dc47f0097500fe26e99fd73a","node_id":"C_kwDOSh0tt9oAKGNiNzFmMTY0YzdhYjA1YzVkYzQ3ZjAwOTc1MDBmZTI2ZTk5ZmQ3M2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commit/6301caa86c696793b256e537473c1b570821282e","sha":"6301caa86c696793b256e537473c1b570821282e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commits/6301caa86c696793b256e537473c1b570821282e"}],"sha":"cb71f164c7ab05c5dc47f0097500fe26e99fd73a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commits/cb71f164c7ab05c5dc47f0097500fe26e99fd73a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25886784?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/syedhaffiz","id":25886784,"login":"syedhaffiz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1ODg2Nzg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commits/6301caa86c696793b256e537473c1b570821282e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-01T12:11:08Z","email":"haffizsyed@gmail.com","name":"Syed Haffiz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-01T12:11:08Z","email":"haffizsyed@gmail.com","name":"Syed Haffiz"},"message":"Use id-based filter catalogs\n\nSwitch filter catalogues from plain string arrays to id/name object lists and update mock generators and API types accordingly. Added lookup helpers (e.g. portNameById, gradeNameById) and normalization so inventory mocks accept filter ids while internal generators use display names. Updated OpenAPI spec and backend FiltersResponse to expose object refs (ports, segments, zones, origins, grades, indexNames), and updated frontend API, mocks, and SelectFilter to consume the new shape and extract value/label pairs. This makes filter ids stable for URLs/API usage while preserving display names for UI and mocks.","tree":{"sha":"72ecdc98a5a3a09581e701bdf184ec3190125146","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/git/trees/72ecdc98a5a3a09581e701bdf184ec3190125146"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/git/commits/6301caa86c696793b256e537473c1b570821282e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25886784?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_u