/users/syedhaffiz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commits/cbfa3da32944ca821262746156ed127d3c22d773/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-27T03:37:33Z","email":"haffizsyed@gmail.com","name":"Syed Haffiz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-27T03:37:33Z","email":"haffizsyed@gmail.com","name":"Syed Haffiz"},"message":"Integrate MSAL SSO and auth plumbing\n\nAdd Microsoft Entra ID (MSAL) single-sign-on support and related auth infrastructure. New auth modules (msalConfig, bootstrap, token, AuthProvider) initialize MSAL before React mounts, handle redirect sign-in, maintain active account, and expose token helpers. Axios client gains request/response interceptors to attach bearer tokens and retry once on 401. main.tsx is updated to bootstrap auth, mount the AuthProvider and ErrorBoundary, and show a friendly error when required env vars are missing. UI tweaks: AppShell shows account name with sign-out dropdown; Chart silences a Highcharts dev accessibility warning. .env.example updated with Azure env placeholders and a mock-data flag. package.json updated to include MSAL packages and vite config adjusted to group msal into its own chunk.","tree":{"sha":"91fd35c91ff1a84cf8b65fec179c8a9b833bea99","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/git/trees/91fd35c91ff1a84cf8b65fec179c8a9b833bea99"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/git/commits/cbfa3da32944ca821262746156ed127d3c22d773","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25886784?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/us