users/syedhaffiz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commits/e24f08328a39f8798a0083f4ee2e0f8adaa84173/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-25T12:37:19Z","email":"haffizsyed@gmail.com","name":"Syed Haffiz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-25T12:37:19Z","email":"haffizsyed@gmail.com","name":"Syed Haffiz"},"message":"Add OpenAPI spec and Swagger UI docs\n\nIntroduce a hand-authored OpenAPI 3 spec (backend/src/openapi/spec.ts) and wire up Swagger UI in app.ts. Adds routes: GET /api/docs (interactive Swagger UI) and GET /api/openapi.json (raw spec). Relax Helmet CSP only for the docs path so Swagger UI inline assets work without weakening CSP globally. Add swagger-ui-express and its types to package.json and update package-lock.json (including swagger-ui-dist and related deps).","tree":{"sha":"ebc58275944e5e1864193dd22d902747a9151ad0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/git/trees/ebc58275944e5e1864193dd22d902747a9151ad0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/git/commits/e24f08328a39f8798a0083f4ee2e0f8adaa84173","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25886784?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_