com/users/syedhaffiz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/commits/3f39ffc8992e1496059c8ce372c6c77b94673397/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-25T10:34:44Z","email":"haffizsyed@gmail.com","name":"Syed Haffiz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-25T10:34:44Z","email":"haffizsyed@gmail.com","name":"Syed Haffiz"},"message":"Add lazy route loading and vendor chunking\n\nConvert page imports to route-level React.lazy in routes.tsx so pages are loaded on demand, and wrap <Outlet> in AppShell with a Suspense boundary using an antd Skeleton fallback to keep the chrome visible while page chunks load. Add Vite build.rollupOptions.manualChunks to split heavy vendor libraries (highcharts, antd, react-router, react) into separate chunks to reduce initial bundle size and improve caching.","tree":{"sha":"3cdb82c356858a471142d656fcc753ca6123a302","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/git/trees/3cdb82c356858a471142d656fcc753ca6123a302"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/syedhaffiz/didactic-octo-happiness/git/commits/3f39ffc8992e1496059c8ce372c6c77b94673397","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25886784?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syedhaffiz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/syedhaffiz","id":25886784,"login":"syedhaffiz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1ODg2Nzg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/user