Blob, None, None, None, None]\nand the stage reported success (measured, pylance 12.0.0). Kind-3 rows\nare now forwarded as pointers and every other non-null row''s bytes are\nread by row id (read_blobs, preserve_order) and carried beside them,\nthrough service_kit.lakehouse.blobs.carried_blob_values.\n\nBoth carry paths now take the upstream blob field instead of a bare\nblob_field(name), so a tier''s first write keeps the Blob V2 thresholds\nand rask.classification that ride the field''s metadata. merge_insert\nand the by-id widening merge keep the target schema (LH-213), so every write also\ncopies the upstream''s rask.* field labels onto same-named target fields\nthat lack them (add-only: a label the target holds is never replaced or\nremoved; no can_classify, since a carried copy can only tighten). A\nclassification set on bronze after silver exists now reaches silver.\n\nThe Ray stage job''s half (scripts/ray_stage_job.py) is LH-326, parked;\nit is not touched here.\n\ntests: +2 -0 (3 cases: 1 + 2 parametrized)\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017XnXD48toDdU7HLsHN54Sv","tree":{"sha":"c9c8340f0612ece55b9b5b9f7e0e8e481497f24c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/git/trees/c9c8340f0612ece55b9b5b9f7e0e8e481497f24c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/git/commits/4a5027c7976baeb8eb961cbf0cea91e0f9b09503","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48671678?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Borg93","id":48671678,"login":"Borg93","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NjcxNjc4","organizations_url":"https://api.