://api.github.com/users/Borg93/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commits/11850bf6239b77742e3b69c64c12273574e9e31f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T16:23:27Z","email":"Borg93@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Borg93"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T16:23:27Z","email":"Borg93@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Borg93"},"message":"chore(estate): a namespace Overwrite replaces only an empty namespace and a Skip drop finishes its trailer, live at helm rev 279; LH-037 closes\n\nRead back at revs 278 and 279 (rev 279: lance-rest-catalog lakehouse-3d8bf815):\n- rev 278: a child namespace''s Overwrite answers 200 when empty and 409 code 3 naming its table when\n  not; a warehouse-bound TOP-LEVEL namespace''s Overwrite answered 400 \"must belong to a warehouse\"\n  (the tests ran with the warehouse requirement off). Fixed in 3d8bf815 (an existing bound top-level\n  namespace keeps its binding and its warehouse parent edge; the tests now run with warehouses on).\n- rev 279: a bound top-level namespace''s Overwrite answers 200 and still describes; a non-empty one\n  answers 409 code 3; a new unbound top-level create is still refused 400. Skip after a complete drop\n  answers 403 can_delete, the authz-before-existence rule the row kept.\n- Health at 16:23:06Z (15 min after rollout): DLQ unchanged, no lakehouse pod unready or restarted.\n\nRegister: LH-037 removed; 204 open / 196 workable / 36 HIGH; short list 18. Parked: LH-416.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017XnXD48toDdU7HLsHN54Sv","tree":{"sha":"3cc326ec9bba0ba9754994a06d15022707443c45","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/git/trees/3cc326ec9bba0ba9754994a06d15022707443c45"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/git/commits/11850bf6239b77742e3b69c64c12273574e9e31f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"un