","id":48671678,"login":"Borg93","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NjcxNjc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commits/3d8bf815dda0d625b1fafcf06b91da5c9d0e04a1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T14:50:46Z","email":"Borg93@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Borg93"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T16:04:59Z","email":"Borg93@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Borg93"},"message":"fix(catalog): a namespace Overwrite replaces an empty namespace, and a Skip drop finishes the trailer (LH-037)\n\ncreate_namespace refused the spec''s Overwrite mode with a 400. It now drops\nand re-creates with Restrict semantics (spec.yaml CreateNamespaceRequest.mode).\nAn empty namespace needs can_delete on it, on top of the create-on-parent\nrung, and no deletion protection. Its tuples, protection record and\nmaintenance policy go with it, and the caller is seeded as owner of the new\nnamespace. Its binding stays, so an Overwrite of a warehouse-bound top-level\nid passes the generic door''s warehouse requirement and seeds the new\nnamespace''s parent edge to that warehouse. Only a new, unbound top-level\nnamespace is still refused. A namespace that holds anything answers 409\ncode 3 (NamespaceNotEmpty), naming what it holds.\n\ndrop_namespace with mode=Skip answered success for an absent namespace\nwithout running the trailer. A retry over a drop that died after the native\ndrop therefore left tuples, protection, policy and binding for a reused id\nto inherit. Skip now runs that idempotent trailer first, unless a live\nnamespace trash record says the grants are being kept for undrop. The answer\nstays 200 with a body: the operation declares only 200, and pylance 12.0.0''s\nRestNamespace refuses a 204 with an empty body (measured).\n\nDECISIONS.md records both, along with the unchanged 403 for a caller with no\nrung on an unknown id.\n\ntests: +3 -3 (route tests on the real catalog over real pylance in\ntests/integration/test_a_namespace_mode_does_what_the_spec_says.py, with\nwarehouses on as the chart deploys them; they replace the unit tests of the Skip-absent path and of the Overwrite refusal)\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017XnXD48toDdU7HLsHN54Sv","tree":{"sha":"d0a2c8ddfdb9c2fe58ac5e60dca5e970b8fdb5d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/git/trees/d0a2c8ddfdb9c2fe58ac5e60dca5e970b8fdb5d2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/git/commits/3d8bf815dda0d625b1fafcf06b91da5c9d0e04a1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48671678?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Borg93","id":48671678,"login":"Borg93","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NjcxNjc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"htt