rev 278; LH-242 and LH-263 close\n\nRead back at rev 278 (lance-rest-catalog lakehouse-c9427322; that image''s tree also carried LH-037''s\nfirst version, which stays open and lands after this commit), scratch namespace b8-probe-134976\n(oct5/catalog-readback/batch8_probe.py):\n- LH-242: on a protected table create?mode=overwrite and insert?mode=overwrite each answer 409 code\n  19 with the version unchanged; with force=true the create overwrite answers 200 and version 1 still\n  reads its 2 rows.\n- LH-263: an erasure of one row on a BTREE-indexed table answers complete=true with surfaces main\n  deleted, compact:main rewritten, index:main rebuilt (name_idx), history reclaimed, verify clean;\n  no object under the table''s prefix holds the subject''s bytes.\n- Health: at 15:56:15Z (21 min after the catalog started) DLQ unchanged since rev 277 and no\n  lakehouse pod unready or restarted. Helm records rev 278 failed on the rask-kueue-setup hook\n  (LH-399); every object applied.\nOwner ruling 2026-10-05: erasure may rewrite past the 64 MiB per-branch cap (recorded in DECISIONS.md).\n\nRegister: two rows removed; 205 open / 197 workable / 36 HIGH; short list 19. Parked: LH-414, LH-415.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017XnXD48toDdU7HLsHN54Sv","tree":{"sha":"a38f26f331c1b247e9196cef5a2011b0beb6f194","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/git/trees/a38f26f331c1b247e9196cef5a2011b0beb6f194"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/git/commits/4b7e4ddba1c65ff97de462fce04820a386dd0ca1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48671678?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Borg93","id":48671678,"login":"Borg93","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NjcxNjc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commit/4b7e4ddba1c65ff97de462fce04820a386dd0ca1","node_id":"C_kwDOSh8U4doAKDRiN2U0ZGRiYTFjNjVmZjk3ZGU0NjJmY2UwNDgyMGEzODZkZDBjYTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commit/261fd4b67da3df0b60f9486b12910f83cde1eca0","sha":"261fd4b67da3df0b60f9486b12910f83cde1eca0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commits/261fd4b67da3df0b60f9486b12910f83cde1eca0"}],"sha":"4b7e4ddba1c65ff97de462fce04820a386dd0ca1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commits/4b7e4ddba1c65ff97de462fce04820a386dd0ca1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48671678?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Borg93","id":48671678,"login":"Borg93","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NjcxNjc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commits/261fd4b67da3df0b60f9486b12910f83cde1eca0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T15:04:16Z","email":"Borg93@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Borg93"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T15:56:36Z","email":"Borg93@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Borg93"},"message":"fix(catalog): an erasure is verified on bytes, rebuilds every index and names what it cannot reach (LH-263)\n\nerase() reported complete while the subject survived in files no step reached.\nMeasured on pylance 12.0.0: a BTREE/BITMAP segment keeps its UUID and the\nsubject''s key through the materialising rewrite and cleanup; an external\nblob-v2 payload under a registered base survives delete, rewrite and cleanup;\na row put through a MemWAL shard writer sits in _mem_wal/ while the base table\ncounts zero; a fragment holding the subject larger than the compact door''s\nbyte bound was left behind a deletion vector.\n\n- The second compaction pass takes every fragment still holding the subject\n  with its bound raised to their size; the first pass keeps the 64 MiB\n  branch-copy cap (2026-09-26), which the owner''s 2026-10-05 ruling lets an\n  erasure exceed (both in DECISIONS.md).\n- Every rewritten ref rebuilds each user index from its own description\n  (index_specs + maintenance.rebuild_index_now, replace=True) and reports an\n  index:<ref> surface; a ref whose rebuild fails is not reclaimed.\n- The verification proves an index segment by provenance: built by the\n  erasure, or by a retained fresh CreateIndex commit over exactly the\n  fragments it covers in a version whose data reads clean; any other segment\n  with files on storage keeps its version residual, named with what keeps it.\n- Step 0 reads every retained version of every ref, deleted rows included,\n  and records held surfaces, which keep complete false and are never touched: external_base:<name> (payload files), data_base:<name> (data files\n  under a data base) and mem_wal (shards under _mem_wal/).\n\nTwo existing tests simulated an unrewritable fragment with a byte bound below\nits size; they now exclude the fragment at Lance''s compact_files call.\n\ntests: +10 -0 (parametrized cases of the existing\ntest_no_object_under_the_table_root_holds_the_identifier_or_the_report_names_what_keeps_it;\nno new test function, two tests'' setup changed)\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017XnXD48toDdU7HLsHN54Sv","tree":{"sha":"757c47eaca8391b379d281d45f2a0508189b4d78","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/git/trees/757c47eaca8391b379d281d45f2a0508189b4d78"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/git/commits/261fd4b67da3df0b60f9486b12910f83cde1eca0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48671678?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Borg93","id":48671678,"login":"Borg93","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NjcxNjc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commit/261fd4b67da3df0b60f9486b12910f83cde1eca0","node_id":"C_kwDOSh8U4doAKDI2MWZkNGI2N2RhM2RmMGI2MGY5NDg2YjEyOTEwZjgzY2RlMWVjYTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commit/5dec0b51d920da06e88dec9c1d37e7bc78bdd5e3","sha":"5dec0b51d920da06e88dec9c1d37e7bc78bdd5e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commits/5dec0b51d920da06e88dec9c1d37e7bc78bdd5e3"}],"sha":"261fd4b67da3df0b60f9486b12910f83cde1eca0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commits/261fd4b67da3df0b60f9486b12910f83cde1eca0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48671678?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Borg93","id":48671678,"login":"Borg93","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NjcxNjc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commits/5dec0b51d920da06e88dec9c1d37e7bc78bdd5e3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T14:55:41Z","email":"Borg93@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Borg93"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T15:56:36Z","email":"Borg93@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Borg93"},"message":"fix(catalog): an Overwrite is a new version of the same table, protected, grant-preserving and recorded as OVERWRITE (LH-242)\n\ncreate?mode=Overwrite and insert?mode=overwrite both write a Lance overwrite on\nthe same dataset, whose earlier versions stay readable. The catalog applied the\ndrop''s ownership reset (every grant revoked, overwriter seeded owner) and none\nof its protection, and recorded the writes as create_table / insert.\n\n- A protected table refuses both Overwrite modes 409 InvalidTableState unless\n  force=true (protection only; the insert door on any branch). The create door\n  now probes pre-existence for every Overwrite, FGA on or off.\n- An Overwrite of an existing table revokes no grant and grants the overwriter\n  no ownership; the create door keeps its owner-tier can_drop gate.\n- Both doors emit overwrite_table with lifecycleStateChange=OVERWRITE, kept a\n  RunEvent so the WROTE edge carries the version; no CREATED edge.\n- A create Overwrite over an existing table must keep each provenance column\n  and key field at its type (400 otherwise) and is written with the table''s\n  own fields and lineage.*/rask.* metadata (provenance_guard.keep_provenance).\n\ntests: +3 -1 (two new integration tests, one authz test replaced, three cases\nadded to the LH-208 provenance tests)\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017XnXD48toDdU7HLsHN54Sv","tree":{"sha":"7b2c4d0d1c40b5f83d2ee1c2bfe6a2f7e293cf14","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/git/trees/7b2c4d0d1c40b5f83d2ee1c2bfe6a2f7e293cf14"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/git/commits/5dec0b51d920da06e88dec9c1d37e7bc78bdd5e3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48671678?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Borg93","id":48671678,"login"