type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commits/c6fa7803e85826a5c9e14877e2a54fa3ce936a80/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T14:56:12Z","email":"Borg93@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Borg93"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T14:56:12Z","email":"Borg93@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Borg93"},"message":"chore(estate): a branch holds only its own files, one location has one holder, and a write event names its own commit, live at helm rev 277; LH-203, LH-204 and LH-214 close\n\nRead back at rev 277 (lance-rest-catalog lakehouse-e7c9413a), scratch namespace b7-probe-88d0239f\n(oct5/catalog-readback/batch7_probe.py):\n- LH-203: branch a 200, a/b 409 code 19, x/_indices 400 code 13; branch a''s write vend on RustFS PUTs\n  tree/a/data and is AccessDenied at tree/a/b/_versions and tree/ab/data.\n- LH-204: eight concurrent renames of one table to one destination: one 200, seven 409 code 14, one\n  live id (dst).\n- LH-214: four concurrent inserts'' lineage events name versions 2, 3, 4, 5; a delete on branch dev\n  names ref dev, version 6 and a branchIdentifier.\n- Health at 14:55:01Z (16 min after rollout): no lakehouse pod unready or restarted; the DLQ grew by\n  one: dlq.lineage.events. Traced: the probe''s own rename event, refused by lineage because the\n  rename had already moved src''s tuples (\"can_get_metadata required on inputs\"). The rename door''s\n  emit and tuple move are unchanged by this batch; a pre-existing defect the probe surfaced, parked\n  as LH-411 (MEDIUM). Recorded beside the as-written H1 verdict.\n\nRegister: three rows removed; 207 open / 199 workable / 37 HIGH; short list 21. Parked: LH-411 to LH-413.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017XnXD48toDdU7HLsHN54Sv","tree":{"sha":"8299adc6704af438ac4067a72a092b70e3c57e42","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/git/trees/8299adc6704af438ac4067a72a092b70e3c57e42"},"url":"https://api.github.com/r