org93/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commits/d3f27dae70ee659bf93fbedf49e1ce832766b18d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T13:54:37Z","email":"Borg93@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Borg93"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T13:54:37Z","email":"Borg93@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Borg93"},"message":"chore(estate): an external blob base is authorized per table and never vended, live at helm rev 276; LH-209 closes\n\nRead back at rev 276 (lance-rest-catalog and ingest lakehouse-de15d580), scratch namespace\nlh209-probe-4da3685f (oct5/catalog-readback/lh209_probe.py):\n- A plain create''s read vend lists its own table prefix (4 keys) and is AccessDenied under models/ in\n  both acme-bucket and lance-catalog.\n- A create requesting external_blob_base s3://lance-catalog/models/churn/ on a blob-v2 table answers\n  400 code 13 \"overlaps storage the catalog governs\"; an unapproved base answers 400 \"not inside an\n  approved external blob base\".\n- alice''s /produce reached gold (both hops source=job, versions 456, 337, no control refusal); an\n  ingest run of 4 units completed.\n- Health: DLQ unchanged, no lakehouse pod unready or restarted at 13:54:13Z (17 min after rollout).\nNot driven live (proved offline on the real catalog app and real pylance, red-checked): silver taking\nan upstream''s external pointers through ensure_stage_output, and a base planted over models/ refused at\nthe blob door and the register door.\n\nRegister: LH-209 removed; 210 open / 202 workable / 40 HIGH; short list 24. Parked: LH-409, LH-410.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017XnXD48toDdU7