n a missing branch 404 code 22 with no storage path; create_index on a missing\n  branch 406 code 0 with main unchanged; restore of branch dev to 2 answered 200, dev 3 -> 4, main\n  2 -> 2. As written that case read FAIL: the probe asked for version 1, which predates the branch\n  (parentVersion 2) and is rightly not found on it; recorded beside the corrected read.\n- Health: DLQ unchanged, no lakehouse pod unready or restarted at 13:36:16Z (15 min after rollout).\n\nRegister: two rows removed; 211 open / 203 workable / 41 HIGH; short list 25. Parked: LH-406 to LH-408.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017XnXD48toDdU7HLsHN54Sv","tree":{"sha":"f5cab0bfcc29066165b94eedf13b8fa345cf327d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/git/trees/f5cab0bfcc29066165b94eedf13b8fa345cf327d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/git/commits/4b204fb3fa71bccc142d9bee6e72ef1c666048a4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48671678?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Borg93","id":48671678,"login":"Borg93","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NjcxNjc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AI-Riksarkive