om/u/48671678?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Borg93","id":48671678,"login":"Borg93","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NjcxNjc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commits/93e215ad3d9bae8faddf59ac3f7005f4459a4402/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T12:42:53Z","email":"Borg93@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Borg93"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T13:05:11Z","email":"Borg93@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Borg93"},"message":"fix(catalog): a writer cannot rewrite a table''s provenance; maintenance names a dataset by its path (LH-208)\n\nReserved lineage.* and rask.* schema-metadata keys are refused 400 at\nschema_metadata/update (both routes, set or null), in a create payload''s\nschema and in create properties. insert?mode=overwrite refuses a reserved\nkey and hands either arm a body carrying the table''s own schema and field\nmetadata, so an overwrite can neither forge nor erase provenance or the key.\ndrop_columns and alter_columns refuse to drop, rename or re-type stage,\nlineage, source_rowid and every field carrying\nlance-schema:unenforced-primary-key plus its ancestors (keyed on the field\nmetadata); Lance''s own nullable-key refusal maps to 400, not 500. The checks\nlive in catalog.core.provenance_guard. The medallion''s ensure_stage_output\nstrips its upstream schema''s metadata before the create.\n\nA maintenance pass names a dataset by the id its path resolves to and by\nlineage.dataset_id only where the path names nothing\n(DatasetResult.declared_table_id -> table_id). blobs.external_base_of reads\nthe manifest only; rask.blob.external_base and stamp_external_base are\nremoved from service-kit, ingest and the medallion''s carry-forward.\n\ntests: +5 -4 (a parametrized integration test of 20 refusal cases, each red\nagainst its guard''s mutant; an insert-overwrite test over both arms and both\ncoercions; ensure_stage_output against the real catalog app; the maintenance\nnaming test replaces two; the blob-base stamp tests are replaced by one that\npins the key is ignored)\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017XnXD48toDdU7HLsHN54Sv","tree":{"sha":"eed793676dfff8dd0ff0286d740c79da83ecf738","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/git/trees/eed793676dfff8dd0ff0286d740c79da83ecf738"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/git/commits/93e215ad3d9bae8faddf59ac3f7005f4459a4402","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48671678?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Borg93","id":48671678,"login":"Borg93","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NjcxNjc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/us