5T13:04:58Z","email":"Borg93@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Borg93"},"message":"fix(catalog): restore serves its branch and the branch gate drives the doors (LH-272)\n\nrestore_table handed a branch-carrying body to native.call with nothing in the\ndoor deciding the branch. Measured on pylance 12.0.0, the upstream dir op does\nrestore the named ref, but a missing branch answered 404 code 4 with a storage\npath, and the RESTORE lineage edge was read back off main. The door now opens\nthe ref first (22 for a missing branch, 11 for a version the branch lacks) and\npasses the branch to the lineage read-back.\n\nThe AST gate that guarded this seam read source and could not see\nrun_in_threadpool(native.call, ...), which is how restore escaped it. It is\nreplaced by a behavioural test that drives each of the fourteen doors handing a\nbranched spec model to the upstream op with a branch the table lacks, through\nthe real catalog app on real pylance, pinning each door''s answer and that main\ntook no commit. create_index''s refusal is now caught (mutant: 200 from main).\n\ntests: +2 -1\n- tests/integration/test_a_declared_branch_is_never_silently_dropped.py (new,\n  14 cases) replaces services/catalog/tests/test_a_declared_branch_is_never_silently_dropped.py\n- test_column_branch.py::test_restore_on_a_branch_rewinds_the_branch_and_stamps_its_lineage\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017XnXD48toDdU7HLsHN54Sv","tree":{"sha":"c89b6fb247dd16a169b7a4056d8a302a9379fac8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/git/trees/c89b6fb247dd16a169b7a4056d8a302a9379fac8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/git/commits/5e4e230407e6671fdf041edbd2d9b805ca3d9d0d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48671678?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://a