- R1: the new head projects rask-lineage and rask-medallion; no stage_run/train_run registration\n  anywhere; medallion-plan-sweep-cron (@every 30s) scoped to the producer and the three runners.\n- R2: alice''s /produce reached gold; both hops closed by the job''s own report (source=job), the\n  versions read from the commit marker (446, 326); CATALOG_CONTROL 12 -> 14 (two run_planned);\n  no consumer refused a signature.\n- R3 (owner-approved; method 3 per the owner''s cloud-native steer): a time-boxed NetworkPolicy\n  refused the head''s traffic to silver-to-gold; the gold job committed v333, its report was\n  refused (Connection refused, in the job log), and the sweep closed the plan succeeded with\n  committed_version 333, source=sweep, no FAIL; the policy was deleted. As written the check\n  read FAIL: its \"still open while blocked\" read came after the sweep had already closed the plan\n  (11:37:29.96Z); recorded beside the corrected verdict. Two earlier attempts (scale to 0; scale to\n  0 plus force-delete) could not lose the report: a 3 s job reached the dying pod both times.\n- R4: a /train run closed through the producer''s door (source=job, registry version 105).\n- R5: a report for a non-existent run: head token 404, a person''s token 401.\n- R6: DLQ unchanged, no pod unready or restarted, the head ready.\n\nRegister: CP-029 removed, LH-226 is FOCUS 1; 216 open / 208 workable / 44 HIGH. Parked from its\nreviews: LH-392 to LH-398.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017XnXD48toDdU7HLsHN54Sv","tree":{"sha":"58d7d695dc0e299dce2fdfb7e92ed6ed8e514bab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/git/trees/58d7d695dc0e299dce2fdfb7e92ed6ed8e514bab"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/git/commits/c2ae0285a32d94a9e33884eca5ad94d1b574cf85","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48671678