lowing_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Borg93","id":48671678,"login":"Borg93","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NjcxNjc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commits/1feab46a31ae42965cc889945fca762a19b3a079/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T08:34:17Z","email":"Borg93@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Borg93"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T08:34:17Z","email":"Borg93@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Borg93"},"message":"feat(ctl021): the notifications reconciler reads every warehouse''s runs through a rung of its own\n\nThe walk read lineage''s per-dataset-governed /events as `notifications`, which held `reader` on\nwarehouse:lance_catalog alone, so a run whose output lived in a tenant warehouse never reached the\nlane while every tick logged lineage_feed_reconciled.\n\n- model.fga: `estate.event_reader: [user]` and `can_read_event_feed: owner or event_reader`, the\n  event_stager shape with no role#assignee; model.json regenerated with `fga model transform`.\n- lineage: /events/projection is gated on can_read_event_feed at the root object (was\n  can_observe_events, which also mints tenants, edits tuples and registers stores), answers a\n  FeedProjection whose rows carry only the targeting view (run id, state, time, the author and lance\n  facets, output names), and drops the meaningless `summary` parameter.\n- notifications: LineageFeedClient.page walks /events/projection; cursor, page cap, oldest_seq and\n  the walk''s gap/truncation logic are unchanged.\n- chart: bootstrap-admin grants `notifications` event_reader on estate:rask and no longer grants it\n  reader on the default warehouse; alert prose and values comment follow.\n- docs/lineage-openapi.json and the generated TS client regenerated; DECISIONS entry; rask-notifications\n  and rask-services-fleet skills corrected.\n\ntests: +1 -2 (pytest: +tests/integration/test_the_feed_walk_reaches_every_warehouse.py; -the source-reading\nservices/lineage/tests/test_the_feed_has_an_estate_projection.py; -test_reconciler.py''s summary=false poll\ntest, its seam now driven end to end). model.fga.yaml: +10 checks in the existing estate-root case.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017XnXD48toDdU7HLsHN54Sv","tree":{"sha":"51f49facc333eeb6b5c1e925a8ab347ea38f7d89","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/git/trees/51f49facc333eeb6b5c1e925a8ab347ea38f7d89"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/git/commits/1feab46a31ae42965cc889945fca762a19b3a079","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48671678?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Borg93","id":48671678,"login":"Borg93","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NjcxNjc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/starred{/owner}{/repo}","s