very foreign credential refused at the secret API; genuine flows and an ingest run\n  unchanged; held overnight.\n- Rev E (rev 270, 2026-10-05, owner-approved switch-over): operator mode with route authorization; nine streams recreated\n  as admin; every connection authenticated, none anonymous; credential-less and foreign-credential publishes refused on\n  every subject family with no stream moving; cascade to gold, a grant notification and an ingest run of 11 units drained\n  through ingest''s own user, all under auth.\nThe register drops the row (cross-cutting 12 -> 11, HIGH 47 -> 46, open 219 -> 218); DECISIONS records slices 2 and 3;\nOPERATORS.md § 7 gives production provisioning, the switch-over and the admin creds recipe; the runbooks'' consumer\nremovals name it; rask-helm and rask-testing describe the mint and the nats-auth lane. Release at rev 270: 1,027,952 B\nstored, 20,624 B headroom.\n\ntests: +0 -0\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017XnXD48toDdU7HLsHN54Sv","tree":{"sha":"2e1cc4bdf5a11df5bdf829d5ec655fed26e42148","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/git/trees/2e1cc4bdf5a11df5bdf829d5ec655fed26e42148"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/git/commits/131041c0456cf9ea314b8cdd5fe3131890a9dc84","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48671678?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Borg93","id":48671678,"login":"Borg93","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NjcxNjc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/received_events"