026-10-04T20:22:45Z","email":"Borg93@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Borg93"},"message":"merge(xc078-s2-na): every bus client carries its own NATS user from the store; the server''s operator mode prepared and off (XC-078)\n\nPhase N-A: one permission table in values (one user per app-id plus admin, monitor, ingest; v1 acks per durable, measured);\nevery pubsub.jetstream Component names nats-user-<app> from lance-secrets, the shared components split so each names one\napp''s user; every app''s deny list hides every nats-* secret (ingest reads only its own); the dev OpenBao mints the trust\nroot with nsc and carries it over a surge (owner ruling R1: production provisions, attested by nats.auth.provisioned);\nthe stream Job runs as admin from an ESO-synced creds file; the operator-mode server config and route authorization sit\nbehind nats.auth.server, off, so nats.conf renders byte-identical to base. Verified in its worktree: RED 28 cases, red\ncheck only its 30, full offline lane 6017 passed; on real binaries in Dagger, a 3-node operator-mode cluster with route\nauth refused an uncredentialed route and the rendered stream Job created all 9 streams as admin.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017XnXD48toDdU7HLsHN54Sv","tree":{"sha":"1d64074fff2ee4149df12b2913a2b7ee4268f62d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/git/trees/1d64074fff2ee4149df12b2913a2b7ee4268f62d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/git/commits/265216cb754a0f0c3a1518cc9d720725aaab9018","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48671678?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Borg93","id":48671678,"login":"Borg93","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NjcxNjc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commit/265216cb754a0f0c3a1518cc9d720725aaab9018","node_id":"C_kwDOSh8U4doAKDI2NTIxNmNiNzU0YTBmMGMzYTE1MThjYzlkNzIwNzI1YWFhYjkwMTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commit/a984ffbc6292abd8f50c412085e68f43ea4091ff","sha":"a984ffbc6292abd8f50c412085e68f43ea4091ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commits/a984ffbc6292abd8f50c412085e68f43ea4091ff"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commit/b413093cbb6b8e4968a9db2de2c93a3f0c81b93e","sha":"b413093cbb6b8e4968a9db2de2c93a3f0c81b93e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commits/b413093cbb6b8e4968a9db2de2c93a3f0c81b93e"}],"sha":"265216cb754a0f0c3a1518cc9d720725aaab9018","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commits/265216cb754a0f0c3a1518cc9d720725aaab9018"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48671678?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Borg93","id":48671678,"login":"Borg93","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NjcxNjc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commits/b413093cbb6b8e4968a9db2de2c93a3f0c81b93e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T20:15:26Z","email":"Borg93@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Borg93"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T20:15:26Z","email":"Borg93@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Borg93"},"message":"feat(chart): every bus client carries its own NATS user before the server asks for one (XC-078)\n\nSlice 2 phase N-A, behind lance.secretsViaDapr like the signing pairs; the server is unchanged.\n\n- values.yaml nats.auth.users is the one permission table: a user per app-id holding a\n  pubsub.jetstream Component, plus admin (the stream Job), monitor (nats-box) and ingest. Acks are\n  v1 and per durable ($JS.ACK.<S>.<D>.>; nats-server 2.14.2 sends v1), only the server-named\n  consumers ack stream-wide, no app holds $JS.API.>. catalog.control.v1 is published by the\n  producer''s promotion_review, never a stage runner, and no stage runner publishes its downstream\n  topic.\n- Every pub/sub Component names its one app''s nats-user-<app> (jwt, seedKey) from lance-secrets.\n  The components two apps shared are split: the catalog enqueues on its own\n  maintenance-work/index components, maintenance and the annotator announce on their own control\n  components, lineage-pubsub drops maintenance (which keeps its own lineage component with no\n  queue lane).\n- Every app''s deny list hides every nats-user-*, nats-root and nats-route; ingest keeps its own user.\n- The dev seed (bundled OpenBao, R1) carries the trust root and route credential from the store\n  behind the Service, else mints them with nsc 2.15 copied out of nats-box 0.19.7, issues every\n  table user afresh, and writes them before the readiness key. The APP account''s JetStream disk is\n  unlimited: an account limit counts every replica (measured), so 1Gi would hold a third.\n- A store the chart does not seed, or a bus it does not run, is refused until\n  nats.auth.provisioned (templates/nats-provisioned.yaml).\n- The stream Job takes admin as an ESO-written creds file and fails on an auth refusal instead of\n  waiting; the ESO policy reads exactly those paths.\n- N-B prepared and off: nats.auth.server includes the operator-mode and route files an\n  ExternalSecret writes, and gives nats-box monitor. Off, every NATS document is byte-identical.\n\nMeasured on real binaries in Dagger: the rendered seed against OpenBao 2.2.0 mints, then carries the\nidentical operator across a surge; the rendered nats.conf passes nats-server -t in operator mode; a\n3-node cluster forms with route authorization, refuses a route without the credential, and the\nrendered stream Job creates every stream as admin.\n\nRelease delta, packed as rask-helm describes: +13,980 B (manifest +4,644, templates +8,444,\nvalues +1,376).\n\nFive sealed-store test overlays and scripts/prod_render_check.sh now attest nats.auth.provisioned.\n\ntests: +0 -0 (functions); collected cases +2 (the secret-resolution test renders the two splits a\nflag gates); the RED commit''s app-id lookup now reads past a null annotations map.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017XnXD48toDdU7HLsHN54Sv","tree":{"sha":"4ae185936a69ad43bf74de093b7d6d95365e31c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/git/trees/4ae185936a69ad43bf74de093b7d6d95365e31c9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/git/commits/b413093cbb6b8e4968a9db2de2c93a3f0c81b93e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.github