tarred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commits/ec0d8abd680627dc9ff2fc42d05c7a47d22c17aa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T19:43:46Z","email":"Borg93@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Borg93"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T19:43:46Z","email":"Borg93@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Borg93"},"message":"test(xc078): RED - every bus client authenticates as its own NATS user, from the store\n\nSlice 2 phase N-A, the chart-render gate. Each assertion goes red against main 102a163b, on its own\nmessage:\n\n- every pub/sub Component names its one app''s nats-user-<app> (jwt and seedKey) from lance-secrets,\n  the store is scoped to that app, no shared token exists, and the user the dev seed issues may consume\n  through the component''s durable and publish or consume every topic the app''s pods are given; every\n  *_PUBSUB env names a component scoped to its own app (the extended secret-resolution test, 3 overlays)\n- the stream Job, and with nats.auth.server nats-box and the NATS servers, mount their credentials as\n  files an ExternalSecret writes from the store; operator mode is two included files the reloader\n  watches, the server switch off leaves nats.conf without auth, and the switch is refused without ESO\n- every app''s deny list hides every nats-user-*, nats-root and nats-route, except ingest''s own user\n- the dev seed issues every table user from a carried or minted trust root, writes them before the\n  readiness key, and refuses a root it cannot use\n- a store nothing seeds, and a bus the platform runs, are refused until nats.auth.provisioned\n\ntests: +3 -2 (one new function, two renamed: the deny-list and attestation tests now name the bus);\ncollected cases +7 (new function 3, dev seed 15 -> 18, attestation 2 -> 3)\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017XnXD48toDdU7HLsHN54Sv","tree":{"sha":"d61a82487ee721ade37c06d717200e2ec8770b9c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/git/trees/d61a82487ee721ade37c06d717200e2ec8770b9c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/git/commits/ec0d8abd680627dc9ff2fc42d05c7a47d22c17aa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48671678?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Borg93","id":48671678,"login":"Borg93","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NjcxNjc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commit/ec0d8abd680627dc9ff2fc42d05c7a47d22c17aa","node_id":"C_kwDOSh8U4doAKGVjMGQ4YWJkNjgwNjI3ZGM5ZmYyZmM0MmQwNWM3YTQ3ZDIyYzE3YWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commit/102a163bd6026d7e63b1bfe1316e47b93bd0a79c","sha":"102a163bd6026d7e63b1bfe1316e47b93bd0a79c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commits/102a163bd6026d7e63b1bfe1316e47b93bd0a79c"}],"sha":"ec0d8abd680627dc9ff2fc42d05c7a47d22c17aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commits/ec0d8abd680627dc9ff2fc42d05c7a47d22c17aa"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48671678?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Borg93","id":48671678,"login":"Borg93","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NjcxNjc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commits/adbebbbb4bdd9c57cc2fcb324c4bee2460ca92a6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T19:42:51Z","email":"Borg93@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Borg93"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T19:42:51Z","email":"Borg93@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Borg93"},"message":"test(xc078): the provisional NATS table carries the allowances the broker and daprd measured\n\nThe lane''s provisional table (tests/e2e-py/nats_auth_provisional_values.yaml)\nnow holds what `dagger call nats-auth` measured on nats-server 2.14.2 and\ndaprd 1.18.1, and the lane passes against it (1 passed in 10.06 s). The same\ntwo corrections belong in the chart''s table:\n\n- acks: `$JS.ACK.<S>.>` for every stream a client consumes, in place of the\n  spec''s `$JS.ACK.*.*.<S>.>`. The server stamps each delivery''s ack subject\n  as `$JS.ACK.<stream>.<consumer>.<delivered>.<stream seq>.<consumer seq>.\n  <timestamp>.<pending>` (daprd''s measured acks: `$JS.ACK.LINEAGE.\n  notifications-durable.1.8.1.<ts>.0`, `$JS.ACK.CATALOG_CONTROL.<generated\n  name>.1.3.1.<ts>.0`), so the two leading wildcards never match and every\n  ack is refused.\n- bronze-to-silver loses `medallion.silver`: a stage runner promotes through\n  the catalog (services/medallion/src/medallion/services/transform.py) and\n  re-wakes only its own topic, so its only medallion publishes are\n  medallion.bronze and medallion.promotion.\n\nIngest keeps `$JS.API.STREAM.NAMES` here because this tree''s work queue\ncalls pull_subscribe without `stream=`; the slice 3 client names its stream\nand the chart''s table, which the lane reads by default, follows that.\n\nThe rig reads `nats.auth: null` as no table (a LookupError naming the file)\nrather than an AttributeError, and its docstring says what a credential''s\nrepr shows.\n\ntests: +0 -0 (test functions); collected cases unchanged\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017XnXD48toDdU7HLsHN54Sv","tree":{"sha":"1aa77bc7a0199be9b2b7891c41e29d3b24b2605f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/git/trees/1aa77bc7a0199be9b2b7891c41e29d3b24b2605f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/git/commits/adbebbbb4bdd9c57cc2fcb324c4bee2460ca92a6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48671678?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Borg93","id":48671678,"login":"Borg93","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NjcxNjc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commit/adbebbbb4bdd9c57cc2fcb324c4bee2460ca92a6","node_id":"C_kwDOSh8U4doAKGFkYmViYmJiNGJkZDljNTdjYzJmY2IzMjRjNGJlZTI0NjBjYTkyYTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commit/999f5abdb7c0283b6fef8e24f3d34806d2f76f95","sha":"999f5abdb7c0283b6fef8e24f3d34806d2f76f95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commits/999f5abdb7c0283b6fef8e24f3d34806d2f76f95"}],"sha":"adbebbbb4bdd9c57cc2fcb324c4bee2460ca92a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commits/adbebbbb4bdd9c57cc2fcb324c4bee2460ca92a6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48671678?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Borg93","id":48671678,"login":"Borg93","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NjcxNjc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commits/999f5abdb7c0283b6fef8e24f3d34806d2f76f95/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T19:40:19Z","email":"Borg93@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Borg93"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T19:40:19Z","email":"Borg93@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Borg93"},"message":"test(xc078): RED - the NATS permission table derived from the spec fails a real operator-mode broker\n\nOne integration test for closes-when clause 1 and the ingest clause, run by\na new Dagger lane (`dagger call nats-auth`, `make nats-auth`). It mints an\noperator, a SYS account, one APP account with JetStream and one user per row\nof `nats.auth.users` with nsc from natsio/nats-box:0.19.7 (test-only keys made\ninside the run), runs the chart''s nats-server 2.14.2 in operator mode with a\nMEMORY resolver, and then: runs the chart''s stream Job as `admin` (twice, the\nsecond over a planted orphan durable and a drifted bound), refuses a client\nwith no credential, drives every table user against every data subject (an\nowner''s publish must be acked, anyone else''s refused with each stream''s\nlast_seq unchanged), replays every Dapr subscription exactly as Dapr 1.18.1''s\npubsub.jetstream builds it, drains an ingest run through ingest''s own client\nand user, reads the broker as `monitor` with nats-box''s CLI, and runs real\ndaprd 1.18.1 per Component shape (publisher-only, durable subscriber with a\ndead-letter topic, the catalog''s ephemeral broadcast subscriber) from the\nchart''s own render. The broker''s log, read once it stops, judges every\nrefusal, and every subject daprd used must be one the replay also exercises.\n\nWho may publish each subject and what each sidecar subscribes are declared in\nthe test, independently of the table, so a table that is too broad fails as\nsurely as one that is too narrow. The lane copies each binary out of the image\nthe chart deploys and the test refuses images the render does not carry.\n\nRED against tests/e2e-py/nats_auth_provisional_values.yaml, the table derived\nfrom the spec''s rules and the research (report 2c/2d):\n- every ack is refused: the spec''s `$JS.ACK.*.*.<S>.>` never matches what\n  nats-server 2.14.2 sends, `$JS.ACK.<stream>.<consumer>.<n>.<n>.<n>.<ts>.<n>`,\n  so daprd''s deliveries stay unacked (LINEAGE/notifications-durable holds 1\n  after daprd handled it; the broker redelivers each after ackWait 720s, up\n  to maxDeliver 3) and ingest''s drain leaves its 3 units unacked;\n- bronze-to-silver may publish medallion.silver, which only the producer and\n  silver-to-gold publish: a stage runner promotes through the catalog\n  (transform.py), it never publishes downstream, and MEDALLION''s last_seq\n  moved under a publish that had to be refused.\n\n`.dagger/test.go` gains withRenderableChart, the helm and subchart setup the\npytest lane already ran, now shared so the two lanes render the same chart.\n\ntests: +1 -0 (test functions); collected cases +1, deselected by every\noffline lane (e2e by location) and selected by the nats_auth marker.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017XnXD48toDdU7HLsHN54Sv","tree":{"sha":"b12b761e4d4781928b82ce82c3781c3baafd4379","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/git/trees/b12b761e4d4781928b82ce82c3781c3baafd4379"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/git/commits/999f5abdb7c0283b6fef8e24f3d34806d2f76f95","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48671678?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Borg93","id":48671678,"login":"Borg93","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NjcxNjc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commit/999f5abdb7c0283b6fef8e24f3d34806d2f76f95","node_id":"C_kwDOSh8U4doAKDk5OWY1YWJkYjdjMDI4M2I2ZmVmOGUyNGYzZDM0ODA2ZDJmNzZmOTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commit/102a163bd6026d7e63b1bfe1316e47b93bd0a79c","sha":"102a163bd6026d7e63b1bfe1316e47b93bd0a79c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commits/102a163bd6026d7e63b1bfe1316e47b93bd0a79c"}],"sha":"999f5abdb7c0283b6fef8e24f3d34806d2f76f95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commits/999f5abdb7c0283b6fef8e24f3d34806d2f76f95"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48671678?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Borg93","id":48671678,"login":"Borg93","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NjcxNjc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commits/4da959d420a85d2816483b8daa440cf3e395f28a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T19:34:46Z","email":"Borg93@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Borg93"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T19:34:46Z","email":"Borg93@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Borg93"},"message":"merge(xc078-s3-ingest): ingest''s raw NATS client presents its own user, inert until the credential exists (XC-078)\n\nSlice 3: both connect seams sign the server nonce with lineage_kit''s SigningKey from nats-user-ingest read through the\nsidecar''s secret API (never env); pull_subscribe names its stream so STREAM.NAMES is not needed; the chart renders\nRASK_NATS_URL from lance.natsUrl. Verified in its worktree: RED on the stand-in operator-mode broker, red check only its\ntwo cases, full offline lane 6010 passed, ty clean, 9 import contracts kept.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017XnXD48toDdU7HLsHN54Sv","tree":{"sha":"f3f72e9f44240d30bea30522c0c7a1bed5c4db07","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/git/trees/f3f72e9f44240d30bea30522c0c7a1bed5c4db07"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/git/commits/4da959d420a85d2816483b8daa440cf3e395f28a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48671678?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Borg93","id":48671678,"login":"Borg93","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NjcxNjc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commit/4da959d420a85d2816483b8daa440cf3e395f28a","node_id":"C_kwDOSh8U4doAKDRkYTk1OWQ0MjBhODVkMjgxNjQ4M2I4ZGFhNDQwY2YzZTM5NWYyOGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commit/102a163bd6026d7e63b1bfe1316e47b93bd0a79c","sha":"102a163bd6026d7e63b1bfe1316e47b93bd0a79c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commits/102a163bd6026d7e63b1bfe1316e47b93bd0a79c"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commit/5cb476aa7806197b6209cdbd371a902419fee9b5","sha":"5cb476aa7806197b6209cdbd371a902419fee9b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commits/5cb476aa7806197b6209cdbd371a902419fee9b5"}],"sha":"4da959d420a85d2816483b8daa440cf3e395f28a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commits/4da959d420a85d2816483b8daa440cf3e395f28a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48671678?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Borg93","id":48671678,"login":"Borg93","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NjcxNjc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commits/5cb476aa7806197b6209cdbd371a902419fee9b5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T19:28:56Z","email":"Borg93@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Borg93"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T19:28:56Z","email":"Borg93@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Borg93"},"message":"feat(ingest): the work queue connects to NATS as ingest''s own user (XC-078)\n\nIngest''s work queue is a direct nats-py client, so it presents its own NATS\nuser instead of riding a sidecar''s component. The lifespan reads\nnats-user-ingest (fields jwt and seed) through the sidecar''s secret API, with\nthe store''s boot budget and before the workflow runtime starts, and holds it\nfor the process (ingest.nats_user). Both connect seams, WorkQueue.connect and\ninspect_queue, present it through nats-py''s user_jwt_cb and signature_cb: the\nJWT, and the server''s nonce signed with lineage_kit''s SigningKey loaded from\nthe NKEY user seed. No new package (nats-py''s creds path needs nkeys, which\nis not in uv.lock).\n\nInert while unset: a service whose secrets do not come from the store, or a\nstore without nats-user-ingest, connects with no credential as before, and a\nserver that does not authenticate sends no nonce, so nothing is presented to\nit. A secret the store holds that is no usable NATS user refuses the boot.\n\npull_subscribe names its stream, so the client no longer needs\n$JS.API.STREAM.NAMES. Measured through the real nats-py 2.15.0 client against\na recording stand-in broker, ingest''s queue seams now publish only on\n$JS.API.STREAM.CREATE.{INGEST,DLQ}, $JS.API.STREAM.INFO.{INGEST,DLQ},\n$JS.API.STREAM.PURGE.INGEST, $JS.API.CONSUMER.{INFO,DELETE,MSG.NEXT}.INGEST.<d>,\n$JS.API.CONSUMER.CREATE.INGEST.<d>.ingest.tasks.<run>, ingest.tasks.<run>,\ndlq.ingest.tasks and the ack subject the server stamps, and subscribe only\nunder _INBOX.\n\nThe chart renders RASK_NATS_URL on the ingest Deployment from lance.natsUrl,\nso ingest follows the release name and nats.externalUrl like every other NATS\nclient; it read the code default nats://rask-nats:4222 everywhere. Release\ndelta: +18 B of gzipped default manifest, +214 B of template source.\n\ntests: +0 -0 (the RED commit 4a24a7e5 added the one test, 2 cases)\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017XnXD48toDdU7HLsHN54Sv","tree":{"sha":"f3f72e9f44240d30bea30522c0c7a1bed5c4db07","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/git/trees/f3f72e9f44240d30bea30522c0c7a1bed5c4db07"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/git/commits/5cb476aa7806197b6209cdbd371a902419fee9b5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48671678?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Borg93","id":48671678,"login":"Borg93","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NjcxNjc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commit/5cb476aa7806197b6209cdbd371a902419fee9b5","node_id":"C_kwDOSh8U4doAKDVjYjQ3NmFhNzgwNjE5N2I2MjA5Y2RiZDM3MWE5MDI0MTlmZWU5YjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commit/4a24a7e5932b3f041a547af3956832c41530c188","sha":"4a24a7e5932b3f041a547af3956832c41530c188","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commits/4a24a7e5932b3f041a547af3956832c41530c188"}],"sha":"5cb476aa7806197b6209cdbd371a902419fee9b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commits/5cb476aa7806197b6209cdbd371a902419fee9b5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48671678?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Borg93","id":48671678,"login":"Borg93","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NjcxNjc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commits/4a24a7e5932b3f041a547af3956832c41530c188/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T19:21:27Z","email":"Borg93@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Borg93"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T19:21:27Z","email":"Borg93@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Borg93"},"message":"test(xc078): RED - each NATS connect seam must present ingest''s own user\n\nIngest''s work queue is a direct nats-py client, so its two connect seams\n(WorkQueue.connect, which every activity body uses, and inspect_queue behind\nGET /queue) must present ingest''s NATS user themselves: the user JWT and the\nserver''s nonce signed with the user''s seed, read at startup from\nnats-user-ingest through the sidecar''s secret API.\n\nThe test drives the real app and its lifespan against a stand-in\noperator-mode broker that judges each CONNECT as the server''s authentication\ndoes. It fails on its own assertion for both seams: the broker saw no user\nJWT (once from the probe, three times from the work queue''s bounded retry).\n\nThe lifespan stand-ins move from the signing-key test to the suite''s conftest\n(secret_store_lifespan), shared by both tests; that test''s store also answers\nnats-user-ingest, which the same lifespan will read.\n\ntests: +1 -0 (test functions); collected cases +2\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017XnXD48toDdU7HLsHN54Sv","tree":{"sha":"f7f566ae24352a27f92c8820845b9c1eb0cfcb89","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/git/trees/f7f566ae24352a27f92c8820845b9c1eb0cfcb89"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/git/commits/4a24a7e5932b3f041a547af3956832c41530c188","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48671678?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Borg93","id":48671678,"login":"Borg93","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NjcxNjc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commit/4a24a7e5932b3f041a547af3956832c41530c188","node_id":"C_kwDOSh8U4doAKDRhMjRhN2U1OTMyYjNmMDQxYTU0N2FmMzk1NjgzMmM0MTUzMGMxODg","parents":[{"h