g93/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commits/d79c83c49cf0f2a126c58381b9edd6d71d253a0b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T17:07:25Z","email":"Borg93@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Borg93"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T17:07:25Z","email":"Borg93@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Borg93"},"message":"fix(xc078): each cascade head exports its refusal series at zero before its first refusal\n\nTriage row D, medallion part (XC-078 slice 1 review). `rate(medallion_signature_refused_total[5m]) > 0`\ncannot see a cumulative series born at 1, so the first refusal on a (door, reason) paged nobody.\n\n`metrics.start_signature_refused_series(door, reasons)` adds 0 to every (door, reason) series of\n`medallion.signature.refused`; `signature_door.start_refusal_series(door)` passes the closed reason\nset, `lineage_kit.signing.RefusalReason`; `register_bronze_arrival_route` calls it for each head it\nregisters (/bronze-arrival always, /publication-arrival with the control lane), 12 series per door.\nA function only: nothing in metrics.py that another module could hold by identity across the door\ntest''s reload of the module.\n\nWhen: at registration. An add on the API''s proxy meter before a MeterProvider exists is dropped, and\nthe chart runs the producer under `opentelemetry-instrument`, whose sitecustomize installs the\nprovider before uvicorn imports the app. Read back offline: `auto_instrumentation.initialize()` (what\nthat sitecustomize calls) with the console exporter, then `import medallion.producer`: the installed\nprovider is the SDK MeterProvider, and the export carries 24 `medallion.signature.refused` points,\nboth doors, every value 0.\n\n`medallion.signature.would_refuse` is unchanged: no alert reads its rate.\n\ntests: +0 -0 (functions).\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017XnXD48toDdU7HLsHN54Sv","tree":{"sha":"f009b2f407a0fe277285bbf92b04b13f909748aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/git/trees/f009b2f407a0fe277285bbf92b04b13f909748aa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/git/commits/d79c83c49cf0f2a126c58381b9edd6d71d253a0b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48671678?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Borg93","id":48671678,"login":"Borg93","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NjcxNjc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commit/d79c83c49cf0f2a126c58381b9edd6d71d253a0b","node_id":"C_kwDOSh8U4doAKGQ3OWM4M2M0OWNmMGYyYTEyNmM1ODM4MWI5ZWRkNmQ3MWQyNTNhMGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commit/d7f9a6d4d45711c4316aa889930d1167cc810f70","sha":"d7f9a6d4d45711c4316aa889930d1167cc810f70","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commits/d7f9a6d4d45711c4316aa889930d1167cc810f70"}],"sha":"d79c83c49cf0f2a126c58381b9edd6d71d253a0b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commits/d79c83c49cf0f2a126c58381b9edd6d71d253a0b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48671678?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Borg93","id":48671678,"login":"Borg93","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NjcxNjc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commits/d7f9a6d4d45711c4316aa889930d1167cc810f70/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T17:03:28Z","email":"Borg93@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Borg93"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T17:03:28Z","email":"Borg93@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Borg93"},"message":"test(xc078): RED - a cascade head''s first refusal makes a series no rate alert can see\n\nTriage row D, medallion part (XC-078 slice 1 review). MedallionHeadRefusingEvents reads\n`rate(medallion_signature_refused_total[5m]) > 0`, and `medallion.signature.refused` is a cumulative\ncounter whose series is born at 1 by the first refusal, so that refusal has no rate and pages nobody.\n\nThe door test''s counter assertion, read through its real in-memory metric reader, now expects every\n(door, reason) refusal series of the producer''s two heads at zero from the moment the routes are\nregistered, plus what the case moved: the doors from the test''s own door names, the reasons from\n`lineage_kit.signing.RefusalReason`. One assertion changed, none added.\n\nFails on its own assertion in every case: the 24 zero series are absent (only the series a case\nmoved exists).\n\ntests: +0 -0 (functions); collected cases unchanged.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017XnXD48toDdU7HLsHN54Sv","tree":{"sha":"74521647ef462d3b83b002777612ff53b3a280b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/git/trees/74521647ef462d3b83b002777612ff53b3a280b2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/git/commits/d7f9a6d4d45711c4316aa889930d1167cc810f70","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48671678?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Borg93","id":48671678,"login":"Borg93","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NjcxNjc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commit/d7f9a6d4d45711c4316aa889930d1167cc810f70","node_id":"C_kwDOSh8U4doAKGQ3ZjlhNmQ0ZDQ1NzExYzQzMTZhYTg4OTkzMGQxMTY3Y2M4MTBmNzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commit/c28da42e20e5b1a6ef790b070d4ed1ed802b030a","sha":"c28da42e20e5b1a6ef790b070d4ed1ed802b030a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commits/c28da42e20e5b1a6ef790b070d4ed1ed802b030a"}],"sha":"d7f9a6d4d45711c4316aa889930d1167cc810f70","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commits/d7f9a6d4d45711c4316aa889930d1167cc810f70"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48671678?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Borg93","id":48671678,"login":"Borg93","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NjcxNjc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commits/c28da42e20e5b1a6ef790b070d4ed1ed802b030a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T17:02:17Z","email":"Borg93@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Borg93"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T17:02:17Z","email":"Borg93@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Borg93"},"message":"fix(xc078): promotion_review waits out the producer''s key and records its outcome instead of failing\n\nTriage row B (XC-078 slice 1 review).\n\n`SIGNING_ACTIVITY_RETRY` for the two activities that sign, `request_approval` and\n`emit_promotion_outcome`. Their failure to plan for is a key miss: the producer''s holder still\nresolving, which heals in place. The budget is sized from the holder (service_kit\ngoverned/signing_key.py): attempts at the holder''s own re-read cadence, 15 s (`retry_seconds`, which\n`make_signing_holder` leaves at its default), for one `MAX_REFRESH_SECONDS` (the window in which every\nsigner is expected to have re-resolved) plus one re-read: 2 + 300 // 15 = 22 attempts, the last at\n315 s. ACTIVITY_RETRY stops after 2 + 4 + 8 + 16 = 30 s.\n\nBoundaries, as around `publish_promotion`: an ask that exhausts its budget is recorded BLOCKED with\nthe failure among the reasons (\"no reachable approver\" plus why) and the instance completes; every\n`emit_promotion_outcome` goes through `_record_outcome`, which logs a record it could not send\nwithin the budget (`medallion_promotion_outcome_unrecorded`, skipped on replay) and lets the review\nreturn its status, never FAILED.\n\n`emit_promotion_outcome` checks the key first (`lineage_publish.require_signing_key`): a miss raises\nfor the retry before anything is counted or sent, where best_effort used to swallow it and drop the\ndurable record on the first attempt (and a count taken first would repeat per attempt). Publish\nfailures after the check stay best-effort, as before.\n\nRead back with the reviewer''s own SDK-executor repro (key never resolves, turn cap raised for the\nlonger budget): 22 request_approval attempts, ORCHESTRATION_STATUS_COMPLETED, the BLOCKED record\nscheduled. Before: 5 attempts, ORCHESTRATION_STATUS_FAILED, no record.\n\ntests: +0 -0 (functions).\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017XnXD48toDdU7HLsHN54Sv","tree":{"sha":"a823e43693946f64079e639fe546894903217d58","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/git/trees/a823e43693946f64079e639fe546894903217d58"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/git/commits/c28da42e20e5b1a6ef790b070d4ed1ed802b030a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48671678?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Borg93","id":48671678,"login":"Borg93","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NjcxNjc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commit/c28da42e20e5b1a6ef790b070d4ed1ed802b030a","node_id":"C_kwDOSh8U4doAKGMyOGRhNDJlMjBlNWIxYTZlZjc5MGIwNzBkNGVkMWVkODAyYjAzMGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commit/73b27c107586d674c418548184c4977a93ba20a6","sha":"73b27c107586d674c418548184c4977a93ba20a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commits/73b27c107586d674c418548184c4977a93ba20a6"}],"sha":"c28da42e20e5b1a6ef790b070d4ed1ed802b030a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commits/c28da42e20e5b1a6ef790b070d4ed1ed802b030a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48671678?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Borg93","id":48671678,"login":"Borg93","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NjcxNjc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commits/86b3ebd7ff8bc3efb30364d5e761f5b4e0b41783/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T17:00:34Z","email":"Borg93@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Borg93"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T17:01:46Z","email":"Borg93@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Borg93"},"message":"fix(xc078): a failed public-key read answers every verification that waited behind it\n\nTRIAGE row F. PublishedKeys now records, per identity, when its latest read\nended in failure (a success clears it). A verification that began at or before\nthat moment takes the failure as its answer, KeySourceUnavailableError and so a\nRETRY, instead of reading again: it is the read the verification queued behind,\nor one that began since. A verification that begins after the failure ended\nreads afresh, so no outage is cached. The comparison uses the moment for_event\nalready stamps on each verification (arrived), the same clock the reader judges\nan unknown key id by; cached() and _read() take it as a keyword.\n\nUnchanged: the 60 s TTL, the 30 s refresh rate limit (failures do not count\ntowards it), the first-sighting memory, and the RETRY for an unknown key id\ninside the rate limit (TRIAGE row G, a decided residual).\n\nThe reviewer''s repro (10 concurrent verifications against a store that hangs\n0.2 s and fails): before, 10 store reads and a 2.0 s longest wait; after, 1 read\nand 0.20 s, one read timeout, which is 2 s at the deployed\nKEY_READ_TIMEOUT_SECONDS rather than 20 s.\n\ntests: +0 -0\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017XnXD48toDdU7HLsHN54Sv","tree":{"sha":"971bb224e74b6f2d4abf02c6f9c7115b0359a98b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/git/trees/971bb224e74b6f2d4abf02c6f9c7115b0359a98b"},"ur