org93/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Borg93","id":48671678,"login":"Borg93","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NjcxNjc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commits/52261ddd43c09bbd2c2971be7e0e7b598905a2ca/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T16:58:36Z","email":"Borg93@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Borg93"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T16:58:36Z","email":"Borg93@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Borg93"},"message":"docs(lineage): a keyless signer withholds its control events and the catalog''s relay signs nothing (XC-078)\n\nThe control-events bullet, the notifications skill''s emitter paragraph, the outbox runbook and the poison counter''s\ndescription now say what fix-a made true: nothing unsigned is staged, a control event emitted while the key is\nunresolved is lost rather than delayed, and an object under the control outbox that does not verify as the catalog''s\nown is retired unpublished and read as a forgery.\n\ntests: +0 -0\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017XnXD48toDdU7HLsHN54Sv","tree":{"sha":"25acc43d485c231c6976c72d825bb55076c15579","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/git/trees/25acc43d485c231c6976c72d825bb55076c15579"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/git/commits/52261ddd43c09bbd2c2971be7e0e7b598905a2ca","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified