uction wiring, real verifier)\nalready red on it, so these unit cases pinned nothing of their own:\n- judge: enforce acts on a verified event, enforce refuses an unsigned event, enforce retries on unreadable keys,\n  observe reports the refusal it would have made (kept: off never runs the check, observe on unreadable keys, a door''s\n  own fault propagates in both modes, observe on a verified event; each is the only test red on its mutant).\n- control rows: a delegator signing for the person it names (also pinned by the wire-format test), a listed signer for\n  a service actor, an unsigned control event, a body changed after signing (kept: the three delegation/author rows no\n  door reaches, the unlisted signer and the rewritten facet).\nSpot check: with judge''s enforce refusal mutated to act, 16 door cases fail across medallion, notifications and\nmaintenance (the review measured 16).\n\ntests: +0 -0 functions; cases -8 (judge 9 -> 5, control rows 9 -> 5)\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017XnXD48toDdU7HLsHN54Sv","tree":{"sha":"c1036d1730f963263ff2630c90e176841b64bf41","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/git/trees/c1036d1730f963263ff2630c90e176841b64bf41"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/git/commits/594b23460a7e2f63d019bf54189330e7090173b6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48671678?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Borg93","id":48671678,"login":"Borg93","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NjcxNjc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/orgs","received_events_url":"https://