s_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commits/ca34cf661e1213ac4fe7b7947cc8da540f71a35d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T16:48:05Z","email":"Borg93@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Borg93"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T16:48:05Z","email":"Borg93@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Borg93"},"message":"test(xc078): RED - the bronze head starts a cascade on a maintenance pass and admits lineage''s whole signer set\n\nOwner ruling R7 (XC-078 slice 1). The catalog stamps the tenant on every write it announces, so its\ncompact_table of acme''s bronze table names the project-qualified bronze pair and verifies under the\ncatalog''s signature: the producer''s /bronze-arrival publishes medallion.bronze for it. One case in\nthe door test (a catalog-signed compact_table for alice on acme-bronze$events) expects no trigger.\n\nThe chart test''s expectation for the producer''s door settings becomes the producer and the catalog\nalone (the identities the catalog''s and the producer''s pods sign as); notifications and both\nmaintenance Deployments keep lineage''s set. Today the producer renders lineage''s full set.\n\nFails on its own assertions: the head published triggers on [''medallion.bronze'']; the producer''s\nRASK_EVENT_SIGNERS lists the stage runners, maintenance and ingest.\n\ntests: +0 -0 (functions); collected cases +1 (door test 26 -> 27).\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017XnXD48toDdU7HLsHN54Sv","tree":{"sha":"9a03186dbd0867948035bdb6b53c7c15663818bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/git/trees/9a03186dbd0867948035bdb6b53c7c15663818bf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/git/commits/ca34cf661e1213ac4fe7b7947cc8da540f71a35d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48671678?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Borg93","id":48671678,"login":"Borg93","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NjcxNjc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commit/ca34cf661e1213ac4fe7b7947cc8da540f71a35d","node_id":"C_kwDOSh8U4doAKGNhMzRjZjY2MWUxMjEzYWM0ZmU3Yjc5NDdjYzhkYTU0MGY3MWEzNWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commit/29b73e94ecd45837a14ba6814d82607e31e4127c","sha":"29b73e94ecd45837a14ba6814d82607e31e4127c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commits/29b73e94ecd45837a14ba6814d82607e31e4127c"}],"sha":"ca34cf661e1213ac4fe7b7947cc8da540f71a35d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commits/ca34cf661e1213ac4fe7b7947cc8da540f71a35d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48671678?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Borg93","id":48671678,"login":"Borg93","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NjcxNjc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commits/2388378c550c859a60b41591503311db23e1f13c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T16:47:05Z","email":"Borg93@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Borg93"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T16:47:05Z","email":"Borg93@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Borg93"},"message":"test(xc078): RED - every signature-refusal series is exported at 0 once its door is registered\n\nTRIAGE row D. The refusal alerts are rate(<svc>_signature_refused_total[5m]) > 0,\nand a cumulative OTel counter exports nothing for a series until its first add,\nso the first refusal on a series is born at 1 with no 0 before it and rate()\nsees no increase: one refused event never pages. The fix creates every series at\n0 when the door is registered, which in production runs after the MeterProvider\nis installed.\n\nEach service''s signature-door test now reads its counter through a real\nin-memory reader with the door registered under that reader''s meter, and gains\none assertion before the delivery: every door x reason series of the refusal\ncounter is exported at 0. It fails today on that assertion, for 24 door cases:\n\n- notifications (test_ingress_delivery_door.py): signing_door is built after\n  signature_counts; the run-event test asserts the 24 door x reason zeros, and\n  both door tests'' final counts now include them.\n- maintenance (test_a_write_event_decides_whether_to_plan.py): the _Counter\n  stand-in is replaced by an in-memory reader (signature_counts), the door is\n  registered under it, and the final counts include the zeros.\n- lineage (test_lineage_refuses_an_event_no_listed_signer_signed.py): a reader\n  fixture (refusals) and the 12 reason zeros asserted after registration.\n\ntests: +0 -0 (collected cases unchanged)\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017XnXD48toDdU7HLsHN54Sv","tree":{"sha":"57015700670a8e98f702e72add385ed739d3b052","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/git/trees/57015700670a8e98f702e72add385ed739d3b052"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/git/commits/2388378c550c859a60b41591503311db23e1f13c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48671678?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Borg93","id":48671678,"login":"Borg93","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NjcxNjc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commit/2388378c550c859a60b41591503311db23e1f13c","node_id":"C_kwDOSh8U4doAKDIzODgzNzhjNTUwYzg1OWE2MGI0MTU5MTUwMzMxMWRiMjNlMWYxM2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commit/7b3cd45fed4d015335d5a0cbfc0f7e83a58324cc","sha":"7b3cd45fed4d015335d5a0cbfc0f7e83a58324cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commits/7b3cd45fed4d015335d5a0cbfc0f7e83a58324cc"}],"sha":"2388378c550c859a60b41591503311db23e1f13c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commits/2388378c550c859a60b41591503311db23e1f13c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48671678?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Borg93","id":48671678,"login":"Borg93","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NjcxNjc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commits/7500ff3eb4755e19461ee99be9fa299fe04f0e4b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T16:45:21Z","email":"Borg93@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Borg93"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T16:45:21Z","email":"Borg93@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Borg93"},"message":"fix(xc078): the control relay verifies what it finds staged and signs nothing\n\nThe catalog''s control relay signed, with the catalog''s key, whatever parsed as a\nCatalogControlEvent under the control outbox, declaring onBehalfOf = whatever\nuser: actor the staged object named. Staged bytes are authenticated by nothing,\nso the relay was a signing oracle for anything that can write the prefix: a\nforged grant_added reached a named person and a forged table_published woke\nsilver->gold past every enforcing door (TRIAGE row A).\n\nThe root cause was the emitter staging an event UNSIGNED while its key was\nunresolved, which only a relay that signs could deliver. LH-064''s model now\nholds on the control lane too:\n\n- service_kit.control_emit: an event the signer cannot sign (key unresolved, or\n  no canonical form) is WITHHELD, neither staged nor published, counted under\n  reason=\"unsigned\" with staged=False and logged with its action and event_id,\n  as the catalog withholds a lineage event it cannot sign. The unsigned-staging\n  path (_hold_unsigned) is gone; a signed event is staged as signed.\n- catalog control relay: signs nothing. Each staged object must parse as a\n  CatalogControlEvent and, on a signing catalog, verify as a control event signed\n  by THIS catalog''s identity (verify_control_signature with that identity as the\n  only signer and delegator) against the keys it publishes, read through the\n  catalog''s sidecar by one PublishedKeys per app on app.state, off the event\n  loop. Verified: the staged bytes are republished verbatim. Refused or invalid:\n  retired as poison, counted, WARN control_outbox_unverifiable (key, action,\n  reason), never published. Keys unreadable: the pass stops, everything stays\n  staged, and the report says keys_unavailable (was waiting_for_signing_key,\n  which the relay no longer waits for). A catalog that does not sign still\n  delivers what parses: it adds no signature, so a forger gains nothing over a\n  direct publish.\n- catalog control_signing keeps only the emitter''s signer; main.py''s comments\n  say what the relay now does.\n\nThe catalog''s sidecar may already read signing-public-<its identity>: the\nrendered Configuration denies only peers'' signing-key-* secrets, and the\nholder reads that list on every resolve.\n\ntests: +0 -0 (the RED commit carries the test change).\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017XnXD48toDdU7HLsHN54Sv","tree":{"sha":"74e38f8b02d7a0f9f80cc87af20a60ac6b3004e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/git/trees/74e38f8b02d7a0f9f80cc87af20a60ac6b3004e8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/git/commits/7500ff3eb4755e19461ee99be9fa299fe04f0e4b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48671678?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Borg93","id":48671678,"login":"Borg93","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NjcxNjc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commit/7500ff3eb4755e19461ee99be9fa299fe04f0e4b","node_id":"C_kwDOSh8U4doAKDc1MDBmZjNlYjQ3NTVlMTk0NjFlZTk5YmU5ZmEyOTlmZTA0ZjBlNGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commit/a80ffd005eabecf7c288fa1b34365ab36d1091be","sha":"a80ffd005eabecf7c288fa1b34365ab36d1091be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commits/a80ffd005eabecf7c288fa1b34365ab36d1091be"}],"sha":"7500ff3eb4755e19461ee99be9fa299fe04f0e4b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commits/7500ff3eb4755e19461ee99be9fa299fe04f0e4b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48671678?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Borg93","id":48671678,"login":"Borg93","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NjcxNjc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commits/7b3cd45fed4d015335d5a0cbfc0f7e83a58324cc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T16:41:58Z","email":"Borg93@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Borg93"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T16:41:58Z","email":"Borg93@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Borg93"},"message":"fix(xc078): a rules-only change rolls vmalert, so the rules it evaluates are the ones deployed\n\nTRIAGE row C. vmalert''s pod template now carries checksum/rules, the sha256 of\nchart/alerting/rules.yml, the estate''s checksum/config convention: a change to\nthe rules changes the template, and the Deployment rolls a pod that loads them.\nNo template comment: template prose is stored in the release on every revision.\n\nMeasured locally: +55 gzipped bytes of rendered manifest where alerting is on\n(nothing where it is off) and +28 gzipped bytes of stored template source.\n\ntests: +0 -0\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017XnXD48toDdU7HLsHN54Sv","tree":{"sha":"96f667f55c2e235ac2ec5d2c4ffc7a4493979a9a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/git/trees/96f667f55c2e235ac2ec5d2c4ffc7a4493979a9a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/git/commits/7b3cd45fed4d015335d5a0cbfc0f7e83a58324cc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48671678?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Borg93","id":48671678,"login":"Borg93","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NjcxNjc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commit/7b3cd45fed4d015335d5a0cbfc0f7e83a58324cc","node_id":"C_kwDOSh8U4doAKDdiM2NkNDVmZWQ0ZDAxNTMzNWQ1YTBjYmZjMGY3ZTgzYTU4MzI0Y2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commit/cc05d6401db1615e79f0b6e71f4dfd558623e8e3","sha":"cc05d6401db1615e79f0b6e71f4dfd558623e8e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commits/cc05d6401db1615e79f0b6e71f4dfd558623e8e3"}],"sha":"7b3cd45fed4d015335d5a0cbfc0f7e83a58324cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commits/7b3cd45fed4d015335d5a0cbfc0f7e83a58324cc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48671678?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Borg93","id":48671678,"login":"Borg93","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NjcxNjc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commits/cc05d6401db1615e79f0b6e71f4dfd558623e8e3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T16:41:15Z","email":"Borg93@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Borg93"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T16:41:15Z","email":"Borg93@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Borg93"},"message":"test(xc078): RED - a rules-only change rolls vmalert''s pod\n\nTRIAGE row C. vmalert reads its -rule file at start and the chart passes no\n-configCheckInterval, so only a new pod loads changed rules, and nothing in\nvmalert''s pod template follows chart/alerting/rules.yml: a rules-only change\nrolls nothing. Live, vmalert started 2026-10-02 12:40 and two rules changes\nwere deployed after it, LH-064''s LineageSignatureRefusedForAListedSigner among\nthem.\n\nNo test rendered the alerting template, so this is a new test: the chart is\ncopied, a line is appended to the copy''s alerting/rules.yml, and vmalert''s\npod template must differ between the two renders. It fails on that assertion\ntoday. tests/unit/chart_render.py gains render_chart_text(chart, ...), the\nuncached render render_text now delegates to, so a modified copy renders\nthrough the shared seam rather than a private helm call.\n\ntests: +1 -0 (collected cases +1)\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017XnXD48toDdU7HLsHN54Sv","tree":{"sha":"147357fbb62f6d2fd77add00b43103b696601943","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/git/trees/147357fbb62f6d2fd77add00b43103b696601943"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/git/commits/cc05d6401db1615e79f0b6e71f4dfd558623e8e3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48671678?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Borg93","id":48671678,"login":"Borg93","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NjcxNjc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commit/cc05d6401db1615e79f0b6e71f4dfd558623e8e3","node_id":"C_kwDOSh8U4doAKGNjMDVkNjQwMWRiMTYxNWU3OWYwYjZlNzFmNGRmZDU1ODYyM2U4ZTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commit/29b73e94ecd45837a14ba6814d82607e31e4127c","sha":"29b73e94ecd45837a14ba6814d82607e31e4127c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commits/29b73e94ecd45837a14ba6814d82607e31e4127c"}],"sha":"cc05d6401db1615e79f0b6e71f4dfd558623e8e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commits/cc05d6401db1615e79f0b6e71f4dfd558623e8e3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48671678?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Borg93","id":48671678,"login":"Borg93","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NjcxNjc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commits/a80ffd005eabecf7c288fa1b34365ab36d1091be/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T16:40:54Z","email":"Borg93@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Borg93"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T16:40:54Z","email":"Borg93@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Borg93"},"message":"test(xc078): RED - the control relay delivers only what this catalog signed\n\nThe catalog''s control relay signs, with the catalog''s key, whatever parses as a\nCatalogControlEvent under the control outbox, and declares onBehalfOf = whatever\nuser: actor the staged object names. Staged bytes are authenticated by nothing,\nso anything that can write the prefix gets a catalog-signed forgery past every\nenforcing door (TRIAGE row A).\n\nThese tests pin the fix, on the tests that already drive the seam:\n\n- test_the_control_lane_has_a_relay.py: \"the relay signs the staged event and\n  keeps its id\" becomes \"the relay delivers only what this catalog signed, and\n  that byte for byte\": a forged object (unsigned; unsigned naming a person;\n  signed by another listed identity; altered after the catalog signed it) is\n  staged oldest, and only the catalog-signed event the emitter staged behind it\n  reaches the bus, verbatim, on the same tick. \"An event the relay may not\n  deliver yet stays staged\" swaps its keyless-catalog case for a signing\n  catalog whose published keys cannot be read.\n- test_the_catalog_signs_for_the_person_it_authenticated.py: a catalog without\n  its key now stages nothing (it staged its control events unsigned).\n\nFails today on its own assertions: the four forgery cases (\"the relay published\nan object this catalog never signed\"), the unreadable-keys case (\"the relay\ndelivered an event it may not deliver yet\"), and the keyless catalog (\"staged\n[''namespace_created'', ''table_created''] unsigned\").\n\ntests: +2 -2 (two functions replaced in place: the relay''s signing test and the\nkeyless-catalog test, renamed for what they now pin); collected cases 12 -> 15\n(+3: the signing test''s one case becomes four forgery cases).\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017XnXD48toDdU7HLsHN54Sv","tree":{"sha":"e356b7b766b5fc5a274d1a2534e7a116fab15d84","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/git/trees/e356b7b766b5fc5a274d1a2534e7a116fab15d84"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/git/commits/a80ffd005eabecf7c288fa1b34365ab36d1091be","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48671678?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Borg93","id":48671678,"login":"Borg93","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ