iYTY4MTRkODI2MDdlMzFlNDEyN2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commit/903d3318f8e71568ca0524550fe08c03599314d4","sha":"903d3318f8e71568ca0524550fe08c03599314d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commits/903d3318f8e71568ca0524550fe08c03599314d4"}],"sha":"29b73e94ecd45837a14ba6814d82607e31e4127c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commits/29b73e94ecd45837a14ba6814d82607e31e4127c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48671678?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Borg93","id":48671678,"login":"Borg93","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NjcxNjc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/commits/903d3318f8e71568ca0524550fe08c03599314d4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T15:39:19Z","email":"Borg93@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Borg93"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T15:39:19Z","email":"Borg93@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Borg93"},"message":"feat(alerting): a refusal at any bus door pages, and the runbook says what each reason means (XC-078)\n\nA door''s refusal is acked, so its counter is the only trace it leaves. Three rules, one per service, over\nmedallion_signature_refused_total, notifications_signature_refused_total and maintenance_signature_refused_total,\neach in that service''s own label convention. Unlike lineage''s rule, every reason pages: every bus publisher signs and\nthe annotator''s exempt actions are never verified, so an unsigned or unlisted event on the bus is a forgery or a\nsigner that broke. Maintenance''s is a warning because its hourly sweep still compacts a table whose arrival it\nrefused.\n\npromtool 2.55.1 (Dagger): check and test pass; with lineage''s exclusions applied to the three rules the new group\nfails, every door''s expected alert reported got:[].\n\ntests: +1 promtool group (rules_test.yml 1f), +0 pytest\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017XnXD48toDdU7HLsHN54Sv","tree":{"sha":"1cd0564fdd5910b242068ee1c94688ece1834545","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/git/trees/1cd0564fdd5910b242068ee1c94688ece1834545"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AI-Riksarkivet/rask/git/commits/903d3318f8e71568ca0524550fe08c03599314d4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48671678?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Borg93","id":48671678,"login":"Borg93","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NjcxNjc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Borg93/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users