:"c0ab8493efee96ddcfadb61161d8daa3b860d474","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/victoraugusto1735-star/restaurante-ebac/commits/c0ab8493efee96ddcfadb61161d8daa3b860d474"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/249989244?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victoraugusto7311-creator/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victoraugusto7311-creator/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victoraugusto7311-creator/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victoraugusto7311-creator/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/victoraugusto7311-creator","id":249989244,"login":"victoraugusto7311-creator","node_id":"U_kgDODuaIfA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victoraugusto7311-creator/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victoraugusto7311-creator/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victoraugusto7311-creator/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victoraugusto7311-creator/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victoraugusto7311-creator/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/victoraugusto7311-creator","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/victoraugusto1735-star/restaurante-ebac/commits/2a05cf63042ae38c3a2cfb2469f1b8dea78c97e4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-19T13:23:15Z","email":"victoraugusto7311@gmail.com","name":"victor1735"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-19T13:23:15Z","email":"victoraugusto7311@gmail.com","name":"victor1735"},"message":"````md\n\nProjeto desenvolvido com React e Webpack Module Federation para praticar Micro Frontends.\n\n- `container` → aplicação principal\n- `cardapio` → lista de pratos\n- `pedido` → itens adicionados ao pedido\n\n---\n\nAbra 3 terminais.\n\n```bash\ncd cardapio\nnpm install\nnpm start\n```\n\nRoda em:\n\n```bash\nhttp://localhost:3001\n```\n\n---\n\n```bash\ncd pedido\nnpm install\nnpm start\n```\n\nRoda em:\n\n```bash\nhttp://localhost:3002\n```\n\n---\n\n```bash\ncd container\nnpm install\nnpm start\n```\n\nRoda em:\n\n```bash\nhttp://localhost:3000\n```\n\n---\n\nA comunicação foi feita usando eventos globais do navegador.\n\nO micro `cardapio` dispara um evento:\n\n```js\nwindow.dispatchEvent(\n  new CustomEvent(\"adicionar-prato\", {\n    detail: prato\n  })\n);\n```\n\nO micro `pedido` escuta esse evento:\n\n```js\nwindow.addEventListener(\"adicionar-prato\", receberPrato);\n```\n\nAssim, quando um prato é adicionado no cardápio, ele aparece automaticamente no pedido.\n\n---\n\n- React\n- JavaScript\n- Webpack 5\n- Module Federation\n- Babel\n````","tree":{"sha":"3fb339bfc0d449995ff9ff91f379dd7def5b47a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/victoraugusto1735-star/restaurante-ebac/git/trees/3fb339bfc0d449995ff9ff91f379dd7def5b47a7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/victoraugusto1735-star/restaurante-ebac/git/commits/2a05cf63042ae38c3a2cfb2469f1b8dea78c97e4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/249989244?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victoraugusto7311-creator/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victoraugusto7311-creator/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victoraugusto7311-creator/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victoraugusto7311-creator/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/victoraugusto7311-creator","id":249989244,"login":"victoraugusto7311-creator","node_id":"U_kgDODuaIfA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victoraugusto7311-creator/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/victoraugusto7311-creator/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vict