ub.com/users/shukla-0007/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shukla-0007/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shukla-0007","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shukla-0007/moon-bites/commits/32bb104fccacfebd1246ffb4c0062ef4007620fc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-11T10:25:25Z","email":"ayushshukla1369@gmail.com","name":"Shukla_Ayush"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-11T10:25:25Z","email":"ayushshukla1369@gmail.com","name":"Shukla_Ayush"},"message":"feat(ui): Phase 5.5 – Swiggy-grade premium UI overhaul\n\n- Orange sticky header (Swiggy brand gradient) with white logo\n- Bottom navigation bar (4 tabs: Surprise/Moods/Schedule/History)\n- Hero banner on Surprise Me tab with floating dice animation + wave cut\n- Quick filter pills (Fast Delivery, Pure Veg, Under ₹150, Top Rated, Popular)\n- Mood chips: per-mood gradient backgrounds (warm/green/purple/blue/red/teal)\n- Toast notification system (success/error/info with slide-in animation)\n- Skeleton shimmer loaders on all API loading states\n- CTA buttons show spinner + loading text while API is in-flight\n- ORDER NOW button changes to orange fill on hover\n- Card hover glow: orange shadow on result card hover\n- Poppins font for all headings (h1/h2/h3)\n- Stagger animation: cards slide in with 80ms sequential delay\n- Auto-trigger: quick filter pills pre-fill form and auto-call API\n- Scroll-to-top on tab switch via scroll-area container\n- History/schedule tab data lazy-loaded on switch\n- Toast on: order placed, feedback saved, schedule activated/paused/deleted","tree":{"sha":"e43f16e978946978190da1dc9ffa84ef809da806","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shukla-0007/moon-bites/git/trees/e43f16e978946978190da1dc9ffa84ef809da806"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shukla-0007/moon-bites/git/commits/32bb104fccacfebd1246ffb4c0062ef4007620fc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned",