limiting\n\n- Enhanced  function to include rate limiting for activation codes.\n- Added error handling for invalid request methods.\n\nfix: Improve media deletion process in Supabase\n\n- Updated  function to include rate limiting and better error handling.\n- Ensured that media deletion checks for Cloudinary public IDs.\n\nfeat: Sign Cloudinary uploads with enhanced validation\n\n- Updated  function to validate resource types and file sizes.\n- Added constraints for allowed formats based on resource type.\n\nchore: Add performance-related indexes and functions\n\n- Created indexes on  and  tables for improved query performance.\n- Added functions for fetching couple context and statistics.\n\nfeat: Enhance notification system with feed function\n\n- Implemented  function to retrieve notifications with pagination.\n- Updated RLS policies for notifications to ensure proper access control.\n\nfix: Strengthen security measures in database migrations\n\n- Added constraints and triggers for validating pin images and protecting ownership fields.\n- Tightened RLS policies for subscriptions and bucket list items.","tree":{"sha":"1d910e462aa0db3df888fc8cfaf567c96d45ef4e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/huynhson0809/couple-map/git/trees/1d910e462aa0db3df888fc8cfaf567c96d45ef4e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/huynhson0809/couple-map/git/commits/79659e40aad73710ec1b37b4b9fae5fda41d8849","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69881676?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huynhson0809/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huynhson0809/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huynhson0809/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huynhson0809/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/huynhson0809","id":69881676,"login":"huynhson0809","node_