0-08T23:06:14.468Z","repositoryId":1243965991,"sha":"ea3d786597f7b32d5315ae9ff9e8b36d09f35950"}],"observedAt":"2026-10-08T23:06:14.468Z","raw":[{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/243045210?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/infosiragpt-ops/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/infosiragpt-ops/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/infosiragpt-ops/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/infosiragpt-ops/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/infosiragpt-ops","id":243045210,"login":"infosiragpt-ops","node_id":"U_kgDODnyTWg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/infosiragpt-ops/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/infosiragpt-ops/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/infosiragpt-ops/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/infosiragpt-ops/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/infosiragpt-ops/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/infosiragpt-ops","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infosiragpt-ops/SiraGPT-APP/commits/eb29a821c640ee47e7bf4998a3d4fd04d208cc47/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T05:50:45Z","email":"Carrerajorge8745@gmail.com","name":"infosiragpt-ops"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T05:50:45Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(agent-runner): «no puede generar ppt» (2.ª) — describe_image con la escalera de visión + aviso del guardia antes de cortar (#1010)\n\ndescribe_image se construía con el cliente y el modelo de TEXTO del turno\n(prepareF7Extras({ client: llm })); con DeepSeek V4 Flash cada llamada era un\n400. Dos fallos de esa herramienta más un recorte con Python agotaron el guardia\nde «sin progreso», que cortaba el turno con el deck ya en outputs/.\n\n- index.js: buildVisionLadderClient construye UNA escalera de visión por turno\n  (deepseek-flash → grok → gemini → gpt); verify_visual y describe_image la\n  comparten; prepareF7Extras recibe client: visionLadder, model: null. Seam\n  visionClient para tests.\n- multimodal/index.js: describe_image solo se ofrece/registra con un cliente de\n  visión (hasVisionClient); su descripción manda a verify_visual para Office.\n- no-progress-nudge.js + loop.js: tras tres fallos seguidos el guardia inyecta\n  UNA vez «RECOVERY REQUIRED» y emite no_progress_recovery; tres fallos seguidos\n  MÁS cortan igual (subtask_no_progress). El dead letter del mismo tool no cambia.\n- Tests: agent-runner-no-progress-recovery (6, nuevo); actualizados\n  ola-3h61-invariants, agent-runner-tool-failure-recovery,\n  agent-runner-python-api-recovery, agent-runner-f7-multimodal. CLAUDE.md.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Cxgo4Xc1JMjLttiH5uegNd","tree":{"sha":"08f77cbb683d22311cae16a39a2b41451197cf91","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infosiragpt-ops/SiraGPT-APP/git/trees/08f77cbb683d22311cae16a39a2b41451197cf91"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infosiragpt-ops/SiraGPT-APP/git/commits/eb29a821c640ee47e7bf4998a3d4fd04d208cc47","verification":{"payload":"tree 08f77cbb683d22311cae16a39a2b41451197cf91\nparent a22affbf06e058c1e720a24f21fcea30f4ecd11f\nauthor infosiragpt-ops <Carrerajorge8745@gmail.com> 1791438645 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791438645 -0500\n\nfix(agent-runner): «no puede generar ppt» (2.ª) — describe_image con la escalera de visión + aviso del guardia antes de cortar (#1010)\n\ndescribe_image se construía con el cliente y el modelo de TEXTO del turno\n(prepareF7Extras({ client: llm })); con DeepSeek V4 Flash cada llamada era un\n400. Dos fallos de esa herramienta más un recorte con Python agotaron el guardia\nde «sin progreso», que cortaba el turno con el deck ya en outputs/.\n\n- index.js: buildVisionLadderClient construye UNA escalera de visión por turno\n  (deepseek-flash → grok → gemini → gpt); verify_visual y describe_image la\n  comparten; prepareF7Extras recibe client: visionLadder, model: null. Seam\n  visionClient para tests.\n- multimodal/index.js: describe_image solo se ofrece/registra con un cliente de\n  visión (hasVisionClient); su descripción manda a verify_visual para Office.\n- no-progress-nudge.js + loop.js: tras tres fallos seguidos el guardia inyecta\n  UNA vez «RECOVERY REQUIRED» y emite no_progress_recovery; tres fallos seguidos\n  MÁS cortan igual (subtask_no_progress). El dead letter del mismo tool no cambia.\n- Tests: agent-runner-no-progress-recovery (6, nuevo); actualizados\n  ola-3h61-invariants, agent-runner-tool-failure-recovery,\n  agent-runner-python-api-recovery, agent-runner-f7-multimodal. CLAUDE.md.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Cxgo4Xc1JMjLttiH5uegNd","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxy81CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAJLsQAIAa7FTzlB9FdmyoSLVcunSA\nc+SukHmT6Spm8C7q2F+8X8rc4/w5Yz3EFqvKhAOqmf8mqtS1H5Kd7we9PBtLjlGD\nUvQzKRwdf/BT6YyWUuCeNTips3eGqxeiGHW3AG1HtA0jhuZAb5aLN1BcoM1KYnqV\nlyMTC+u02leKdaRMz+5xkXZwMlwon0lrMdfqTMyyxThjwwGqmOhzNSwYAoGDuxA/\nCYxgGr2kbU0mRBAPBnj2ax1GBTxbu+zSg7sneCi4Hxaj4UkrmuVS8DsRwCWqtd4Q\ndMprL7p2dNwsNwLeQdfK/dgisOpe2ucZr+dGQK7wQBA2OB5P14Vuu62BrwVunosH\ng7gQ5bA/y+Sc43moR6Vk8l789Wg3cIZ6OWnbdZtLs3LFT9CUF1Da+9PBQgyhN4OC\nzBRVCJSl3uSErLBZkF5DhPX+tvQeyqufNMXBFXfUufp3/uagmIdyB5CXd/J8pDmN\n/AumVltRqdpppwa8FFF89dBy9A3DgRClUS0Rlr9ix6tQ1JDdd91Ay80PAW46lc7R\np2AoXidvwOGmnTfrbVhmrfOXD0IUmF7j2mJ7yYNxD+0UrMpOkzl7Tey3ZlEh418z\ncTO9DhbQWLwe5J+ixx+6uWoyhyCJ+KUmLJYsoxu9wUcVC8pk2iz13YjdwIAn8RZj\n5RA2uuogVaIXeof1cKpl\n=Errw\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-08T05:50:46Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/user