ithub.com/repos/infosiragpt-ops/SiraGPT-APP/commits/8ab04dc3a4ae511ee44cd9e62a61ea56068ec3ac"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/243045210?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/infosiragpt-ops/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/infosiragpt-ops/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/infosiragpt-ops/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/infosiragpt-ops/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/infosiragpt-ops","id":243045210,"login":"infosiragpt-ops","node_id":"U_kgDODnyTWg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/infosiragpt-ops/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/infosiragpt-ops/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/infosiragpt-ops/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/infosiragpt-ops/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/infosiragpt-ops/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/infosiragpt-ops","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infosiragpt-ops/SiraGPT-APP/commits/6268f1e447ea07aaaaea93345a966100e0bab0ed/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T19:37:14Z","email":"Carrerajorge8745@gmail.com","name":"infosiragpt-ops"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T19:37:14Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(prod): volcado del 7-oct — bloqueo de 2 s por minuto, navegador integrado y ruido de logs (#1006)\n\nDel log de producción 2026-10-07 (15:10 → 18:45 UTC):\n\n- Barrido de recuperación de transcripciones (media-transcription-queue): cargaba filas completas (con extractedText) de todo archivo en etapa pendiente cada minuto y filtraba isMediaFile en Node; un backlog de documentos atascados lo convertía en un bloqueo de ~2 s por minuto para todo el backend (304 de 2 s en los sondeos de la computadora y de créditos). Ahora PostgreSQL filtra por MIME de medios, columnas estrechas, pase acotado (SIRAGPT_MEDIA_RECONCILE_MAX_ROWS) y cursor que continúa el backlog (SIRAGPT_MEDIA_RECONCILE_INTERVAL_MS).\n- Navegador integrado: texto suelto («google») es una búsqueda (SIRAGPT_COMPUTER_SEARCH_URL) en backend y frontend; host:puerto no es esquema; classifyNavigationFailure → 422 navigate_host_unresolved / navigate_url_invalid, 502 navigate_site_unreachable / navigate_tls_failed, 504 navigate_timeout.\n- Ruido: latido idle de Stripe a debug (campo idle); goal_cleanup_*_completed a INFO; sin console.log en el callback de Google OAuth.\n- /admin error boundary: lib/client-bundle-recovery compartido con app/error (recarga única por build+error, cooldown 10 min), telemetría y «Hay una versión nueva de SiraGPT · Recargar». UI lock re-baselineado para los cuatro archivos tocados.\n\nTests: navigate-url (+8), computer-browser-route (+1), media-transcription-queue (+2), stripe-webhook-recovery (+1), production-log-hygiene (5), client-bundle-recovery (4), admin-error-boundary-source (3), computer-navigate (+1). Docs: CHANGELOG, docs/ENV_VARIABLES.md, CLAUDE.md.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Cxgo4Xc1JMjLttiH5uegNd","tree":{"sha":"f8fce55fccd413cdf47e7100f48bef82bbdece25","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infosiragpt-ops/SiraGPT-APP/git/trees/f8fce55fccd413cdf47e7100f48bef82bbdece25"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/infosiragpt-ops/SiraGPT-APP/git/commits/6268f1e447ea07aaaaea93345a966100e0bab0ed","verification":{"payload":"tree f8fce55fccd413cdf47e7100f48bef82bbdece25\nparent e7fdaa47fb51cb7678f3ff65b62a2f997de1b590\nauthor infosiragpt-ops <Carrerajorge8745@gmail.com> 1791401834 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791401834 -0500\n\nfix(prod): volcado del 7-oct — bloqueo de 2 s por minuto, navegador integrado y ruido de logs (#1006)\n\nDel log de producción 2026-10-07 (15:10 → 18:45 UTC):\n\n- Barrido d