 panel de la computadora en el chat.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011AWaUd73Em4yqyCsXD97kz\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwtQTCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA60IQAIGvdKWWDFlLgvIVxQhYvKTu\n2/T/QwYjClsjiUOpUwi8tkrzJN66CluUuMv94fP2V9u8Bx14GG6aSdvEk75BAW2m\nTluNcme5QC/WhOPwBC2LxAVTgBvxW7DeB7nGHMgsnA+wCYOz78LqK3TG1+r1pDHw\nW3rohCdL9aKWOLWa02BG8R/wgX4NackDbU4g2241tC5RGDyFAF8/TTG+2WkjyWaB\nzBauAtNPLAPf2Ls3Zm7OIsC+8Cmi9uDRq6SguHGQtzhMPLeTn0IUvZJLZsjPSVNZ\nDJACMeNKKYZiy3OaWqAIT28kcvoBvqdkLD2L+VDUlFgc9RTDP0rtPsoNgdvkyymo\n50bekltDSZa8pyMqBE6NO6OHc2c40S/jVEl6YuSm2CpQkIw6MbxL8A/vykufzCdW\n3NDOz+TfVHMdg7GVAXEv2jvxcExAiP+bpBr5fzZhO0Br0XS6jOS+gITUndDpZ4g3\nBUKljadT4FnMp5ref8G+eIO241b2AhSBzf2x6/3ex0peDLiC1UhrpI+YxK+YYaN9\n7laoLMvKs7q2oS6i1V+wudRqJAh/mG4LhOqOk2eKKbt+5rCmuwxpW+c7ek2ylClp\noiV/NfeDHd3eYpi4HQ3dZg63umL9/Eqy7Ss7k+z8iUeLYNBhB7d7YaajJ8VSvMPv\nQehkw3R6Qvse9nsOM1WX\n=j3l0\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-04T22:32:52Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","typ