s. Screenshots re-encoded smaller (about 25% lighter).\n- Remove the always-running background and floating animations and the\n  large blur effects; glows are now plain gradients.\n- Replace the dark phone bezels with clean rounded screenshot cards, on\n  the case study page and on the homepage and /work feature cards.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HxJ1V19VEEgfVyJs35DaBr","tree":{"sha":"78dd8c976cc7623c2a5a290fc1e009876968a049","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adeniyi-faith/getonline-studio/git/trees/78dd8c976cc7623c2a5a290fc1e009876968a049"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adeniyi-faith/getonline-studio/git/commits/77dc7df10643aefaef640b5276510e901ed1b36f","verification":{"payload":"tree 78dd8c976cc7623c2a5a290fc1e009876968a049\nparent d741a726bfe6d9e7b0ebbaf94592b941c7965fbe\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790936403 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790936403 +0000\n\nMake the K-logistics Hub page lighter and drop the phone frames\n\n- Serve a pre-built stylesheet (page.css, ~20 KB) instead of the\n  Tailwind CDN script, which built every style inside the visitor''s\n  browser. tailwind.config.js explains how to rebuild it.\n- Only the three hero screenshots load up front; the rest load as the\n  visitor scrolls. Screenshots re-encoded smaller (about 25% lighter).\n- Remove the always-running background and floating animations and the\n  large blur effects; glows are now plain gradients.\n- Replace the dark phone bezels with clean rounded screenshot cards, on\n  the case study page and on the homepage and /work feature cards.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HxJ1V19VEEgfVyJs35DaBr\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1