}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adeniyi-faith/getonline-studio/commits/e0f2d1a16288b8a508f34afe46a721e3d4688871/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T10:34:52Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T10:37:15Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Add \"Featured on homepage\" toggle for portfolio projects\n\nPublishing a project from /wp/admin/portfolio.php already made it show\nup on /work automatically, but there was no way to also surface it on\nthe homepage''s \"Selected Work\" section. Adding a project there still\nrequired hand-editing index.php.\n\n- Portfolio admin form gets a \"Featured on homepage\" checkbox, saved\n  as go_featured post meta and included in the data/portfolio.json\n  snapshot.\n- index.php''s Selected Work section now appends any featured projects\n  after the 4 existing hand-built cards, using the same card markup.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015hE4NmyujEMiw6nHk15wV8","tree":{"sha":"37d714b01a2fa38a7c3a9d3585fdda2baee6afd2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adeniyi-faith/getonline-studio/git/trees/37d714b01a2fa38a7c3a9d3585fdda2baee6afd2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adeniyi-faith/getonline-studio/git/commits/e0f2d1a16288b8a508f34afe46a721e3d4688871","verification":{"payload":"tree 37d714b01a2fa38a7c3a9d3585fdda2baee6afd2\nparent 86b4645a490b936f52a0412c425cdb3392634aa0\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789382092 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789382235 +0000\n\nAdd \"Featured on homepage\" toggle for portfolio projects\n\nPublishing a project from /wp/admin/portfolio.php already made it show\nup on /work automatically, but there was no way to also surface it on\nthe homepage''s \"Selected Work\" section. Adding a project there still\nrequired hand-editing index.php.\n\n- Portfolio admin form gets a \"Featured on homepage\" checkbox, saved\n  as go_featured post meta and included in the data/portfolio.json\n  snapshot.\n- index.php''s Selected Work section now appends any featured projects\n  after the 4 existing hand-built cards, using the same card markup.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015hE4NmyujEMiw6nHk15wV8\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQBK5E0ul\n1uxIzvAN+eAPXGz12yQ2vpgeRsLSAtmQQGpkfkK6hSdpTMEse+d21pdvpOhHrLY5lwNqMS//PYEY\nvAY=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-14T10:37:24Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/adeniyi-faith/getonline-studio/commit/e0f2d1a16288b8a508f34afe46a721e3d4688871","node_id":"C_kwDOSiaUgNoAKGUwZjJkMWExNjI4OGI4YTUwOGYzNG