,"gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/adeniyi-faith/getonline-studio/commit/86b4645a490b936f52a0412c425cdb3392634aa0","node_id":"C_kwDOSiaUgNoAKDg2YjQ2NDVhNDkwYjkzNmY1MmEwNDEyYzQyNWNkYjMzOTI2MzRhYTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/adeniyi-faith/getonline-studio/commit/2aea7b0bca27837dac2a943ae70944a321dcf9f7","sha":"2aea7b0bca27837dac2a943ae70944a321dcf9f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adeniyi-faith/getonline-studio/commits/2aea7b0bca27837dac2a943ae70944a321dcf9f7"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/adeniyi-faith/getonline-studio/commit/b57dafa9d3754131ca1ee7e7c4a374f6f7246804","sha":"b57dafa9d3754131ca1ee7e7c4a374f6f7246804","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adeniyi-faith/getonline-studio/commits/b57dafa9d3754131ca1ee7e7c4a374f6f7246804"}],"sha":"86b4645a490b936f52a0412c425cdb3392634aa0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adeniyi-faith/getonline-studio/commits/86b4645a490b936f52a0412c425cdb3392634aa0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adeniyi-faith/getonline-studio/commits/b57dafa9d3754131ca1ee7e7c4a374f6f7246804/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T10:13:09Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T10:13:09Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Add no-code admin for portfolio/pages, and full site nav everywhere\n\nNothing on the site could be managed without editing code: adding a\nnew case study or a new page meant hand-writing a new HTML file, and\nthere was no admin path for the marketing site at all (only the pSEO\nlocation/niche pages had one, at /wp/studio-admin.php).\n\n- New admin at /wp/admin/ (reuses the existing WordPress login and\n  \"manage_options\" gate, same as /wp/studio-admin.php):\n  - Portfolio manager: add/edit/delete case studies (client, summary,\n    cover image, tags, accent color, external link) with a flexible\n    block builder (heading/paragraph/image/quote/stats/FAQ). New\n    projects automatically appear on /work and get their own page at\n    /work/{slug} — no file ever needs to be created by hand.\n  - Site Pages manager: same block builder for simple structured\n    pages (hero + content), published at /{slug}.\n  - Navigation & Settings: edit the site''s menu items, contact email,\n    WhatsApp numbers, and social links in one place.\n- Registered the underlying ''portfolio_project'' and ''site_page''\n  custom post types via a new mu-plugin, following the same pattern\n  as the existing getonline-pseo-core.php.\n- Saving from the admin also writes a plain JSON snapshot under\n  /data/ (site-settings.json, portfolio.json, pages/*.json), so the\n  public pages read that instead of booting WordPress on every\n  request — fast and still works if WordPress has a bad moment.\n- partials/header.php now renders the full site menu (Work, Services,\n  About, Locations, Contact) on every page instead of just a \"Back\n  Home\" link, fixing the disjointed navigation — you can get anywhere\n  from anywhere now, not just back to the homepage first.\n- Cleaned up a corrupted .gitignore (it had stray shell-command text\n  and a duplicated block left over from an earlier edit) and added\n  the new mu-plugin to its allow-list so it actually gets tracked.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015hE4NmyujEMiw6nHk15wV8","tree":{"sha":"fa742ba37f4c7b8bbf66f29c5ddd4a1bcf8f79ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adeniyi-faith/getonline-studio/git/trees/fa742ba37f4c7b8bbf66f29c5ddd4a1bcf8f79ba"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adeniyi-faith/getonline-studio/git/commits/b57dafa9d3754131ca1ee7e7c4a374f6f7246804","verification":{"payload":"tree fa742ba37f4c7b8bbf66f29c5ddd4a1bcf8f79ba\nparent 3a64195134436f6b583f1d63c1c354568359f9e8\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789380789 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789380789 +0000\n\nAdd no-code admin for portfolio/pages, and full site nav everywhere\n\nNothing on the site could be managed without editing code: adding a\nnew case study or a new page meant hand-writing a new HTML file, and\nthere was no admin path for the marketing site at all (only the pSEO\nlocation/niche pages had one, at /wp/studio-admin.php).\n\n- New admin at /wp/admin/ (reuses the existing WordPress login and\n  \"manage_options\" gate, same as /wp/studio-admin.php):\n  - Portfolio manager: add/edit/delete case studies (client, summary,\n    cover image, tags, accent color, external link) with a flexible\n    block builder (heading/paragraph/image/quote/stats/FAQ). New\n    projects automatically appear on /work and get their own page at\n    /work/{slug} — no file ever needs to be created by hand.\n  - Site Pages manager: same block builder for simple structured\n    pages (hero + content), published at /{slug}.\n  - Navigation & Settings: edit the site''s menu items, contact email,\n    WhatsApp numbers, and social links in one place.\n- Registered the underlying ''portfolio_project'' and ''site_page''\n  custom post types via a new mu-plugin, following the same pattern\n  as the existing getonline-pseo-core.php.\n- Saving from the admin also writes a plain JSON snapshot under\n  /data/ (site-settings.json, portfolio.json, pages/*.json), so the\n  public pages read that instead of booting WordPress on every\n  request — fast and still works if WordPress has a bad moment.\n- partials/header.php now renders the full site menu (Work, Services,\n  About, Locations, Contact) on every page instead of just a \"Back\n  Home\" link, fixing the disjointed navigation — you can get anywhere\n  from anywhere now, not just back to the homepage first.\n- Cleaned up a corrupted .gitignore (it had stray shell-command text\n  and a duplicated block left over from an earlier edit) and added\n  the new mu-plugin to its allow-list so it actually gets tracked.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015hE4NmyujEMiw6nHk15wV8\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQAIdMGnU\nxYv2c9NOktgcWrn71lFCybchA76SRuLMsjI0KEzbDOkWwUddrwaqItDnfgtxPuyTiy+EWmHAzcs3\nrQ4=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-14T10:13:13Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"htt