email":"dgarcia@infoblox.com","name":"Daniel Garcia"},"authoredDate":"2026-05-20T00:22:41Z","committedDate":"2026-05-20T00:22:41Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"daniel-garcia","providerType":"User"},"email":"dgarcia@infoblox.com","name":"Daniel Garcia"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T23:06:17.710Z","repositoryId":1244069144,"sha":"ec5b677b20fbce5b4f5c440332cb42eb8a89d4c2"}],"observedAt":"2026-10-08T23:06:17.710Z","raw":[{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/366029?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/daniel-garcia","id":366029,"login":"daniel-garcia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjAyOQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bright-guard/bright-guard/commits/ee90963ecf18334f979fbae5edf1f5ca0c5f624c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-21T16:10:22Z","email":"dgarcia@infoblox.com","name":"Daniel Garcia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-21T16:10:22Z","email":"dgarcia@infoblox.com","name":"Daniel Garcia"},"message":"DCR: allow registration_endpoint on same registrable domain as AS metadata\n\nReal-world deployment hit: Atlassian''s remote MCP server at\nmcp.atlassian.com advertises full RFC 8414 metadata with a working\nregistration_endpoint, but the endpoint lives at cf.mcp.atlassian.com\n(their Cloudflare-fronted OAuth backend). Our defense-in-depth\nsameOrigin check rejected the cross-subdomain registration_endpoint,\nproducing dcr_unsupported and bouncing the user into manual mode\nasking for a client_id they don''t have.\n\nLoosen the host check from same-origin to same-registrable-domain\n(eTLD+1) via golang.org/x/net/publicsuffix. Extends the check to all\nthree AS endpoints (authorize, token, register) — previously only\nthe registration endpoint was validated.\n\nHosts that aren''t dotted DNS names (IP literals used by httptest,\nsingle-label hosts) fall back to exact-host equality so existing test\ncases pass without httptest-only special-casing in the code.","tree":{"sha":"7ef3fa8db23f7de6f4bb7879997ee60479d418b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bright-guard/bright-guard/git/trees/7ef3fa8db23f7de6f4bb7879997ee60479d418b8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bright-guard/bright-guard/git/commits/ee90963ecf18334f979fbae5edf1f5ca0c5f624c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/366029?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/daniel-garcia","id":366029,"login":"daniel-garcia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjAyOQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bright-guard/bright-guard/commit/ee90963ecf18334f979fbae5edf1f5ca0c5f624c","node_id":"C_kwDOSib9GNoAKGVlOTA5NjNlY2YxODMzNGY5NzlmYmFlNWVkZjFmNWNhMGM1ZjYyNGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bright-guard/bright-guard/commit/6bb029f62f4f3502020a5d4bfdee0640b710ba32","sha":"6bb029f62f4f3502020a5d4bfdee0640b710ba32","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bright-guard/bright-guard/commits/6bb029f62f4f3502020a5d4bfdee0640b710ba32"}],"sha":"ee90963ecf18334f979fbae5edf1f5ca0c5f624c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bright-guard/bright-guard/commits/ee90963ecf18334f979fbae5edf1f5ca0c5f624c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/366029?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/daniel-garcia","id":366029,"login":"daniel-garcia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjAyOQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bright-guard/bright-guard/commits/6bb029f62f4f3502020a5d4bfdee0640b710ba32/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-21T16:00:59Z","email":"dgarcia@infoblox.com","name":"Daniel Garcia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-21T16:00:59Z","email":"dgarcia@infoblox.com","name":"Daniel Garcia"},"message":"Wire Quick Start tiles to real MCP endpoints + correct transport\n\nTiles now pre-fill the actual remote MCP server URL + transport (not\njust placeholder text), and stop applying OAUTH_PRESETS general-API\nURLs (which were pointing at Atlassian/Notion''s main OAuth, not their\nMCP server''s OAuth — misleading on the manual-mode fallback path).\n\nNew tile values:\n\n  Atlassian  https://mcp.atlassian.com/v1/sse  sse\n  Notion     https://mcp.notion.com/sse        sse\n  Linear     https://mcp.linear.app/sse        sse\n  Sentry     https://mcp.sentry.dev/sse        sse\n  Custom     (blank)                            streamable-http\n\nClick a non-Custom tile → name + endpoint URL + transport + auth\nmethod (oauth2_authcode) + mode (auto/DCR) all pre-fill. Banner copy\nclarifies the MCP server''s OAuth metadata is what drives DCR, not the\nprovider''s general API. Tile grid widens to 2x3 on narrow screens.","tree":{"sha":"afc744d7023f0c55f3edd188ab805e8183103795","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bright-guard/bright-guard/git/trees/afc744d7023f0c55f3edd188ab805e8183103795"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bright-guard/bright-guard/git/commits/6bb029f62f4f3502020a5d4bfdee0640b710ba32","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/366029?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/daniel-garcia","id":366029,"login":"daniel-garcia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjAyOQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bright-guard/bright-guard/commit/6bb029f62f4f3502020a5d4bfdee0640b710ba32","node_id":"C_kwDOSib9GNoAKDZiYjAyOWY2MmY0ZjM1MDIwMjBhNWQ0YmZkZWUwNjQwYjcxMGJhMzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bright-guard/bright-guard/commit/a396a3d82a10522f0e613ce168f5bd51f2b98b17","sha":"a396a3d82a10522f0e613ce168f5bd51f2b98b17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bright-guard/bright-guard/commits/a396a3d82a10522f0e613ce168f5bd51f2b98b17"}],"sha":"6bb029f62f4f3502020a5d4bfdee0640b710ba32","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bright-guard/bright-guard/commits/6bb029f62f4f3502020a5d4bfdee0640b710ba32"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/366029?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/daniel-garcia","id":366029,"login":"daniel-garcia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjAyOQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bright-guard/bright-guard/commits/a396a3d82a10522f0e613ce168f5bd51f2b98b17/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-21T15:39:55Z","email":"dgarcia@infoblox.com","name":"Daniel Garcia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-21T15:39:55Z","email":"dgarcia@infoblox.com","name":"Daniel Garcia"},"message":"Quick Start tiles default to DCR, not manual client_id paste\n\nThe previous commit forced Quick Start tiles into oauthMode=manual,\nwhich contradicts the whole reason these tiles exist. MCP servers are\nspec-required to support Dynamic Client Registration (RFC 7591): the\nclient probes /.well-known/oauth-authorization-server and POSTs to\nthe registration_endpoint to mint its own client at install time.\nThat is how VS Code, Claude Code, and other modern MCP clients\nauthenticate — without the user ever pasting a client_id/secret.\n\nDefault Quick Start to oauthMode=auto so DCR is the happy path. The\npreset authorize/token URLs are still applied so they survive the\nauto→manual bounce when the server''s well-known metadata is missing\n(the existing 422 dcr_unsupported fallback in handleSave). Banner\ncopy now explains the DCR semantics instead of asking the user to\nhave a client_id.","tree":{"sha":"22670ddcd21d313492f2847c98235d757cc5b5e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bright-guard/bright-guard/git/trees/22670ddcd21d313492f2847c98235d757cc5b5e2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bright-guard/bright-guard/git/commits/a396a3d82a10522f0e613ce168f5bd51f2b98b17","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/366029?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/daniel-garcia","id":366029,"login":"daniel-garcia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjAyOQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bright-guard/bright-guard/commit/a396a3d82a10522f0e613ce168f5bd51f2b98b17","node_id":"C_kwDOSib9GNoAKGEzOTZhM2Q4MmExMDUyMmYwZTYxM2NlMTY4ZjViZDUxZjJiOThiMTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bright-guard/bright-guard/commit/41a88cd23fe9aca05922ed1b34827d0fb5608d4b","sha":"41a88cd23fe9aca05922ed1b34827d0fb5608d4b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bright-guard/bright-guard/commits/41a88cd23fe9aca05922ed1b34827d0fb5608d4b"}],"sha":"a396a3d82a10522f0e613ce168f5bd51f2b98b17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bright-guard/bright-guard/commits/a396a3d82a10522f0e613ce168f5bd51f2b98b17"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/366029?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/daniel-garcia","id":366029,"login":"daniel-garcia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjAyOQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bright-guard/bright-guard/commits/41a88cd23fe9aca05922ed1b34827d0fb5608d4b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-21T15:24:55Z","email":"dgarcia@infoblox.com","name":"Daniel Garcia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-21T15:24:55Z","email":"dgarcia@infoblox.com","name":"Daniel Garcia"},"message":"Surface OAuth path via Quick Start tiles on Add Connection step 1\n\nThe OAuth2 authorize-code flow has been in the wizard since Wave N+4,\nbut it lived two steps deep behind a dropdown that defaults to Bearer\ntoken. New admins connecting to Jira / Notion couldn''t find it.\n\nAdd a Quick start row at the top of step 1 with three tiles —\nAtlassian / Jira, Notion, Custom. Clicking Atlassian or Notion pre-\nfills the connection name, sets authMethod=oauth2_authcode + mode=\nmanual, applies the OAuth URLs + scopes from OAUTH_PRESETS, and shows\na brief banner reminding the user they still need a client_id +\nclient_secret on step 2. URL field placeholder also adapts to the\nchosen provider. Custom keeps the original default behaviour.","tree":{"sha":"5abce28d23673e6f261fb58509b9e68744ce69ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bright-guard/bright-guard/git/trees/5abce28d23673e6f261fb58509b9e68744ce69ed"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bright-guard/bright-guard/git/commits/41a88cd23fe9aca05922ed1b34827d0fb5608d4b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/366029?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/daniel-garcia","id":366029,"login":"daniel-garcia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjAyOQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bright-guard/bright-guard/commit/41a88cd23fe9aca05922ed1b34827d0fb5608d4b","node_id":"C_kwDOSib9GNoAKDQxYTg4Y2QyM2ZlOWFjYTA1OTIyZWQxYjM0ODI3ZDBmYjU2MDhkNGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bright-guard/bright-guard/commit/f063fba41435fb6dae0c313c0509de89d76994cf","sha":"f063fba41435fb6dae0c313c0509de89d76994cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bright-guard/bright-guard/commits/f063fba41435fb6dae0c313c0509de89d76994cf"}],"sha":"41a88cd23fe9aca05922ed1b34827d0fb5608d4b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bright-guard/bright-guard/commits/41a88cd23fe9aca05922ed1b34827d0fb5608d4b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/366029?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/daniel-garcia","id":366029,"login":"daniel-garcia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjAyOQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bright-guard/bright-guard/commits/f063fba41435fb6dae0c313c0509de89d76994cf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-21T06:05:05Z","email":"dgarcia@infoblox.com","name":"Daniel Garcia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-21T06:05:05Z","email":"dgarcia@infoblox.com","name":"Daniel Garcia"},"message":"Wave N+10: Chat polish — deep-link references + close deferred tools\n\nThree deferred Wave-N+7 tools land:\n- list_capabilities(server_id?, kind?, name_contains?, limit?): tools,\n  resources, prompts across the org''s MCP servers\n- get_policy(policy_id): policy detail plus the last 10 enforcement\n  decisions joined through mcp_invocation_decisions\n- dashboard_timeseries(metric, range): daily series passthrough so the\n  model can answer trend questions\n\nSystem prompt grows a Deep links section enumerating SPA URL patterns\n(activity, mcp-servers/:id, callers/:id, gateways/:id, policies/:id,\nthe two filtered list variants) with a worked example and a strict\n\"Never invent IDs\" guardrail. ChatPanel intercepts internal-link\nclicks via a delegated handler so navigation stays in-SPA;\nmodifier-key clicks pass through, external links get target=_blank\nrel=noopener.\n\nKnown caveats:\n- get_policy returns `enabled` rather than `mode` — there is no\n  `mode` column on policies today; the audit-vs-enforce switch is a\n  separate data-model decision.\n- Activity deep links land on /app/activity but the page does not yet\n  read filter state from URL query params; pre-filtering query params\n  are advertised in the prompt but ignored at render time. Worth a\n  small follow-up.\n\nRefs #40.","tree":{"sha":"f540728b29b249994f53844e6e5bf6dc596cdf3c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bright-guard/bright-guard/git/trees/f540728b29b249994f53844e6e5bf6dc596cdf3c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bright-guard/bright-guard/git/commits/f063fba41435fb6dae0c313c0509de89d76994cf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/366029?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/daniel-garcia","id":366029,"login":"daniel-garcia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjAyOQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bright-guard/bright-guard/commit/f063fba41435fb6dae0c313c0509de89d76994cf","node_id":"C_kwDOSib9GNoAKGYwNjNmYmE0MTQzNWZiNmRhZTBjMzEzYzA1MDlkZTg5ZDc2OTk0Y2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bright-guard/bright-guard/commit/eedc41c32d79dde73e283f739e5b371e91429a89","sha":"eedc41c32d79dde73e283f739e5b371e91429a89","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bright-guard/bright-guard/commits/eedc41c32d79dde73e283f739e5b371e91429a89"}],"sha":"f063fba41435fb6dae0c313c0509de89d76994cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bright-guard/bright-guard/commits/f063fba41435fb6dae0c313c0509de89d76994cf"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/366029?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/daniel-garcia","id":366029,"login":"daniel-garcia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjAyOQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bright-guard/bright-guard/commits/eedc41c32d79dde73e283f739e5b371e91429a89/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-21T06:01:25Z","email":"dgarcia@infoblox.com","name":"Daniel Garcia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-21T06:01:25Z","email":"dgarcia@infoblox.com","name":"Daniel Garcia"},"message":"Fix invisible text in Add Connection wizard inputs\n\nThe 15 input/textarea fields in AddConnectionWizard had bg-slate-950\n(near-black) without an explicit text color, so typed characters\ninherited the default dark color and were invisible against the dark\nbackground. Add text-slate-100 to the shared input class string.","tree":{"sha":"c3289d95e1ce913f443239c0686c245fb46aa682","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bright-guard/bright-guard/git/trees/c3289d95e1ce913f443239c0686c245fb46aa682"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bright-guard/bright-guard/git/commits/eedc41c32d79dde73e283f739e5b371e91429a89","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/366029?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/daniel-garcia","id":366029,"login":"daniel-garcia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjAyOQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bright-guard/bright-guard/commit/eedc41c32d79dde73e283f739e5b371e91429a89","node_id":"C_kwDOSib9GNoAKGVlZGM0MWMzMmQ3OWRkZTczZTI4M2Y3MzllNWIzNzFlOTE0MjlhODk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bright-guard/bright-guard/commit/3e6b7ff8a1afaf1f9e0c174539e59b36baefb718","sha":"3e6b7ff8a1afaf1f9e0c174539e59b36baefb718","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bright-guard/bright-guard/commits/3e6b7ff8a1afaf1f9e0c174539e59b36baefb718"}],"sha":"eedc41c32d79dde73e283f739e5b371e91429a89","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bright-guard/bright-guard/commits/eedc41c32d79dde73e283f739e5b371e91429a89"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/366029?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/daniel-garcia","id":366029,"login":"daniel-garcia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjAyOQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bright-guard/bright-guard/commits/3e6b7ff8a1afaf1f9e0c174539e59b36baefb718/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-21T00:12:17Z","email":"dgarcia@infoblox.com","name":"Daniel Garcia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-21T00:12:17Z","email":"dgarcia@infoblox.com","name":"Daniel Garcia"},"message":"Bake GOOGLE_CLOUD_PROJECT into deploy.sh so chat survives redeploys\n\nThe chat agent (Vertex Gemini, Wave N+7) requires GOOGLE_CLOUD_PROJECT\nat startup. Cloud Run does not auto-inject it. Setting it via gcloud\nrun services update --update-env-vars worked at the time, but every\nsubsequent deploy.sh call uses --set-env-vars which replaces the\nentire env-var map and silently drops it, leaving chat with ''GOOGLE_\nCLOUD_PROJECT unset — chat endpoint will return 503''. This bit us\nafter Wave N+9. Add the variable to the script''s primary --set-env-\nvars line so it survives every redeploy.","tree":{"sha":"4e1650b0db07d4973f24d832e7b2353e8b78da36","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bright-guard/bright-guard/git/trees/4e1650b0db07d4973f24d832e7b2353e8b78da36"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bright-guard/bright-guard/git/commits/3e6b7ff8a1afaf1f9e0c174539e59b36baefb718","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/366029?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/daniel-garcia","id":366029,"login":"daniel-garcia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjAyOQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bright-guard/bright-guard/commit/3e6b7ff8a1afaf1f9e0c174539e59b36baefb718","node_id":"C_kwDOSib9GNoAKDNlNmI3ZmY4YTFhZmFmMWY5ZTBjMTc0NTM5ZTU5YjM2YmFlZmI3MTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bright-guard/bright-guard/commit/6b88e406466f9c220e47452b3e39ba8f564b8a43","sha":"6b88e406466f9c220e47452b3e39ba8f564b8a43","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bright-guard/bright-guard/commits/6b88e406466f9c220e47452b3e39ba8f564b8a43"}],"sha":"3e6b7ff8a1afaf1f9e0c174539e59b36baefb718","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bright-guard/bright-guard/commits/3e6b7ff8a1afaf1f9e0c174539e59b36baefb718"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/366029?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/daniel-garcia","id":366029,"login":"daniel-garcia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjAyOQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bright-guard/bright-guard/commits/6b88e406466f9c220e47452b3e39ba8f564b8a43/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-20T23:59:19Z","email":"dgarcia@infoblox.com","name":"Daniel Garcia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-20T23:59:19Z","email":"dgarcia@infoblox.com","name":"Daniel Garcia"},"message":"Wave N+9: Phase 4 — UC5 simulation + UC6 asset/user + UC7 network-aware\n\nThree vision use cases shipped in one wave. Each was on Phase 4 with\nnothing started; this wave closes most of the open scope on all three.\n\nUC6 (Asset & User-Level Policy, #16) + UC7 (Network-Aware Enforcement,\n#17): migration 00018 adds workload + network columns to\nmcp_invocations; CEL env gains workload.{host,cluster,namespace,\nagent_class} and network.{subnet,vpc,zone,caller_ip} scopes,\nbyte-identical on control plane and shim; observation API accepts\noptional workload + network objects; shim emits synthetic values on\n~80% of demo invocations to exercise both present and absent paths;\naudit-mode sweep enriches the new scopes so audit policies see the\nsame env as the shim. Two new policy templates: block-prod-to-public\n(UC6+UC8 composite) and block-outside-corp-net (UC7).\n\nUC5 (Policy Simulation, #18): new policy.Simulate engine evaluates a\nCEL expression against historical mcp_invocations and aggregates would-\nblock counts plus top-10 breakdowns by server / capability / caller\nand 10 representative sample rows. POST /api/orgs/{id}/policies/\nsimulate accepts an optional comparison block to diff one expression\nagainst another. Hard-capped at 50k invocations per simulation (150ms\non a synthetic 50k fixture). Pre-mortem surfaces as a \"Simulate\" tab\nin the new-policy modal; post-mortem surfaces as a collapsible panel\non PolicyDetailPage with \"What is this blocking?\" and \"What if I\nchanged it?\" sub-modes.\n\nThe audit-mode sweep + simulation share the same enrichment loader so\nUC6/UC7 context flows through both consistently.\n\nRefs #16, #17. Closes #18.","tree":{"sha":"3fa04828e4f5bd6797ffb70b34fe56669ed5e0ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bright-guard/bright-guard/git/trees/3fa04828e4f5bd6797ffb70b34fe56669ed5e0ba"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bright-guard/bright-guard/git/commits/6b88e406466f9c220e47452b3e39ba8f564b8a43","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/366029?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/daniel-garcia","id":366029,"login":"daniel-garcia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjAyOQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bright-guard/bright-guard/commit/6b88e406466f9c220e47452b3e39ba8f564b8a43","node_id":"C_kwDOSib9GNoAKDZiODhlNDA2NDY2ZjljMjIwZTQ3NDUyYjNlMzliYThmNTY0YjhhNDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bright-guard/bright-guard/commit/ca8db7eada21c868ddd0a2abcd5524992799a029","sha":"ca8db7eada21c868ddd0a2abcd5524992799a029","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bright-guard/bright-guard/commits/ca8db7eada21c868ddd0a2abcd5524992799a029"}],"sha":"6b88e406466f9c220e47452b3e39ba8f564b8a43","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bright-guard/bright-guard/commits/6b88e406466f9c220e47452b3e39ba8f564b8a43"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/366029?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/daniel-garcia","id":366029,"login":"daniel-garcia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjAyOQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bright-guard/bright-guard/commits/ca8db7eada21c868ddd0a2abcd5524992799a029/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-20T23:36:05Z","email":"dgarcia@infoblox.com","name":"Daniel Garcia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-20T23:36:05Z","email":"dgarcia@infoblox.com","name":"Daniel Garcia"},"message":"Wave N+8: Enforcement v2 (UC8 + UC9 block) + operational polish\n\nEnforcement v2 turns detection-only Phase-3 work into real deny via the\nshim''s local CEL eval. The control-plane policy sweep stays audit-only;\nthe shim is the single deny point as before.\n\nCEL env (control plane + shim, identical):\n- server: map<string,dyn> now includes exposure_state, id, name,\n  address, transport.\n- caller: map<string,dyn> now includes signature, label, flagged_new,\n  acknowledged.\n- request: map<string,dyn> with request.now timestamp.\n\nBundle wire format gains optional servers[] and callers[] snapshots\ndelivered via the existing heartbeat response. Older shims ignore\nthe new fields. Capped at 5000 servers and 1000 callers (last 30\ndays, flagged_new + last_seen ordered) per bundle. Bundle version\nbumps via DB trigger on org_callers.acknowledged_at and on\nmcp_servers.exposure_state changes.\n\nMigration 00017_caller_acknowledged.sql adds org_callers.acknowledged_at\nplus bundle-bump triggers on org_callers and mcp_servers.\n\nTwo starter policy templates accessible from /app/policies:\n- block-public-exposure (UC8): server.exposure_state == \"public\"\n- block-unapproved-callers (UC9): caller.flagged_new && !caller.acknowledged\nBoth surface a violet \"Enforces UC8/UC9\" badge in the policy list and\ndetail views.\n\nOperational polish:\n- #36 closed properly: NoOrgEmptyState component + tenant pages now\n  early-return on null activeOrgId; platform admins land on the empty\n  state instead of being bounced to /onboarding so the \"Visit admin\n  console\" CTA is reachable.\n- Cache-Control on SPA static assets: immutable on /assets/* (hash-\n  named), no-cache on index.html, 1h on other static.\n- Metrics-rollup observability: startup, per-tick, and backfill info\n  log lines so operators can see the sweeper running.\n\nRefs #14, #15. Closes #36.","tree":{"sha":"d78580202a3bb4fab4fd21b6a0d8af392015be09","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bright-guard/bright-guard/git/trees/d78580202a3bb4fab4fd21b6a0d8af392015be09"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bright-guard/bright-guard/git/commits/ca8db7eada21c868ddd0a2abcd5524992799a029","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/366029?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/daniel-garcia","id":366029,"login":"daniel-garcia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjAyOQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bright-guard/bright-guard/commit/ca8db7eada21c868ddd0a2abcd5524992799a029","node_id":"C_kwDOSib9GNoAKGNhOGRiN2VhZGEyMWM4NjhkZGQwYTJhYmNkNTUyNDk5Mjc5OWEwMjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bright-guard/bright-guard/commit/e7da34baec3631d929d9d0f79c6e12af5baf5d5f","sha":"e7da34baec3631d929d9d0f79c6e12af5baf5d5f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bright-guard/bright-guard/commits/e7da34baec3631d929d9d0f79c6e12af5baf5d5f"}],"sha":"ca8db7eada21c868ddd0a2abcd5524992799a029","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bright-guard/bright-guard/commits/ca8db7eada21c868ddd0a2abcd5524992799a029"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/366029?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/daniel-garcia","id":366029,"login":"daniel-garcia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjAyOQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bright-guard/bright-guard/commits/e7da34baec3631d929d9d0f79c6e12af5baf5d5f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-20T22:41:16Z","email":"dgarcia@infoblox.com","name":"Daniel Garcia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-20T22:41:16Z","email":"dgarcia@infoblox.com","name":"Daniel Garcia"},"message":"Wave N+7: In-product AI chat agent over MCP/gateway/caller data (#40)\n\nAdds a read-only natural-language chat that answers questions about a\ntenant''s MCP servers, gateways, callers, activity, policies, and\nexposure state. Floating button in the bottom-right of the AppShell\nopens a slide-over panel (mirrors the HelpPanel pattern).\n\nBackend uses Vertex AI Gemini 2.5 Flash via the existing\naiplatform.googleapis.com API. No new GCP services or keys — reuses\nthe roles/aiplatform.user grant already in place. Agentic loop with\nfunctionCall/functionResponse Parts, 8-iteration cap, per-org daily\ntoken budget (default 100k tokens) enforced with 429 on overrun.\n\nTools shipped (all read-only, org-scoped via path orgID):\nlist_mcp_servers, get_mcp_server, list_gateways, list_callers,\nget_caller, query_activity, activity_aggregates, dashboard_kpis,\nexposure_summary, list_policies. Deferred for follow-up:\nlist_capabilities, get_policy, dashboard_timeseries.\n\nMigration 00016_chat.sql adds chat_sessions, chat_messages, and a\nseparate chat_daily_usage table (per-message updates vs hourly\nmetrics rollup).\n\nRefs #40.","tree":{"sha":"84355a6e39fdd57290d0903e2f3dc9e2cbf75712","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bright-guard/bright-guard/git/trees/84355a6e39fdd57290d0903e2f3dc9e2cbf75712"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bright-guard/bright-guard/git/commits/e7da34baec3631d929d9d0f79c6e12af5baf5d5f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/366029?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/daniel-garcia","id":366029,"login":"daniel-garcia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjAyOQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscr