,"html_url":"https://github.com/daniel-garcia","id":366029,"login":"daniel-garcia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjAyOQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bright-guard/bright-guard/commits/d25365dd11df9c81667355c8af6a2648858372fc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-20T16:22:23Z","email":"dgarcia@infoblox.com","name":"Daniel Garcia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-20T16:22:23Z","email":"dgarcia@infoblox.com","name":"Daniel Garcia"},"message":"Wave N+3: security headers + JSON errors + robots + CSP skin + CI\n\nP1 (#29 / #30 / #31):\n- securityHeadersMiddleware adds HSTS, CSP, X-Frame-Options,\n  Referrer-Policy, X-Content-Type-Options on every response\n- writeError helper + apiError{Code,Message} envelope; every\n  http.Error call site across api/ and auth/ converted to JSON\n- error codes deduplicated to ~17 codes (bad_request, unauthorized,\n  forbidden, not_found, conflict, expired, internal, ...)\n- cloud/web/public/robots.txt is the prod source (Vite emits it into\n  dist/, embed.FS ships it). Local-dev placeholder at\n  cloud/api/internal/spa/dist/robots.txt\n- new server_test.go + spa_test.go cover the new behavior\n\nS1 (#32 — CSP first-hour spike):\n- CSS variables for CSP palette (#101820 top bar, #1a2533 rail,\n  #f4f5f7 app bg, #0091e1 accent, yellow/green/cyan stripe)\n- Lato font via Google Fonts\n- AppShell + LoginPage restyled to mimic CSP root UI chrome\n- AdminShell keeps red branding but shares structural shape\n- Page interiors still need a Phase-2 to render light surfaces; see\n  cloud/web/docs/csp-integration.md\n\nC1 (#33):\n- .github/workflows/cloud-api.yml — build/vet/test for api+shim+seed\n- .github/workflows/cloud-web.yml — npm ci + npm run build\n- Path-filtered so they don''t fire on docs-only changes","tree":{"sha":"cc752f4d96e8944a625a4998e5cb4e8ef5df3f6d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bright-guard/bright-guard/git/trees/cc752f4d96e8944a625a4998e5cb4e8ef5df3f6d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bright-guard/bright-guard/git/commits/d25365dd11df9c81667355c8af6a2648858372fc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/366029?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/daniel-garcia","id":366029,"login":"daniel-garcia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjAyOQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bright-guard/bright-guard/commit/d25365dd11df9c81667355c8af6a2648858372fc","node_id":"C_kwDOSib9GNoAKGQyNTM2NWRkMTFkZjljODE2NjczNTVjOGFmNmEyNjQ4ODU4MzcyZmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bright-guard/bright-guard/commit/3f620638e73563c1d19f556df20386eb6c58a069","sha":"3f620638e