OST/GET/DELETE invitations, accept/decline endpoints\n- /app/settings/members page, pending-invite banner, /app/invitations/:id\n\nB1 (#28): backoffice / platform-admin console\n- migration 00012 adds platform_admins + platform_audit_log + suspended_at\n- Bootstrap admins seeded from PLATFORM_ADMIN_SEED_EMAILS\n  (defaults: daniel@danielgarcia.info, dgarcia@infoblox.com)\n- Suspended users blocked at session middleware\n- /admin/* routes with RequirePlatformAdmin guard, separate AdminShell\n- /api/platform/{overview,users,orgs,admins,audit} with full audit log\n- Confirmation-body match required for destructive ops\n\nCSP research memo (issue #32) lives at cloud/web/docs/csp-integration.md\nQA-surfaced polish issues filed as #29 (security headers), #30 (error shapes),\n#31 (robots.txt).","tree":{"sha":"ff27aab9a20c4997f3e6de0e4a5d011da3deba7d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bright-guard/bright-guard/git/trees/ff27aab9a20c4997f3e6de0e4a5d011da3deba7d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bright-guard/bright-guard/git/commits/42c8bf592b2a6abb8c8fdbd835f1e23abeb1374e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/366029?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/daniel-garcia","id":366029,"login":"daniel-garcia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjAyOQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/