,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bright-guard/bright-guard/commits/e7d0f6a8088e45707ebb17c30e906fa8c40dfc86"}],"sha":"02e6ba9f2128aa9738e22b064ca3788e0df2d825","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bright-guard/bright-guard/commits/02e6ba9f2128aa9738e22b064ca3788e0df2d825"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/366029?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/daniel-garcia","id":366029,"login":"daniel-garcia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjAyOQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bright-guard/bright-guard/commits/e7d0f6a8088e45707ebb17c30e906fa8c40dfc86/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-20T14:02:02Z","email":"dgarcia@infoblox.com","name":"Daniel Garcia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-20T14:02:02Z","email":"dgarcia@infoblox.com","name":"Daniel Garcia"},"message":"Add OAuth2 authcode + exposure detection + caller tracking\n\nThree parallel-agent worktrees landed together.\n\nO1 — OAuth2 authcode (#8): each MCP connection can use the auth code +\nrefresh flow. User pastes authorize_url, token_url, client_id, secret,\nscopes per connection (no separate provider entity). Atlassian and Notion\npresets in the wizard. PKCE round-trip, AEAD-encrypted tokens, automatic\nrefresh in OAuth2RoundTripper. Discovery scheduler skips pending_authorize\nand flips to needs_reauth on refresh failure.\n\nX1 — Exposure detection (partial #14): pure-syntax classifier in\ncloud/api/internal/exposure/ classifies mcp_servers addresses as\ninternal / cloud_internal / public / unknown / unreachable. Sweep\ngoroutine refreshes classifications every 10 min. Badges on dashboards\nand exposure-summary card on Overview.\n\nG1 — Caller tracking (partial #15): per-org distinct-caller registry\nkeyed by canonicalized-JSON signature of mcp_invocations.caller.\nSweep goroutine maintains last-seen / count / flagged_new (7d).\nNew /app/callers page with filter + detail.\n\nMigrations 00007 / 00008 / 00009 applied clean.","tree":{"sha":"7d5fb93c2fde97f6749a462ba141531880297485","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bright-guard/bright-guard/git/trees/7d5fb93c2fde97f6749a462ba141531880297485"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bright-guard/bright-guard/git/commits/e7d0f6a8088e45707ebb17c30e906fa8c40dfc86","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/366029?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/daniel-garcia","id":366029,"login":"daniel-garcia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NjAyOQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel-garcia/starred{/owner}{/re